DATA.enStory = {
"一七五四年，一个砍柴的孩子在山路上绕过一群浑身是血的人。等他跑回家，母亲、父亲和最疼爱的弟弟都倒在血泊里。\n他从那一天起只做一件事：找到那些人，然后让他们还回来。": "In 1754, a woodcutting child walked around a group of blood-soaked men on a mountain road. By the time he ran home, his mother, his father, and the brother he loved most lay in pools of blood.\nFrom that day he did only one thing: find those people, and make them pay it back.",
"「不变者为主，变化者为用。」": "\"The unchanging is the master; the changing is the use.\"",
"山路": "Mountain Road",
"山林里的叶子还是那年秋天的颜色。你走在一条回家的路上。": "The leaves in the mountain woods were still the color of that autumn. You were walking a road home.",
"你脚边的草被压过。草叶上的血还没有干——不是你的。": "The grass by your feet was pressed down. The blood on the blades had not dried. It was not yours.",
"更远处，几个人影正朝山下去。他们穿着奇装异服，浑身是血。": "Farther off, several figures were heading down the mountain. They wore strange clothes, and they were covered in blood.",
"你心里升起一个很轻的疑问：他们是从谁家里出来的？": "A very light question rose in you: whose home had they come out of?",
"然后你想起了自己的家。": "Then you remembered your own home.",
"家门是开着的。木门轴断了一半，还在轻轻地晃。": "The door of the house was open. The wooden hinge was half broken, and it was still swaying gently.",
"你跪了下来。你把他们的手一个一个握过，一只一只合上眼。": "You knelt down. You took their hands one by one, and closed their eyes one by one.",
"那天夜里你没有哭。你只是在数：一共三个。这个数字你记了一辈子。": "That night you did not cry. You only counted: three in all. You remembered that number for the rest of your life.",
"绕过去，先回家看看": "Go around them. See your home first.",
"你从坡上绕了过去。你跑得很快，快到自己都听见了风在耳朵后面喊。": "You went around by the slope. You ran fast, fast enough that you heard the wind shouting behind your ears.",
"记住他们的脸，跟一段": "Memorize their faces. Follow them a while.",
"你数了数人数，记住了走在最后那个人的步幅。多年以后你还能画出那个背影。": "You counted them, and memorized the stride of the one walking last. Years later you could still draw that back.",
"冲上去问他们为什么": "Charge them and ask why.",
"你冲了上去，被一脚踹进了泥里。你在泥里躺了很久，第一次明白恨需要力气。": "You charged. A kick put you in the mud. You lay there a long time, and understood for the first time that hate needs strength.",
"初阵": "First Battle",
"你还没学会怎么用剑。你只是把砍柴的那把刀握正了。": "You had not yet learned how to use a sword. You only held the woodcutter's blade straight.",
"你打赢了。你才发现自己一点也不激动——你只是想再找一个。": "You won. Only then did you find that you felt nothing at all. You only wanted to find one more.",
"五年与一群人": "Five Years, and a Group of People",
"你拜了师。五年里你把剑、刀、棍、枪都摸了一遍，把每一样都练到别人不愿再陪你练。": "You took a Master. In five years you handled sword, saber, staff, and spear, and trained each until no one would spar with you anymore.",
"你也遇见了别人。他们的家，也都是被人从里面打开的。": "You met others too. Their homes had also been opened from the inside.",
"有人提议：既然我们都恨同一样东西，不如给它起个名字。": "Someone proposed: since we all hate the same thing, we may as well give it a name.",
"你们在这个名字上吵了三天。最后定下来的字，只有一个。": "You argued over that name for three days. The word finally settled on was just one.",
"组织成立那天没有会台，没有掌声。只有三十几个人，把刀插在地上，算了算谁家里还剩几个活人。": "On the day the Organization was founded there was no stage and no applause. Only some thirty-odd people, driving their blades into the ground, counting how many in each family were still alive.",
"「灭」——让它死，一个不留": "\"Mie.\" Let it die. Not one left.",
"你选了最直白的那个字。很多年后组织改了名字，但你始终记得它原来叫什么。": "You chose the plainest word. Many years later the Organization changed its name, but you always remembered what it had first been called.",
"「恒」——让它再也不发生": "\"Heng.\" Let it never happen again.",
"你选了最难的那个字。难到你用了一辈子，还没做完。": "You chose the hardest word. So hard that you spent a lifetime on it and it is still not done.",
"「守」——别再有孩子跪在门口": "\"Shou.\" Let no more children kneel at a doorway.",
"你选了最不像复仇者的那个字。可你心里清楚，你就是那个跪在门口的孩子。": "You chose the word least like a revenger's. But you knew plainly: you were that child kneeling at the doorway.",
"血与火的日子": "Days of Blood and Fire",
"你们和高举邪神名号的人，从此都在水深火热之中。": "From that time on, you and the ones who raised the name of the Cult God lived alike in blood and fire.",
"你把祭坛下的孩子抱了出来。他不会说话，只是抓着你的衣领不放。": "You carried the child out from under the altar. He could not speak. He only gripped your collar and would not let go.",
"一个和李光阳有关的孩子": "A Child Concerning Li Guangyang",
"一七九七年，你二十七岁。你在四处寻找同行者的时候，遇见了一个孩子。": "In 1797 you were twenty-seven. While searching everywhere for comrades, you met a child.",
"他跪在自家屋檐下，跪了很久，久到膝盖下面的土都湿了。": "He was kneeling under the eaves of his own house. He had knelt a long time, long enough that the earth under his knees was wet.",
"你在他旁边也跪了下来。你什么都没说，因为你知道这时候说什么都没用。": "You knelt down beside him. You said nothing, because you knew that nothing said now would help.",
"你收留了他。你给他起名义子，你把他当成唯一的继承人。": "You took him in. You named him your adopted son, and treated him as your only heir.",
"你教他剑。你把你头脑里那点还没成形的东西，一点一点地拆给他看。": "You taught him the sword. The thing in your head that had not yet taken shape, you took apart and showed to him, piece by piece.",
"「不变者为主，变化者为用。记住了，先守得住，才谈得上杀。」": "\"The unchanging is the master; the changing is the use. Remember it. Only when you can hold is killing even worth speaking of.\"",
"先让他把恨说出来": "Let him speak his hate first.",
"他吼了整整一晚。你没有打断。天亮的时候他哑了，但眼睛里终于有了东西。": "He shouted the whole night. You did not interrupt. By dawn his voice was gone, but at last there was something in his eyes.",
"先教他一招，让他有事可做": "Teach him one move first, and give him something to do.",
"你递给他一根木棍。他握着木棍的那双手，止住了抖。": "You handed him a wooden stick. The hands that gripped it stopped shaking.",
"告诉他：以后我挡在你前面": "Tell him: from now on I stand in front of you.",
"你说完就觉得这句话太沉。可你还是一字一句地说完了。": "The moment you finished saying it, you felt the words were too heavy. Still, you said them out, word by word.",
"邪教·总坛": "The Cult · Headquarters",
"一七九七年。邪神亲临。总坛的血阵里，鬼火一盏一盏亮起来。": "1797. The Cult God came in person. In the blood array of the headquarters, ghost fires lit one by one.",
"血阵灭了。可你听见远处有更重的东西在走进战场。": "The blood array went out. But you heard something heavier walking into the field.",
"留下的那一击": "The Strike Left Behind",
"邪神来了。它不是人形，也不是兽形——它只是很大，大到整个天空都退开了一步。": "The Cult God came. It was not in human form, nor in beast form. It was only vast, vast enough that the whole sky stepped back.",
"你回头看了一眼正在撤离的人。李光阳在最前面，他正冲着你喊什么。": "You looked back once at the people withdrawing. Li Guangyang was at the front, shouting something at you.",
"你听不清。你也已经不想听清了。": "You could not hear it clearly. You no longer wanted to.",
"「走。我挡着。」": "\"Go. I hold them.\"",
"你一个人迎了上去。你把这一生练过的东西，全部收进了一剑里。": "You went up alone to meet it. Everything you had trained in your life, you gathered into a single blade.",
"那一剑没有砍出去。邪神的手先到了——它没有杀你，它只是把你的生命之力抽干了。": "That strike never went out. The Cult God's hand arrived first. It did not kill you. It only drained your life force dry.",
"四十八岁。你最后变成了一具人干，站在战场上没有倒下去。": "Forty-eight years old. In the end you became a dried husk, standing on the field, not falling.",
"李光阳把你抱下来的时候，你手里还攥着那半截没收完的剑势。": "When Li Guangyang took you down, your hand still gripped the half-gathered force of that unfinished strike.",
"——你留下的东西，后来被叫做「恒之剑技雏形」。": "What you left behind was later called the rudiment of the Heng Sword Arts.",
"五年": "Five Years",
"你拜了师。五年里你把剑、刀、棍、枪都摸了一遍，摸到师父不愿再陪你练。": "You took a Master. In five years you handled sword, saber, staff, and spear, until the Master would no longer spar with you.",
"有人比你大十岁，有人比你小两岁。他们身上都有一处地方，你一看就知道是怎么来的。": "Some were ten years older than you, some two years younger. Each had one place on his body, and you knew at a glance how it had come.",
"第五年冬天，有人提议：既然我们恨的是同一样东西——": "In the winter of the fifth year, someone proposed: since we hate the same thing—",
"不如给它起个名字。": "we may as well give it a name.",
"组织成立那天没有会台，没有掌声，只有一群把刀插在地上的人。": "On the day the Organization was founded there was no stage, no applause. Only a group of people driving their blades into the ground.",
"他们做的第一件事，不是立誓，是算账——算每个人家里还剩几个活的。": "The first thing they did was not swear an oath, but settle accounts: counting how many in each family were still alive.",
"算完之后，谁都没有再说话。": "When the counting was done, no one spoke again.",
"名字要能让人听懂": "The name must be understood.",
"你把话说得很直：一个名字要是还得解释，那就不必起。你们最后只留了一个字。": "You said it plainly: if a name needs explaining, it need not be given. In the end you kept only one word.",
"名字要能撑得久": "The name must last.",
"你提出来的那个字不好听，也不痛快。但你说：痛快的名字活不过一代人。": "The word you proposed was not pleasant to hear, nor satisfying. But you said: a satisfying name does not outlive one generation.",
"名字要让以后的孩子不必用": "The name must be one that later children never need.",
"你在桌上写了一个字，又用手盖住。你说：等它用不上的那天，我们才算赢。": "You wrote a word on the table, then covered it with your hand. You said: on the day it is no longer needed, only then have we won.",
"二十七岁的泥地": "Mud at Twenty-Seven",
"你二十七岁那年，在四处寻找同行者。": "The year you were twenty-seven, you were searching everywhere for comrades.",
"有人给你指了个方向，说那边有个孩子，跪了三天没起来。": "Someone pointed you a direction, and said there was a child over there who had knelt three days without rising.",
"你走过去，在他旁边也跪了下来。你什么都没说——你知道这时候说什么都没用。": "You walked over and knelt down beside him. You said nothing. You knew that nothing said now would help.",
"你收留了他，认他做义子，把他当成唯一的继承人。": "You took him in, made him your adopted son, and treated him as your only heir.",
"「你叫什么。」": "\"What is your name.\"",
"「李光阳。」": "\"Li Guangyang.\"",
"「光阳。记住你家里那三个人的样子。记不住的时候来找我，我替你记着。」": "\"Guangyang. Remember the faces of the three in your family. When you cannot, come to me. I will remember them for you.\"",
"你没有告诉他，你家里也是三个。": "You did not tell him that your family had been three as well.",
"让他先把恨说出来": "Let him speak his hate first.",
"他吼了整整一晚。你没有打断。天亮时他哑了，可眼睛里终于有了东西。": "He shouted the whole night. You did not interrupt. By dawn his voice was gone, but at last there was something in his eyes.",
"先递给他一件有事可做的事": "Hand him something to do first.",
"说完你就觉得这句话太沉。可你还是一字一句地说完了——你说过的话，你后来也做到了。": "The moment you finished saying it, you felt the words were too heavy. Still you said them out, word by word. What you said, you later did.",
"一个方向": "One Direction",
"你带着他出了第一次任务。你还不想让他上手，只让他在你身后看着。执事把刀举起来的时候，你往旁边站了半步——把那条线，一个人堵上了。": "You took him on his first mission. You did not yet want him to take part; you only let him watch from behind you. When the steward raised his blade, you shifted half a step aside, and blocked that line alone.",
"你把执事按在祭坛边。孩子在你背后探出头，第一次看见一个人是怎么倒下的。回去的路上他说：师父，刚才那一剑我看懂了。你说：那明天你练给我看。": "You pinned the steward against the altar. The child poked his head out from behind you, and saw for the first time how a man falls. On the way back he said: Master, I understood that strike. You said: then tomorrow, show me you can train it.",
"第一间屋子": "The First House",
"组织成立后的第三天，他们决定先盖一间屋子。": "Three days after the Organization was founded, they decided to build a house first.",
"选的地方是一片背风的坡，地上还有去年没烧完的炭。": "The place chosen was a slope sheltered from the wind; on the ground there was still charcoal from last year, not yet burnt out.",
"三十几个人，会的各有不同。会砍树的去砍树，不会砍树的去搬石头。": "Some thirty-odd people, each with different skills. Those who could cut trees cut trees; those who could not carried stones.",
"有一个人从头到尾只会扶着柱子，扶了两天。": "One man could only hold a post upright, from beginning to end. He held it for two days.",
"第三天下雨，屋顶漏。所有人挤到墙角，谁也没说话。": "On the third day it rained and the roof leaked. Everyone crowded into the corner, and no one spoke.",
"「漏就漏。明天补。」": "\"It leaks. We patch it tomorrow.\"",
"第二天补完，还是漏；第三天再补，不漏了。": "They patched it the next day; it still leaked. They patched it again the third day; it stopped.",
"屋子盖好的那天没有人庆祝。": "On the day the house was finished, no one celebrated.",
"他们只是把刀从地上拔起来，一把一把插进了墙根。": "They only pulled their blades up from the ground, and drove them one by one into the base of the wall.",
"一共三十七把。": "Thirty-seven in all.",
"先把墙垒起来，屋顶最后再说": "Build the walls first; the roof last.",
"墙垒得比谁都厚。后来这面墙挡过风、挡过雨，也挡过很多次争吵。": "The wall was built thicker than anyone's. Later that wall held off wind, held off rain, and held off many arguments.",
"先搭灶，先让人吃上热的": "Build the stove first; let people eat something hot.",
"灶是最早立起来的东西。此后所有的事都在这个灶边上商量，包括那件最要紧的事。": "The stove was the first thing raised. After that everything was discussed beside that stove, including the most important matter of all.",
"先把每一根木料编号": "Number every piece of timber first.",
"编号是拿刀刻在木头上的。第二年拆房子的时候，一根都没配错——那是这个组织第一次有条理。": "The numbers were cut into the wood with blades. When the house was taken apart the next year, not one piece was mismatched. That was the first time this Organization had order.",
"名册": "The Roster",
"组织有一本册子，用来记名字。": "The Organization had a ledger, for recording names.",
"记名字的活落在一个不太会写字的人身上。他写得慢，一个字要写三遍才认得出来。": "The job of recording names fell to a man who could not write well. He wrote slowly; one word took three tries before it was readable.",
"有人提议换个人。恒没同意，说：写慢一点，能多记一会儿。": "Someone proposed replacing him. Heng did not agree. He said: write slower, and we remember them a while longer.",
"册子第一页是成立那天的那三十七个；第二页开始，是陆续进来的人。": "The first page of the ledger was the thirty-seven from the day of founding. From the second page on, they were the ones who came in one after another.",
"一七九七年冬天，册子上多了一行。写的人问：这一行写谁家的孩子？": "In the winter of 1797, one more line appeared in the ledger. The one writing asked: whose child is this line for?",
"「写他自己的名字。」": "\"Write his own name.\"",
"写完，那个人把笔放下，去分饭。锅里的份不够，他把自己那份拨了一半出去。": "When it was written, the man put down the brush and went to divide the food. There was not enough in the pot. He moved half of his own portion out.",
"在场的人谁都没有提这件事。": "No one present mentioned it.",
"那间屋子里，笔和刀放在同一张桌上。": "In that house, the brush and the blade lay on the same table.",
"用坏了的笔比用坏的刀多。": "More brushes were worn out than blades.",
"在旁边补一行小字：家里三口，都没了": "Add a small line beside it: three in the family, all gone.",
"那一行字很小，挤在名字右边。后来翻册子的人都要停一下才看得清。": "That line was very small, squeezed to the right of the name. Later, whoever turned the ledger had to pause before it could be read.",
"先教他自己写自己的名字": "Teach him to write his own name first.",
"他学了很久，写得歪。恒说：歪也行，只要是你自己写上去的。": "He studied a long time, and wrote it crooked. Heng said: crooked is fine, as long as you wrote it yourself.",
"把册子交给他，让他记以后的人": "Give him the ledger; let him record those who come later.",
"那本册子后来记了很多人。字一直不好看，但没有漏过一个名字。": "That ledger later recorded many people. The writing was never good, but not one name was missed.",
"1754年，年幼的恒在山林里遇见一群浑身是血的人。等他跑回家，母亲、父亲和最疼爱的弟弟都倒在血泊里。后来他拜师五年，聚起一群同样被邪教毁掉家的人，建了一个组织，名叫[灭]。27岁那年他收留了李光阳。48岁那年，邪神亲至，他独自留下掩护撤离，被夺走生命之力，变成人干。他留下的不是职位，是雏形。": "In 1754, the young Heng met a group of blood-soaked men in the mountain woods. By the time he ran home, his mother, his father, and the brother he loved most lay in pools of blood. He then took a Master for five years, gathered a group of people whose homes the Cult had likewise destroyed, and built an Organization named [Mie]. At twenty-seven he took in Li Guangyang. At forty-eight the Cult God came in person; he stayed behind alone to cover the withdrawal, had his life force taken from him, and became a dried husk. What he left behind was not a post. It was a rudiment.",
"1749 — 1797 · 崩于48岁": "1749 — 1797 · Fell at forty-eight",
"创始人之一。组织最早的形态名为[灭]。": "One of the founders. The Organization's earliest form was named [Mie].",
"以「不变者为主，变化者为用」立下恒之剑技雏形——这是后来一千万种剑法的源头。": "With \"The unchanging is the master; the changing is the use,\" he set down the rudiment of the Heng Sword Arts — the source of the ten million sword arts that followed.",
"与组织创立同期，原文未写受位仪式": "Contemporary with the founding of the Organization. The source text gives no rite of investiture.",
"降神·恒": "Descent · Heng",
"一道斩柴人的背影站到你身前。他生前没挡住的那一击，这一剑替他挡住。": "The back of a woodcutter stands before you. The strike he did not block in life, this strike blocks for him.",
"分部堆了一批没人愿意接的活。你先去把最外围那几个据点清一遍——不需要打得多漂亮，只要清干净。": "The branch has piled up a batch of jobs no one would take. Go clear the outermost outposts first. It does not need to be fought well. It only needs to be clean.",
"他是首任恒永者唯一的继承人。他的师父死在邪神手里，而他站在撤离队伍的最前面，什么都做不了。\n从那天起，他把「恨」练成了一件可以交给别人的东西。": "He was the only heir of the first Eternal. His Master died at the hands of the Cult God, and he stood at the very front of the evacuation line, able to do nothing.\nFrom that day on, he forged hate into something he could hand to others.",
"「恨也可以是一种纪律。」": "\"Hate can also be a discipline.\"",
"跪着的人": "The Man on His Knees",
"首任恒永者走了。组织没有会台，没有掌声，只有一个空出来的位置和一群不知道该往哪看的人。": "The first Eternal was gone. The Organization had no stage and no applause. Only a vacant seat and a crowd that did not know where to look.",
"李光阳在一间空屋子里坐了一整夜。天亮的时候他走了出来。": "Li Guangyang sat in an empty room all night. At dawn he walked out.",
"「师父说过，撑不住的时候，就先做一件小事。」": "\"Master said, when you cannot hold on, do one small thing first.\"",
"他重新把所有人叫到了一起。他没有说大道理，只说了两句。": "He called everyone together again. He gave no grand speech. He said two things.",
"「我师父挡的那一下，是替我们挡的。所以我们现在活着。」": "\"The blow my Master took, he took for us. That is why we are alive.\"",
"「活着的人，得把这件事做完。」": "\"The living have to finish it.\"",
"陪他把师父的剑收进鞘里": "Help him sheathe his Master's sword",
"剑入鞘的那一声很轻。他却像被那一声打醒了一样，站直了。": "The sword went into the sheath with a faint sound. It was as if that sound woke him. He stood straight.",
"问他打算怎么报仇": "Ask him how he plans to take revenge",
"他说：「先练。练到我不需要报仇也能赢。」": "He said, \"First I train. Until I can win without needing revenge.\"",
"把撤离名单念给他听": "Read the evacuation list to him",
"他念了一遍又一遍，念到最后把每一个名字都背了下来。": "He read it over and over, until he had every name by heart.",
"十四个邪教团": "Fourteen Cult Bands",
"他一个人捣毁了一整个中小型邪教。从那以后，他把目标从「一个」改成了「十四个」。": "Alone, he destroyed an entire mid-sized cult. After that he changed his target from \"one\" to \"fourteen.\"",
"第十四个团倒下的时候，他蹲下来数了数自己身上的伤，数到一半就不数了。": "When the fourteenth band fell, he crouched down and counted the wounds on his body. Halfway through he stopped counting.",
"九年": "Nine Years",
"他觉得自己还不够。他想要那些人也尝一遍他家人尝过的东西。": "He did not think he was enough yet. He wanted those people to taste what his family had tasted.",
"于是他给自己排了一套训练——他后来说，那是他出生以来最难的一套。": "So he drew up a training regimen for himself. He later said it was the hardest one of his life.",
"这套训练花了九年。第九年结束的时候，他二十七岁。": "The training took nine years. When the ninth year ended, he was twenty-seven.",
"也是在那些年里，他创出了属于自己的剑法。它不华丽，也不快。": "In those same years he created a sword style of his own. It was not ornate. It was not fast.",
"它只有一个特点：无论对方怎么变，它都不会乱。": "It had one trait: no matter how the opponent changed, it never lost its order.",
"把难度再往上调一档": "Raise the difficulty another notch",
"他把每天的时间又压掉了一个时辰。压掉的那部分，他用来练剑势的收尾。": "He cut another two hours out of each day. What he cut, he spent on the closing of his sword forms.",
"把训练也教给其他人": "Teach the training to the others too",
"他明白了：一个人再强，也只能守住一条战线。": "He understood: however strong one man is, he can hold only one front.",
"给自己留一点时间睡觉": "Leave himself some time to sleep",
"他终于承认自己也是肉身。承认之后，他反而撑得更久了。": "He finally admitted he was only flesh. After admitting it, he lasted longer than before.",
"邪神之子": "Son of the Cult God",
"邪教把他们的神子推到了台前。那东西还带着奶腥味，手上却已经有几十条人命。": "The Cult pushed its divine child to the front. The thing still smelled of milk, and already had dozens of lives on its hands.",
"他没有多看那东西一眼。他只是把它归了档——像归档一件必须处理的麻烦。": "He did not spare the thing a second look. He only filed it away, like a nuisance that had to be dealt with.",
"传承与病": "Inheritance and Illness",
"他二十八岁结婚，二十九岁有了儿子李炎阳。": "He married at twenty-eight. At twenty-nine he had a son, Li Yanyang.",
"三十八岁那年，他开始教儿子剑法。这一教就是八年。": "At thirty-eight he began teaching his son the sword. He taught for eight years.",
"四十六岁，他第一次带着儿子上前线。他要让儿子亲眼看看，邪教到底是什么东西。": "At forty-six he took his son to the front for the first time. He wanted his son to see with his own eyes what the Cult really was.",
"五十六岁，他得了重病。治不好。": "At fifty-six he fell gravely ill. It could not be cured.",
"「炎阳。你在暗处收徒弟。收进来的人，一个都不许丢。」": "\"Yanyang. Take disciples in the dark. Of those you take in, not one may be lost.\"",
"他把最信任的成员叫来，任命为新的首领。恒永者这个位置，他让它空着了。": "He summoned the member he trusted most and named him the new Leader. The seat of the Eternal, he left empty.",
"五十七岁，他离世。空着的位置一直空到他儿子那一支的徒弟长大。": "At fifty-seven he died. The empty seat stayed empty until the disciple of his son's line grew up.",
"——那一支，后来传到了李耀辉。": "— That line passed, in time, to Li Yaohui.",
"只有一个人": "Only One Man",
"每清完一个据点，他都会坐下来清点一次：邪教在变多，他的同伴在变少。": "After clearing each outpost he would sit down and take stock: the Cult was growing, his comrades were fewer.",
"三十四岁那年他不再等人。他开始一个人去。": "At thirty-four he stopped waiting for anyone. He began going alone.",
"有人劝他，说一个人能挡的方向太窄。他没有反驳，只问了一句。": "Someone warned him that one man could cover too narrow a direction. He did not argue. He asked one question.",
"「地图上，哪个方向只有一个恒永者？」": "\"On the map, which direction has only one Eternal?\"",
"没人答得上来。他说：那南边以后我自己去。": "No one could answer. He said: then the south is mine from now on.",
"那天晚上他把师父的剑从鞘里抽出来看了一眼，又收回去。": "That night he drew his Master's sword from its sheath and looked at it once. Then he put it back.",
"「师父，你挡了一次。我替你把剩下的都挡完。」": "\"Master, you took one blow. I will take all the rest for you.\"",
"把训练的时间再挤一个时辰": "Squeeze another two hours out of training",
"他把自己又拆了一遍。拆下来的那部分，他拿去练剑势的收尾——师父死在没收完的那一剑上。": "He took himself apart again. What he took apart he spent on the closing of his sword forms. His Master had died on a strike he never finished.",
"把胆子分给身边的人": "Give some of his nerve to those around him",
"他开始教别人。他明白了一个人再强也只能守住一条线；一条线守不住，家就还会被人从里面打开。": "He began teaching others. He understood that however strong one man is, he can hold only one line; and if a line cannot be held, a home will still be opened from within.",
"先学会活着回来": "First learn to come back alive",
"他给自己定了一条规矩：每次出门，必须自己走回来。规矩很土，但他守了一辈子。": "He set himself one rule: every time he went out, he had to walk back on his own. The rule was crude. He kept it all his life.",
"一个人清一间": "One Man Clears One Hall",
"主祭在殿里等他，身后站着几十个人。它说：一个人来，是瞧不起我们。他说：不是。是我不想让别人看见你们这个样子。": "The high priest waited for him in the hall, dozens standing behind it. It said, \"Coming alone is contempt for us.\" He said, \"No. It is that I do not want others to see you like this.\"",
"他走出来的时候，身后的殿已经不需要再点灯了。属下问：要报给首领吗？他说：不用。然后他坐到台阶上，把药拿出来，一颗一颗地数。": "When he walked out, the hall behind him no longer needed lamps. A subordinate asked: report to the Leader? He said: no need. Then he sat down on the steps, took out his medicine, and counted the pills one by one.",
"空着的位置": "The Empty Seat",
"三十八岁，儿子李炎阳八岁。他决定开始教他，一教就是八年。": "Thirty-eight. His son Li Yanyang was eight. He decided to begin teaching him. He taught for eight years.",
"四十六岁，他第一次带儿子上战线。他让儿子走在前面——他要让儿子亲眼看见，邪教到底是什么东西。": "Forty-six. He took his son to the front for the first time. He made his son walk in front. He wanted his son to see with his own eyes what the Cult really was.",
"那天他把儿子叫到床前，只交代一件事。": "That day he called his son to his bedside and gave him one instruction.",
"「你在暗处收徒弟。收进来的人，一个都不许丢。」": "\"Take disciples in the dark. Of those you take in, not one may be lost.\"",
"然后他把最信任的成员叫来，让他做新的首领。": "Then he summoned the member he trusted most and made him the new Leader.",
"有人问：恒永者这个位置，谁来坐？": "Someone asked: who will sit in the seat of the Eternal?",
"五十七岁，他离世。": "Fifty-seven. He died.",
"那把师父留下的剑，他让人挂在了空位置的正对面。": "The sword his Master had left, he had hung directly facing the empty seat.",
"空着的位置一直空着，空到他儿子那一支的徒弟长大。——那一支，后来传到了李耀辉。": "The empty seat stayed empty until the disciple of his son's line grew up. That line passed, in time, to Li Yaohui.",
"「让它空着。」": "\"Leave it empty.\"",
"他说：这个位子空着，组织才知道自己还没到可以歇的时候。位子一满，人心就散了。": "He said: with this seat empty, the Organization knows it is not yet time to rest. Once a seat is filled, hearts scatter.",
"「让炎阳那一支去接。」": "\"Let Yanyang's line take it.\"",
"他摇头：不是现在。传位不是把剑递过去，是把命递过去。他还太小。": "He shook his head: not now. Passing the seat is not handing over a sword. It is handing over a life. He is still too young.",
"「先记在册上，别立人。」": "\"Write it in the ledger. Name no one.\"",
"他让人在册上写下一行字：恒永者之位，空缺。落款处，他自己按了一个指印。": "He had a line written in the ledger: seat of the Eternal, vacant. At the signature line he pressed his own thumbprint.",
"值夜表": "The Night Watch Roster",
"重建那几年，组织照常运转：排班、值夜、清点、修墙。": "In the years of rebuilding, the Organization ran as usual: shifts, night watch, inventory, wall repairs.",
"值夜表挂在门口，一格一格，写满了名字。": "The night watch roster hung by the door, box after box, filled with names.",
"最上面那一格原来写着恒永者。李光阳走之后，那一格空了下来。": "The top box had read Eternal. After Li Guangyang was gone, that box was left empty.",
"有人问要不要划掉。新的首领说：留着。": "Someone asked whether to cross it out. The new Leader said: keep it.",
"于是每天换班的时候，值夜的人还是会往那一格上看一眼。": "So at every shift change the night watch still glanced at that box.",
"那一格一直空着，空了二十几年，格子里落了灰，也没人去擦。": "The box stayed empty for more than twenty years. Dust settled in it. No one wiped it.",
"后来有新来的年轻人问那格是谁的。老队员说：一个还没回来的人。": "Later a new young man asked whose box it was. An old member said: someone who has not come back yet.",
"老队员自己也知道这话不对。可他就是这么说的。": "The old member knew himself that this was wrong. He said it anyway.",
"值夜的规矩一直没改：写名字，换班，天亮交表。": "The rule of the night watch never changed: write the names, change the shift, hand over the roster at dawn.",
"表上从来没有缺过人，也没有缺过那一格。": "The roster never lacked a man. It never lacked that box either.",
"把那一格改成两个人守": "Make that box two men",
"他在那一格底下加了一行小字：两人。理由是——一个人守的位置，最容易空。": "Beneath that box he added a small line: two men. The reason: a post held by one man is the easiest to leave empty.",
"每晚轮一个新人去补那一格": "Rotate a new man into that box each night",
"新人补了三夜就有人不肯了。不肯的理由很实在：站那儿的时候，总觉得旁边还站着个人。": "After three nights the new men refused. The reason was plain: standing there, you always felt someone standing beside you.",
"把那一格空着，谁都不补": "Leave the box empty. No one fills it.",
"那一格就这么空着。夜里巡过门口的人都说：看见那个空格，就不太敢偷懒。": "The box stayed empty. Those who passed the door on night rounds all said: seeing that empty square, you do not dare slack off.",
"八岁的木棍": "The Wooden Stick at Eight",
"三十八岁那年，李光阳开始教儿子。李炎阳八岁。": "At thirty-eight Li Guangyang began teaching his son. Li Yanyang was eight.",
"他没有先给剑，先给了一根木棍，是他自己削的，削了半夜。": "He did not give him a sword first. He gave him a wooden stick he had whittled himself, half the night through.",
"第一天只教一个动作：手腕转，肩不动。": "The first day he taught one motion only: turn the wrist, keep the shoulder still.",
"练了两百次。第二天还是这个动作。": "Two hundred repetitions. The next day, the same motion.",
"练到第十天，孩子的手心磨破了。他看了一眼，说：包上，接着练。": "By the tenth day the boy's palm was worn raw. He looked at it and said: wrap it. Keep training.",
"夜里有人路过，看见他坐在灯下，把那根木棍又削细了一圈。": "At night someone passed by and saw him sitting under the lamp, shaving the stick a little thinner.",
"「握着不硌手，才练得下去。」": "\"If it does not bite the hand, he can keep at it.\"",
"这套训练一共八年。八年里他没有夸过一次。": "The training lasted eight years. In eight years he never praised him once.",
"那根木棍后来一直放在训练场的墙角。": "The stick stayed in the corner of the training yard.",
"没有人扔。也没有人问那是谁的。": "No one threw it away. No one asked whose it was.",
"把每天的练习写在册子上": "Write each day's practice in the ledger",
"册子上一天一行，八年没有断过。最后一页只有两个字：够了。": "One line a day in the ledger, unbroken for eight years. The last page held two words: enough.",
"练完再教他收势": "After practice, teach him the closing form",
"他教的第一件事其实不是打，是收。他说：收不住的东西，不能交出去。": "The first thing he taught was not striking but closing. He said: what cannot be held back cannot be handed on.",
"让他自己去挑一根棍子": "Let him pick his own stick",
"孩子在山坡上挑了三天，挑回来一根最歪的。他没有换掉，只说：用久了就直了。": "The boy searched the hillside for three days and brought back the crookedest one. He did not replace it. He said only: use it long enough and it straightens.",
"他贪玩跑进深山，回家时家人已经全死了。首任恒永者把他带走，一天一天地安慰他，直到他燃起斗志。14岁起他随师父捣毁十四个邪教团，27岁那年亲眼看着师父被邪神杀死，无能为力。他接下了恒永者的位置，也在56岁病重时把传承交给了儿子。他教会组织的是「恨也可以是一种纪律」。": "He ran off into the deep mountains to play. When he came home his family was already dead. The first Eternal took him away and comforted him day after day, until his will caught fire. From fourteen he followed his Master in destroying fourteen cult bands. At twenty-seven he watched the Cult God kill his Master and could do nothing. He took up the seat of the Eternal, and at fifty-six, gravely ill, he passed the inheritance to his son. What he taught the Organization was this: \"hate can also be a discipline.\"",
"「他们尝到的痛苦，得有人还回去。」": "\"The pain they tasted, someone has to give it back.\"",
"1770 — 1827 · 享年57岁": "1770 — 1827 · died at 57",
"首任恒永者的义子与唯一继承人，恒永者一脉的真正传人。": "Adopted son and only heir of the first Eternal, the true inheritor of the Eternal line.",
"创出自己的剑法，并以「李炎阳」一支把恒之剑技传了下去——那是李耀辉的祖先。": "He created a sword style of his own and passed the Heng Sword Arts down through the \"Li Yanyang\" line. They were the ancestors of Li Yaohui.",
"27 岁：在师父战死的那一天接任": "Age 27: took office on the day his Master fell in battle",
"降神·李光阳": "Descent · Li Guangyang",
"一个从尸堆里跪起来的人，把「恨」这种东西变成了一剑。": "A man who rose to his knees from a heap of corpses, who turned a thing like hate into a single sword strike.",
"「新人都想赢。老人都想活。」——把你自己的血补满一次，再来找我。": "\"The new want to win. The old want to live.\" Fill your own blood once, then come find me.",
"哥哥姐姐替他死光的那一年，他七岁。拿起剑的第一件事，他把他们的名字刻在了剑鞘内侧。\n九岁李耀阳为他而死，他用拳屠了一座邪教。此后他放弃了所有的感情，把它们全留给了孩子。": "The year his brothers and sisters died in his place, he was seven. The first thing he did with a sword was carve their names inside the scabbard.\nAt nine, Li Yaoyang died for him, and he wiped out a Cult stronghold with his fists. After that he gave up all his feelings and left all of them to the children.",
"「它输了。」": "It lost.",
"七岁：血里的第二个人": "Seven: The Second Person in the Blood",
"埋伏是他们早就布置好的。带他出任务的那几位哥哥姐姐，是最宠他的几位。": "The ambush had been set long in advance. The brothers and sisters who took him out on the mission were the ones who doted on him most.",
"他们把他压在身下，血顺着他自己的脸往下淌。": "They pressed him under their bodies. Blood ran down his own face.",
"邪教的人把刀举了起来。他没有闭眼。": "The Cult members raised their blades. He did not close his eyes.",
"就在那一瞬间，他身体里另一个人醒了。": "In that instant, another person inside him woke.",
"他在组织里醒来，想起了那几位哥哥姐姐。他很痛苦，却无能为力。": "He woke in the Organization and remembered those brothers and sisters. He was in pain, and there was nothing he could do.",
"每一天，思晓雅都会来，争取每一天都待在他身边。": "Every day Si Xiaoya came. She fought to spend every day at his side.",
"她不劝他别难过。她只是坐在旁边，把自己抄的书一页一页念给他听。": "She did not tell him not to grieve. She only sat beside him and read the book she had copied out, page by page, aloud to him.",
"念到他不哭了为止。第二天再来。": "She read until he stopped crying. The next day she came again.",
"让他自己来（第二人格接管）": "Let him come out himself (the second personality takes over)",
"三分钟。四周所有邪教成员都被杀光。战后清点战场的人发现：没有一具尸体是完整的，而他手上连一道划伤都没有。": "Three minutes. Every Cult member around them was killed. When the battlefield was counted afterwards, they found that not one corpse was whole, and that there was not a single scratch on his hands.",
"压住他，自己撑到支援": "Hold him down and last until support arrives",
"你死死按住那具发抖的身体。三分钟后支援到了——你活了下来，但那一夜的惨叫，你听了很多年。": "You pinned the trembling body down with all your strength. Three minutes later support arrived. You lived, but you heard the screaming of that night for many years.",
"三分钟": "Three Minutes",
"「你不该醒的。」——血泊里那个用着他的身体、他的招式、他的杀意的东西，转过了头。": "\"You should not have woken.\" In the pool of blood, the thing using his body, his moves, his killing intent, turned its head.",
"三分钟到了。它把身体还给了他，像一件用旧的衣服。他没说谢谢。": "The three minutes were up. It returned the body to him like a worn-out coat. He did not say thank you.",
"你倒在了血里。可三分钟还没到——它把你的身体接了过去，替你杀完了剩下的人。": "You fell into the blood. But the three minutes were not up. It took your body over and finished killing the rest for you.",
"八岁：一个放弃感情的决定": "Eight: A Decision to Give Up Feeling",
"八岁那年，第7任和第8任恒之剑法雏形的传人找到了他，收他为徒。": "At eight, the seventh and eighth inheritors of the Heng Sword Arts prototype found him and took him as a disciple.",
"他成为了第9任恒之剑法雏形的传人。": "He became the ninth inheritor of the Heng Sword Arts prototype.",
"他只用了四个月就出师了。两位师父都以为他会先哭一场再拿起剑。": "He finished his training in only four months. Both Masters thought he would cry first and then pick up the sword.",
"他没有。他拿起剑的第一件事——": "He did not. The first thing he did after picking up the sword—",
"把哥哥姐姐的名字刻在剑鞘内侧": "Carve the names of his brothers and sisters inside the scabbard",
"他一笔一笔地刻。刻完之后，他把剑收进鞘里，从此这把剑再没换过鞘。": "He carved, stroke by stroke. When he was done he put the sword back in the scabbard, and from then on that sword never changed scabbards.",
"先练四个月里最难的那一招": "Practise the hardest move of the four months first",
"他选了最难的那一招，练到师父都不忍心看。他只用四个月就出师了。": "He chose the hardest move and practised it until his Master could not bear to watch. He finished his training in only four months.",
"去把思晓雅念的书借来": "Go and borrow the book Si Xiaoya reads aloud",
"他借了那本书。他不会读得比她慢——他只是不想让她念得太久。": "He borrowed the book. He would not read it slower than she did. He only did not want her reading for so long.",
"九岁：没有用剑的那一次": "Nine: The Time He Did Not Use a Sword",
"李耀阳为了保护他死了。这一年他再次爆发，但这一次是他自己控制着身体。\n他全程只用拳。": "Li Yaoyang died protecting him. That year he broke out again, but this time he controlled the body himself.\nHe used only his fists from beginning to end.",
"他一路打过去，没有一间屋子的墙是完好的，也没有一个敌人是被砍死的。": "He fought his way through. Not one wall of any room was left intact, and not one enemy was killed by a blade.",
"你被人拖了出来。带队的成员在报告里写：「他不是来杀人的，他是来问一个问题的。问完之后，就没有人回答了。」": "You were dragged out. The member leading the squad wrote in the report, \"He did not come to kill. He came to ask a question. After he asked it, no one answered.\"",
"633680天": "633,680 Days",
"这件事以后，他放弃了所有的感情。": "After this, he gave up all his feelings.",
"他决定进入一个地方：现实世界一天，里世界五年。里面除了寿命，一切都可以继续增长；什么伤都会瞬间恢复。": "He decided to enter a place where one day in the real world is five years inside. Everything there can keep growing except lifespan, and any wound heals in an instant.",
"缺点是十年之内只能进一次，而且一次只能进一个人。": "The drawback was that it could be entered only once in ten years, and only one person at a time.",
"他在里面待了六十三万三千六百八十天。": "He stayed inside for six hundred thirty-three thousand six hundred eighty days.",
"受着：一天一千次自残": "Endure: a thousand self-inflicted wounds a day",
"他每天都把自己逼到离死亡一步的地方。他学会了身体是先于意志习惯疼痛的。": "Every day he pushed himself to within one step of death. He learned that the body gets used to pain before the will does.",
"对决：每天杀一次自己": "Duel: kill himself once a day",
"每一天他都要和一个杀心极重的自己打一场。输了就真的死了。他赢了自己六十多万次。": "Every day he had to fight a version of himself with an extreme will to kill. To lose was to truly die. He beat himself more than six hundred thousand times.",
"两样都做": "Do both",
"他没有留出喘气的时间。六十多万天里，他没有休息过一天。": "He left himself no time to breathe. In more than six hundred thousand days he did not rest for a single one.",
"每天一次的决斗": "A Duel Once a Day",
"对面站着的是他自己。区别只有一个：那一个，杀心极重。": "Standing across from him was himself. There was only one difference: that one had an extreme will to kill.",
"它散开的时候，连一句告别都没有。他站在原地，数了数自己赢了多少次。数不清了。": "When it dispersed, it did not even say farewell. He stood where he was and counted how many times he had won. He lost count.",
"「你输了。」它说。然后它把这一天的份额从你身上收走了——但明天，你还要再来一次。": "\"You lost,\" it said. Then it collected that day's share from you. But tomorrow you would come again.",
"十岁：一颗比他身体还大的头颅": "Ten: A Head Bigger Than His Body",
"组织决定对邪神发起总攻。他一路杀到了邪神王的面前。": "The Organization decided on a general offensive against the Cult God. He fought his way to the Cult God-King.",
"战场上的成员后来回忆：最先让人安静下来的不是胜利的消息——": "Members on the battlefield recalled later that what silenced them first was not the news of victory—",
"而是一个十岁的孩子，拖着一颗比他身体还大的头颅，从战线尽头走回来。": "but a ten-year-old child dragging a head bigger than his own body back from the far end of the front.",
"他把头颅放下，说了一句话。": "He set the head down and said one sentence.",
"然后他去了李耀阳的家，把李耀阳的家人带回了组织。": "Then he went to Li Yaoyang's home and brought Li Yaoyang's family back to the Organization.",
"李耀阳的儿子李耀辉被他收为徒弟；女儿沫雪儿被他安排到罗求恩那里学习。": "Li Yaoyang's son Li Yaohui he took as a disciple. His daughter Mo Xue'er he sent to study under Luo Qiu'en.",
"组织内对这一天有一个说法——": "Within the Organization there was a saying about that day—",
"他砍下邪神王的头，是为了赢；": "He cut off the Cult God-King's head to win.",
"他接走李耀阳的家人，是因为他终于承认：自己赢不回来什么。": "He took Li Yaoyang's family away because he finally admitted that he could win nothing back.",
"那一晚没有人睡得着。只有他一个人坐在孤儿院门口。": "No one slept that night. He alone sat at the gate of the orphanage.",
"院里刚带回来的几个孩子还不敢靠近他，最小的那个躲在门后偷看。": "The children just brought into the yard still did not dare come near him. The youngest hid behind the door and watched.",
"他拍了拍身边的地。": "He patted the ground beside him.",
"「坐这儿。这地方以前很吵，现在不吵了。」": "\"Sit here. This place used to be loud. It is not loud now.\"",
"那孩子问：「为什么？」": "The child asked, \"Why?\"",
"思源看了一眼会台的方向。": "Siyuan glanced toward the stage.",
"「因为吵的人，我替他们记着了。」": "\"Because the ones who made noise—I kept the record for them.\"",
"邪神王": "The Cult God-King",
"它的王座是用骨头搭的。它低头看着你，像看一件终于送到的货。": "Its throne was built of bone. It looked down at you like a shipment that had finally arrived.",
"你把它的头颅提了起来。你没有喊。你只是把它拖回了战线尽头。": "You lifted its head. You did not shout. You only dragged it back to the far end of the front.",
"十一岁：会台、星空与一个名分": "Eleven: The Stage, the Stars, and a Place",
"胜利一周年。焉鹤把他拉到了会台之上。": "The first anniversary of the victory. Yan He pulled him up onto the stage.",
"台下是几百名成员。掌声响了很久，久到他自己有点不知所措——": "Below the stage were several hundred members. The applause went on so long that he did not quite know what to do—",
"他那时还没习惯站在会台上，而不是拆掉会台。": "At that time he was not yet used to standing on the stage rather than tearing it down.",
"晚上的庆功宴上，思晓雅站在远处看着他。": "At the celebration banquet that evening, Si Xiaoya stood at a distance and watched him.",
"他也看到了她。她拉住他，来到了组织的外面，一起看了很长时间的星星。": "He saw her too. She took his hand and led him outside the Organization, and they watched the stars for a long time.",
"他们聊了很多。他的情感，也渐渐地恢复了。": "They talked about many things. His feelings gradually returned.",
"组织内后来流传着一句话——": "A saying later spread within the Organization—",
"「那一夜之后，第三任恒永者才真正开始像个人。」": "\"Only after that night did the third Eternal begin to look like a person.\"",
"「以后我教你剑。」": "\"I will teach you the sword from now on.\"",
"他去训练李耀辉了。他教得很慢，慢到李耀辉后来自己都觉得不好意思。": "He went to train Li Yaohui. He taught so slowly that Li Yaohui himself later felt embarrassed about it.",
"「你别再替我抄书了。」": "\"Stop copying books out for me.\"",
"她笑了一下，说：「那你得先学会自己念给我听。」": "She smiled and said, \"Then you have to learn to read it to me yourself first.\"",
"「我想把这套东西传下去。」": "\"I want to pass this down.\"",
"从这一晚起，他不再把自己当成一把剑。他开始把自己当成一套能教下去的东西。": "From that night on he no longer treated himself as a sword. He began to treat himself as a set of things that could be taught onward.",
"叛徒": "The Traitor",
"「你以为我不敢还手吗，师父。」——对面站着的，是他亲手带大的那个孩子。": "\"Do you think I dare not strike back, Master?\" Standing across from him was the child he had raised with his own hands.",
"他赢了。他没有罚他。他只是把剑鞘内侧的名字，又多刻了一个。": "He won. He did not punish him. He only carved one more name inside the scabbard.",
"交出去": "Handing It Over",
"十二岁到十七岁，他把恒之剑法完全完善，又创出了一千多万种剑法。": "From twelve to seventeen he brought the Heng Sword Arts to completion and created more than ten million sword techniques.",
"在同一段时间里，他创建并完善了恒之弓法、恒之刃法、恒之枪法、恒之斧法——还有其他所有冷兵器。": "In the same period he created and completed the Heng Bow Arts, the Heng Blade Arts, the Heng Spear Arts, the Heng Axe Arts—and every other cold weapon.",
"十八岁，在所有成员的目睹下，他命李耀辉成为了第四任恒永者。": "At eighteen, before all the members, he named Li Yaohui the fourth Eternal.",
"十九岁，他逐渐让李耀辉全面担任这个职务。二十岁，退休。": "At nineteen he gradually handed the full duties over to Li Yaohui. At twenty, he retired.",
"从十一岁受位到二十岁退休，前后不过九年。": "From taking the seat at eleven to retiring at twenty, it was no more than nine years.",
"组织对这九年的总结只有一句——": "The Organization summed up those nine years in a single line—",
"他把一个需要天才才能撑住的位子，改造成了一个普通人也能接住的位子。": "He turned a seat that only a genius could hold into a seat an ordinary person could catch.",
"二十一到二十二岁，他去了邪神王的王宫，让新一任邪神王理解了「善良」的意思。": "From twenty-one to twenty-two he went to the palace of the Cult God-King and made the new Cult God-King understand the meaning of \"kindness.\"",
"离开之前，邪神王为了报答他，施法诅咒——让他和思晓雅、李耀辉、沫雪儿等人获得了永生。": "Before he left, the Cult God-King cast a curse to repay him, granting him, Si Xiaoya, Li Yaohui, Mo Xue'er and others eternal life.",
"很多人不理解：为什么是诅咒，而不是祝福。": "Many did not understand why it was a curse and not a blessing.",
"「永生不是活得久。永生是看着别人一个个走完，而你还在。这当然是诅咒。」": "\"Eternal life is not living long. Eternal life is watching others finish one by one while you remain. Of course it is a curse.\"",
"「不过我要。我得看着这套东西传下去。」": "\"But I want it. I have to watch this be passed down.\"",
"要么进牢，要么进会台": "Either the Cell or the Stage",
"组织档案里关于他五岁之前的部分，只有零碎几行。": "The Organization's file on him before the age of five holds only a few scattered lines.",
"他曾在三天里拆掉[恒]分部的一整座演武场，理由是「想看看底下的管子通到哪里」。": "He once took apart an entire training yard of a [Heng] branch in three days. His stated reason: \"I wanted to see where the pipes underneath lead.\"",
"他也曾在一次物资清点里把所有的编号标签对调，让整条后勤线乱了半个月。": "He also once swapped every numbered tag during a supply count and threw the whole logistics line into disorder for half a month.",
"处理他的成员在报告末尾写了一句：「此子将来要么进牢，要么进会台。」": "The member handling him wrote at the end of the report, \"This child will end up either in a cell or on the stage.\"",
"没有人想到：会台在前，牢不在后。": "No one expected that the stage would come first, and the cell would not follow.",
"五岁那年，第6任首领焉鹤没有把他拎起来丢出去。": "When he was five, the sixth Leader, Yan He, did not pick him up and throw him out.",
"「你拆东西的时候，是想知道它怎么坏的，还是怎么好的？」": "\"When you take something apart, do you want to know how it broke, or how it was fixed?\"",
"思晓雅第一次见他时，正抱着一摞书。": "When Si Xiaoya first saw him, she was carrying a stack of books.",
"他后来承认：那是他第一次看见比自己安静的人。他并不喜欢安静，但他记住了那个样子。": "He admitted later that it was the first time he had seen someone quieter than himself. He did not like quiet, but he remembered the way she looked.",
"六岁那年，他成了[恒]组织的一员。值班的成员给他发了一个编号。": "At six he became a member of [Heng]. The member on duty gave him a number.",
"「思源。这个是我自己起的。」": "\"Siyuan. I chose this one myself.\"",
"「怎么好的。」": "\"How it was fixed.\"",
"焉鹤看了他一会儿，说：「那你留下。」——这句话他记了一辈子，也照着它活了一辈子。": "Yan He looked at him for a moment and said, \"Then you stay.\" He remembered those words his whole life, and lived by them his whole life.",
"「怎么坏的。」": "\"How it broke.\"",
"焉鹤笑了一下：「那你得先学会把它修回去。」他不太服气，但当天下午就蹲在演武场边上，把拆下来的管子一根一根对了回去。": "Yan He smiled. \"Then you have to learn to put it back first.\" He was not convinced, but that afternoon he crouched at the edge of the training yard and matched the removed pipes back one by one.",
"先不答，回头把演武场修好": "Say nothing for now, and repair the training yard afterwards",
"他修到天亮。焉鹤站在远处看了一夜，第二天只说了两个字：「留下。」": "He repaired it until dawn. Yan He stood at a distance and watched all night, and the next day said only two words: \"You stay.\"",
"七岁：第一次团体任务": "Seven: The First Squad Mission",
"七岁那年，他第一次参与团体任务。带他出去的，是组织里最宠他的几位哥哥和姐姐。": "At seven he joined a squad mission for the first time. The ones who took him out were the brothers and sisters in the Organization who doted on him most.",
"埋伏是他们早就布置好的。": "The ambush had been set long in advance.",
"哥哥和姐姐们为了保护他，全部被杀死。": "The brothers and sisters were all killed protecting him.",
"他被压在同伴的身体下面。血顺着他自己的脸往下淌。": "He was pinned under his comrades' bodies. Blood ran down his own face.",
"他不记得自己哭了多久。他只记得邪教的人把刀举起来的时候，他甚至没有闭眼。": "He did not remember how long he cried. He only remembered that when the Cult members raised their blades, he did not even close his eyes.",
"她不劝他别难过。她只是坐在旁边，把自己抄的书一页一页念给他听。念到他不哭了为止。第二天再来。": "She did not tell him not to grieve. She only sat beside him and read the book she had copied out, page by page, aloud to him. She read until he stopped crying. The next day she came again.",
"三分钟。四周所有邪教成员都被一一杀死。等支援赶到，第7任和第8任恒之剑法雏形的传人把他击晕，带走了所有活着的邪教成员。战后清点战场——没有一具尸体是完整的，而他手上，连一道划伤都没有。": "Three minutes. Every Cult member around them was killed, one by one. When support arrived, the seventh and eighth inheritors of the Heng Sword Arts prototype knocked him out and took away every living Cult member. Afterwards the battlefield was counted. Not one corpse was whole, and there was not a single scratch on his hands.",
"你死死按住那具发抖的身体。三分钟后支援到了，你活了下来。可那一夜之后，你有很长一段时间不敢闭眼。": "You pinned the trembling body down with all your strength. Three minutes later support arrived, and you lived. But after that night, for a long time, you did not dare close your eyes.",
"先替哥哥姐姐把眼睛合上": "Close the eyes of his brothers and sisters first",
"他一个一个地合。合到第三个人的时候，他身体里的另一个人自己醒了。他后来说：那天替我杀人的是我自己；替他们合眼的，也是我自己。": "He closed them one by one. At the third, the other person inside him woke on his own. He said later: the one who killed for me that day was myself. The one who closed their eyes was myself too.",
"四个月": "Four Months",
"八岁那年，第7任和第8任恒之剑法雏形的传人找到了他，收他为徒。他成了第9任传人。出师前，师父把最后一个据点交给他，说：这一处，你自己收。狂信者把血写在墙上，笑着问他要不要先哭一场。": "At eight, the seventh and eighth inheritors of the Heng Sword Arts prototype found him and took him as a disciple. He became the ninth. Before he finished his training, his Master gave him one last outpost and said: this one, you take yourself. The fanatics wrote in blood on the wall and asked him, smiling, whether he wanted to cry first.",
"他进去了四个月，出来的时候是第9任。两位师父都以为他会先哭一场，再拿起剑。他没有。他拿起剑的第一件事，是把哥哥姐姐们的名字一个一个刻在剑鞘内侧。从那以后，那把剑再没换过鞘。": "He went in for four months and came out the ninth. Both Masters thought he would cry first and then pick up the sword. He did not. The first thing he did after picking it up was carve the names of his brothers and sisters, one by one, inside the scabbard. From then on that sword never changed scabbards.",
"九岁：不用剑的那一次": "Nine: The Time Without a Sword",
"九岁那年，他和李耀辉的父亲李耀阳搭档。李耀阳为了保护他，死了。这一年他再次爆发——只不过这一次，是他自己控制着躯体。他一路打过去，全程只用拳。": "At nine he was paired with Li Yaohui's father, Li Yaoyang. Li Yaoyang died protecting him. That year he broke out again—except this time he controlled the body himself. He fought his way through using only his fists.",
"没有一间屋子的墙是完好的，也没有一个敌人是被砍死的。带队的成员在报告里写：「他不是来杀人的，他是来问一个问题的。问完之后，就没有人回答了。」": "Not one wall of any room was intact, and not one enemy was killed by a blade. The member leading the squad wrote in the report, \"He did not come to kill. He came to ask a question. After he asked it, no one answered.\"",
"他被人从废墟里拖了出来。拖他的人在报告末尾又补了一行：「他是来问一个问题的。问完之后，就没有人回答了。」": "He was dragged out of the ruins. The one who dragged him added a line at the end of the report: \"He came to ask a question. After he asked it, no one answered.\"",
"会台": "The Stage",
"十岁那年，组织决定对邪神发起总攻。": "At ten, the Organization decided on a general offensive against the Cult God.",
"他一路杀到了邪神王的面前。那东西的王座是用骨头搭的；它低头看着他，像在看一件终于送到的货。": "He fought his way to the Cult God-King. Its throne was built of bone. It looked down at him like a shipment that had finally arrived.",
"战场上最先安静下来的，不是胜利的消息——而是一个十岁的孩子拖着一颗比他身体还大的头颅，从战线尽头走回来。": "What silenced the battlefield first was not the news of victory, but a ten-year-old child dragging a head bigger than his own body back from the far end of the front.",
"然后他去了李耀阳的家，把李耀阳的家人接进了组织。李耀辉被他收为徒弟；沫雪儿被他安排到罗求恩那里学习。": "Then he went to Li Yaoyang's home and brought Li Yaoyang's family into the Organization. Li Yaohui he took as a disciple. Mo Xue'er he sent to study under Luo Qiu'en.",
"组织内对这一天有一个说法：他砍下邪神王的头是为了赢；他接走李耀阳的家人，是因为他终于承认——自己赢不回来什么。": "Within the Organization there was a saying about that day: he cut off the Cult God-King's head to win. He took Li Yaoyang's family away because he finally admitted that he could win nothing back.",
"那天晚上没有人睡得着。只有他一个人坐在孤儿院门口。": "No one slept that night. He alone sat at the gate of the orphanage.",
"院里刚带回来的几个孩子还不敢靠近他。最小的那个躲在门后偷看。": "The children just brought into the yard still did not dare come near him. The youngest hid behind the door and watched.",
"那孩子问：「为什么？」思源看了一眼会台的方向。": "The child asked, \"Why?\" Siyuan glanced toward the stage.",
"十一岁：站到会台上去": "Eleven: Stand on the stage",
"胜利一周年。焉鹤把他拉到了会台之上，台下是几百名成员。掌声响了很久，久到他自己有点不知所措——他那时还没习惯站在会台上，而不是拆掉会台。": "The first anniversary of the victory. Yan He pulled him up onto the stage, and below it were several hundred members. The applause went on so long that he did not quite know what to do. At that time he was not yet used to standing on the stage rather than tearing it down.",
"十一岁：把书接过来自己念": "Eleven: Take the book and read it himself",
"他去找思晓雅，把那摞书接了过来。他念得很慢，她听了很久，没有笑他。那天之后，他学会了自己念东西给自己听。": "He went to Si Xiaoya and took the stack of books from her. He read very slowly. She listened for a long time and did not laugh at him. After that day he learned to read things aloud to himself.",
"十一岁：先教李耀辉站好": "Eleven: Teach Li Yaohui to stand first",
"他去训练李耀辉。他教得很慢，慢到李耀辉后来自己都觉得不好意思。他说：慢一点没关系，站得住才有下一招。": "He went to train Li Yaohui. He taught so slowly that Li Yaohui himself later felt embarrassed. He said: slow is all right. If you can stand, there is a next move.",
"修演武场": "Repairing the Training Yard",
"五岁那年他拆了分部的一整座演武场。理由写在他的说明里：想看看底下的管子通到哪里。": "At five he took apart an entire training yard of the branch. His stated reason: he wanted to see where the pipes underneath lead.",
"处理意见下来得很快：自己修回去。": "The ruling came down quickly: repair it yourself.",
"他蹲在坑边，把管子一根一根对了回去。对了三天。": "He crouched at the edge of the pit and matched the pipes back one by one. It took three days.",
"对到最后缺三根。他找了一下午没找到，就在记录上写了三个字：缺三根。": "In the end three were missing. He searched all afternoon and did not find them, so he wrote three words in the record: three missing.",
"修完那天，焉鹤来看了一圈，什么都没说，走了。": "The day it was finished, Yan He came and looked around, said nothing, and left.",
"后来他才知道，那三根是有人半夜放到门口的，没有署名。": "Only later did he learn that someone had put those three by the door in the middle of the night, with no name signed.",
"他也才知道：那三根管子，本来就不在演武场下面。": "He also learned that those three pipes had never been under the training yard to begin with.",
"演武场修好的第二个月，他又去把底下的管子看了一遍。": "In the second month after the training yard was repaired, he went to look at the pipes underneath again.",
"这一次他没有拆。": "This time he did not take them apart.",
"把多余的三根也装上去": "Fit the three spare pipes in as well",
"装上去以后，地面鼓了一小块。此后每次列队，都有人绕开那个地方走。": "After they were fitted, a small patch of ground swelled up. From then on, whenever the members lined up, someone always walked around that spot.",
"把三根留在库房，登记入库": "Leave the three in the storehouse and log them in",
"库房登记上写着：来历不明，三根。这行字在册子上留了很多年，没人去改。": "The storehouse log read: origin unknown, three. That line stayed in the ledger for many years, and no one changed it.",
"去问是谁放的": "Go and ask who left them",
"他问了半个月，谁都说不知道。最后他自己停下不问了——他大概猜到了。": "He asked for half a month and everyone said they did not know. In the end he stopped asking. He had probably guessed.",
"多出来的一张床": "The Extra Bed",
"孤儿院的床位一直是紧的。每带回来一个孩子，就得挪一张床。": "Beds in the orphanage were always tight. Every child brought back meant a bed had to be moved.",
"那年冬天带回来三个。最小的那个不肯睡靠门的位置。": "That winter three were brought back. The youngest refused to sleep in the spot by the door.",
"思晓雅每晚过来念书，念到他们睡着。她念得很平，不换调子。": "Si Xiaoya came every night to read aloud until they fell asleep. She read flatly and never changed her tone.",
"思源坐在门槛上听。他不进去，也不催她回去。": "Siyuan sat on the threshold and listened. He did not go in, and he did not hurry her back.",
"有个孩子问她：那个坐在门口的人是谁。": "One child asked her who the person sitting at the door was.",
"「是你们以后要叫他先生的人。」": "\"He is the one you will call teacher later.\"",
"那天夜里他让人在最里面靠墙的地方多搭了一张床。": "That night he had an extra bed put up in the innermost place against the wall.",
"那张床一直空着。没人问为什么，也没人往上面放东西。": "That bed stayed empty. No one asked why, and no one put anything on it.",
"孤儿院的名分是他亲自办的，条例只有一条：遇孤儿必带回。": "He handled the orphanage's charter himself. It had one rule: any orphan found must be brought back.",
"没有例外，没有配额，没有成本核算。": "No exceptions, no quota, no cost accounting.",
"把靠门的位置改成放杂物的架子": "Turn the spot by the door into a shelf for supplies",
"架子搭起来之后，靠门那一块反而成了院里最热闹的地方。有人在那儿分饭、发衣服、贴通知。": "After the shelf went up, the area by the door became the busiest place in the yard. People handed out meals there, gave out clothes, posted notices.",
"每晚留一盏灯到最晚那个孩子睡着": "Leave one lamp lit every night until the last child falls asleep",
"灯的规矩一直没写进任何条例，但每晚都有人去点。点的次数比值夜表上记的还多。": "The rule about the lamp was never written into any charter, but someone lit it every night. It was lit more often than the night watch log recorded.",
"把册子上「带回的孩子」改成「入册的孩子」": "Change \"children brought back\" to \"children entered\" in the ledger",
"改完之后有人问这两个词有什么差别。他说没有差别，只是他不想让孩子看见「带回」两个字。": "After the change, someone asked what difference there was between the two words. He said there was none. He only did not want the children to see the words \"brought back.\"",
"7岁那年哥哥姐姐替他死光，第二人格在血里醒来，3分钟杀空四周的邪教。8岁拜师，4个月出师，拿起剑的第一件事是把他们的名字刻在剑鞘内侧。9岁李耀阳为他而死，他用拳屠了一座邪教。里世界633680天，一天1000次自残、一次与自己决斗，一次没输。10岁砍下邪神王的头，对战场说：「它输了。」11岁受位，18岁授位李耀辉，20岁退休。此后他创办孤儿院，严令「遇孤儿必带回」。他放弃了所有的感情，留下的那一点全给了孩子。组织内有一句话：「第三任恒永者守住了[恒]组织，思晓雅守住了第三任恒永者。」": "At seven his brothers and sisters died in his place, the second personality woke in the blood, and in three minutes he cleared the Cult around him. At eight he took a Master, finished his training in four months, and the first thing he did with a sword was carve their names inside the scabbard. At nine Li Yaoyang died for him, and he slaughtered a Cult stronghold with his fists. In the inner world, 633,680 days: a thousand self-inflicted wounds a day, one duel with himself a day, not one loss. At ten he cut off the Cult God-King's head and told the battlefield, \"It lost.\" At eleven he took the seat, at eighteen he gave it to Li Yaohui, at twenty he retired. After that he founded an orphanage and ordered that any orphan found must be brought back. He gave up all his feelings; the little that remained he gave entirely to the children. Within the Organization there is a saying: \"The third Eternal held the [Heng] Organization. Si Xiaoya held the third Eternal.\"",
"「解了也没事做，还不如留着让组织安心。」": "\"Even if I lifted it there would be nothing to do. Better to keep it and let the Organization rest easy.\"",
"2009年生 · 生死不知所终": "Born 2009 · Fate unknown",
"焉鹤带入组织；思晓雅守住了他；李耀辉是他徒弟，也是他侄子。": "Yan He brought him into the Organization. Si Xiaoya held him. Li Yaohui is his disciple and also his nephew.",
"完善恒之剑法，并一人立起五脉：剑、弓、刃、枪、斧。仅剑法一门，便有一千多万种。": "He completed the Heng Sword Arts and single-handedly established five branches: sword, bow, blade, spear, axe. The sword branch alone holds more than ten million techniques.",
"11 岁：第 6 任首领焉鹤在会台当众宣布。三任中唯一有公开受位仪式的一次": "Age 11: the sixth Leader, Yan He, announced it publicly on the stage. The only public succession ceremony among the three.",
"降神·思源": "Descent · Siyuan",
"他没有出手。他只是站到了你前面——就像他以前站到所有人前面那样。这一击之后，战场会安静下来。": "He did not strike. He only stepped in front of you, the way he once stepped in front of everyone. After this blow, the battlefield will go quiet.",
"去弄一身像样的兵装。别用分部发的那些残次品——它们会在最关键的那一下断掉。": "Go and get yourself some proper gear. Do not use the defective issue from the branch. They break on the one blow that matters most.",
"七岁那年他失去父亲。八岁那年，一个「很旧的恒永者」把他接进了组织，他才知道那个人是父亲用命护住的搭档。\n十一岁他叛逃，十三岁被抓回——那天思源没有罚他，只把剑鞘内侧的名字又多刻了一个。": "He lost his father at seven. At eight, a \"very old Eternal\" brought him into the Organization, and only then did he learn that the man was the partner his father had shielded with his life.\nHe defected at eleven and was dragged back at thirteen. That day Siyuan did not punish him. He only carved one more name into the inside of the scabbard.",
"「那天他没罚我。他只是又刻了一个名字。」": "\"That day he did not punish me. He only carved one more name.\"",
"叔叔": "Uncle",
"他第一次听到那个名字的时候，正在收拾父亲的遗物。": "He first heard that name while sorting through his father's belongings.",
"父亲的文件里夹着一张很旧的纸，上面写着：搭档——思源。": "An old sheet of paper was tucked among his father's files. On it: Partner — Siyuan.",
"他拿着那张纸去找那个比自己大两岁的少年。少年正在擦剑。": "He took the sheet to the boy two years older than him. The boy was wiping his sword.",
"少年没有抬头，只说了一句。": "The boy did not look up. He said one thing.",
"「你父亲挡在我前面。这件事我记着。」": "\"Your father stood in front of me. I remember it.\"",
"问他：那你打算怎么还": "Ask him: how do you intend to repay it",
"「我把你们接进来。就当我先还一半。」——他说完，把剑收了起来。": "\"I bring you in. Count that as half.\" He said it, then sheathed the sword.",
"把那张纸还给他": "Hand the sheet back to him",
"他接过去，看了很久，然后把它折好，收进了剑鞘内侧。": "He took it and looked at it for a long time. Then he folded it and put it inside the scabbard.",
"说：我以后要练到比他更强": "Say: one day I will train until I am stronger than he was",
"「可以。」他终于抬了头，「但先把基本功练完。」": "\"Fine.\" He finally raised his head. \"But finish the basics first.\"",
"十一岁的叛逃": "Defection at Eleven",
"他觉得自己已经很强了。他想证明一件事——不是证明给组织，是证明给那个总在他前面的人。": "He thought he was already strong. He wanted to prove one thing. Not to the Organization. To the one who always stood in front of him.",
"他输了。输得很干净，连一招都没拖完。可那个收剑的人没有骂他，也没有罚他。": "He lost. Cleanly, without dragging out a single exchange. But the one who sheathed the sword did not scold him. He did not punish him either.",
"刻上去的名字": "The Carved Name",
"他被抓回来了。十五岁，站在思源面前，等着受罚。": "He was brought back. Fifteen years old, standing before Siyuan, waiting for punishment.",
"思源只是从鞘里把剑抽出来，让他看内侧。": "Siyuan only drew the sword from its sheath and showed him the inside.",
"那里刻着一排名字。最下面一个新刻的，是他的名字。": "A row of names was carved there. The newest, at the bottom, was his.",
"「……你刻我名字干什么？」": "\"...Why carve my name?\"",
"「因为你回来了。」": "\"Because you came back.\"",
"那一瞬间他明白了：那个人一直都知道他会回来。也知道他如果回不来，这个名字会一直是最后一行。": "In that instant he understood. That man had always known he would come back. And that if he did not, this name would stay the last line forever.",
"十六岁，他在恒永者候补之间的战斗中以压倒的优势平推。": "At sixteen he rolled straight through the battle between Eternal candidates.",
"然后思源亲自授位——第四任恒永者。": "Then Siyuan conferred the seat himself. The fourth Eternal.",
"从此把「规矩」两个字刻进骨头": "Carve the word \"rules\" into his bones from then on",
"他成了组织里最守规矩的人。因为他知道规矩是他师父用一次不罚换来的。": "He became the most rule-abiding man in the Organization. He knew the rules had been bought with one act of mercy.",
"把妹妹的安全放到第一位": "Put his sister's safety first",
"他在自己的日程表最上面写了一行字：沫雪儿。以后所有的事都排在这一行下面。": "He wrote one line at the top of his schedule: Mo Xue'er. Everything else came below that line.",
"把剑鞘内侧抄一份带在身上": "Copy the inside of the scabbard and carry it on him",
"他抄了一份，贴身带着。他怕自己有一天也会忘记那排名字。": "He copied it and carried it against his body. He was afraid that one day he too would forget that row of names.",
"冰晶之前的最后一战": "The Last Battle Before Frostcrystal",
"虚无里浮出一头以「吞噬」为名的东西。它先把周围三座哨站的名字从档案上抹掉了。": "Something named Devouring rose out of the void. First it erased the names of three nearby outposts from the records.",
"它被冻在原地的时候还在张嘴。他看了一眼，转身走了。": "It was still opening its mouth when it froze in place. He glanced at it, turned, and walked away.",
"洞穿": "Pierced Through",
"二十岁到二十七岁，他一直是组织主要且唯一的最强战力。": "From twenty to twenty-seven he was the Organization's main and only strongest fighter.",
"二十八岁那一年，某种邪恶的力量从背后洞穿了他的心脏。": "At twenty-eight, some evil force pierced his heart from behind.",
"他倒下去的时候还在想：今天没人值班，妹妹的信还没写完。": "Going down, he was still thinking: no one is on duty today, and the letter to his sister is not finished.",
"撑着，等那个人回来": "Hold on. Wait for that man to come back",
"他撑住了。他不知道自己撑了多久——只记得睁开眼的时候，那个熟悉的声音在说：「换好了。」\n思源回来了，带回了一颗「永恒的冰晶之主宰的心脏」。心脏更换后，他成了新一任永恒的冰晶之主宰，样貌永远停在了十八岁。": "He held on. He did not know how long. He only remembered waking to that familiar voice saying, \"It is in.\"\nSiyuan had come back with the heart of the eternal Lord of Frostcrystal. After the replacement he became the new eternal Lord of Frostcrystal. His face stopped at eighteen, permanently.",
"把最后的力量压进胸腔里": "Force the last of his strength into his chest",
"他把还没散尽的力量全压进了胸腔。低温把他自己先冻住了一半——也正是这一半，替他撑到了那个人回来。": "He forced what strength remained into his chest. The cold froze half of him first. That half held him until the man returned.",
"在心里喊一声师父": "Call out to his Master, silently",
"他没有喊出声。可他知道，那个人听得见。思源带着「永恒的冰晶之主宰的心脏」回来了。他成了新一任主宰。": "He made no sound. But he knew that man could hear him. Siyuan came back with the heart of the eternal Lord of Frostcrystal. He became the new Lord.",
"半天": "Half a Day",
"妹妹被邪教抓走，准备献祭。他觉醒血脉的瞬间，战场上的温度掉了十几度。": "His sister was taken by the Cult for sacrifice. The moment his bloodline awakened, the temperature on the field dropped more than ten degrees.",
"半天。这个邪教所有成员都被灭绝。他和思源联手，用了半天。": "Half a day. Every member of that Cult was wiped out. He and Siyuan together, in half a day.",
"再往后的日子": "The Years After",
"二十九岁，他收了一个徒弟，叫程墨歌。": "At twenty-nine he took a disciple. Cheng Moge.",
"三十岁到四十一岁，他一直在教。他把自己学的、师父给的、自己悟的，全都拆开来讲。": "From thirty to forty-one he taught. What he had learned, what his Master had given him, what he had worked out himself. He took it all apart and explained it.",
"四十二岁，他退休，亲自授予程墨歌第五任恒永者的职位。": "At forty-two he retired, and with his own hands conferred the fifth Eternal's seat on Cheng Moge.",
"四十三岁，他住进总部，开始养老。": "At forty-three he moved into headquarters and settled into retirement.",
"——「养老」这个词是他自己说的。说的时候他手里还在擦剑。": "The word \"retirement\" was his own. He said it while wiping his sword.",
"八岁那年": "The Year He Was Eight",
"七岁那年，父亲死了。文件里夹着一张旧纸，上面写着两个字：搭档。": "At seven his father died. An old sheet of paper was tucked among the files. Two words on it: Partner.",
"八岁那年，有人敲开了他家的门。": "At eight, someone knocked on his family's door.",
"那是一个看起来只有十岁出头的少年。他后来才明白：那具身体并不指示年龄，那只是他愿意让人看见的样子。": "It was a youth who looked barely past ten. Only later did he understand. That body did not tell age. It was only the shape he was willing to be seen in.",
"少年和母亲谈了很久。谈完之后，母亲收拾了东西。": "The youth talked with his mother for a long time. When it was over, she packed.",
"他跟着那个少年走进早期的[恒]组织总部。走了很久，没有人说话。": "He followed the youth into the early headquarters of the [Heng] Organization. They walked a long way. No one spoke.",
"进门之前，少年停下来，说了一句。": "Before the door, the youth stopped and said one thing.",
"「从今天起，你叫我师父。别的以后再说。」": "\"From today, you call me Master. The rest can wait.\"",
"也是在那一天，他才知道：这个把他接进组织的人，是他的叔叔，也是他父亲用命护住的搭档。": "That same day he learned it. The man who brought him into the Organization was his uncle, and the partner his father had shielded with his life.",
"问他：我父亲是怎么死的": "Ask him: how did my father die",
"「他挡在我前面。」思源说完，把剑抽出来擦了擦，「这件事我记着。你也记着。」": "\"He stood in front of me.\" Siyuan drew the sword and wiped it. \"I remember it. You remember it too.\"",
"先练完今天该练的": "Finish today's training first",
"他当天就练到了手抖。思源没夸他，只在训练记录上多写了一行：可。": "He trained until his hands shook, that same day. Siyuan did not praise him. He only added one line to the training record: Passable.",
"把妹妹领到离训练场最近的房间": "Move his sister to the room closest to the training ground",
"他把沫雪儿的房间安排在了自己隔壁。从那天起，他的门从来不锁。": "He put Mo Xue'er in the room next to his. From that day his door was never locked.",
"八岁那年：叛逃": "The Year He Was Eight: Defection",
"九岁到十岁，他觉得自己强得很快。十一岁那年他做了一个决定——不再站在那个人后面。": "From nine to ten he felt himself growing strong fast. At eleven he made a decision. He would no longer stand behind that man.",
"他连一招都没拖完。收剑的人没有骂他，也没有拦住他。他逃出了总部。": "He did not drag out a single exchange. The one who sheathed the sword did not scold him, and did not stop him. He fled headquarters.",
"他连一招都没拖完。他逃出总部的时候还以为自己赢了——直到两年后才明白，那天没有人追他。": "He did not drag out a single exchange. Running from headquarters, he thought he had won. Only two years later did he understand that no one had chased him.",
"候补之间的战斗": "The Battle Between Candidates",
"十三岁他被逮了回来。他以为会挨罚，思源只是把剑抽出鞘，让他看内侧。": "At thirteen he was caught and brought back. He expected punishment. Siyuan only drew the sword from the sheath and showed him the inside.",
"那里刻着一排名字。最下面一行，新刻的是他的名字。": "A row of names was carved there. The last line, freshly cut, was his.",
"十四岁到十五岁，思源关起门来秘密地教他。练的东西从不记录。": "From fourteen to fifteen, Siyuan taught him behind closed doors. Nothing they practiced was ever recorded.",
"十六岁，组织在会台上办了恒永者后补之间的战斗。规则只有一条：站到最后的人，由恒永者亲自授位。": "At sixteen the Organization held a battle between Eternal candidates on the stage. One rule only. The one left standing received the seat from the Eternal himself.",
"把所有候补都当成当年那个自己": "Treat every candidate as the boy he once was",
"他打得毫无保留。因为当年他自己，最恨的就是别人对他留手。": "He held nothing back. As a boy, what he had hated most was being spared.",
"先等，等所有人都打完": "Wait. Let them all finish first",
"他最后一个上场。台上的人换了一轮又一轮，他只上去走了一趟。": "He went up last. The stage changed hands round after round. He walked up once.",
"只守，逼他们自己认输": "Defend only. Force them to yield",
"他一招没出。对面三个人轮流撞在他身上，最后是自己放下武器的。": "He threw nothing. Three opponents took turns running into him. In the end they put down their weapons themselves.",
"后补之间的战斗": "The Candidates' Battle",
"会台上一共十七个人。他们都想站到最后，而他只想证明一件事——那个人教他的东西，他全接住了。": "Seventeen on the stage. All of them wanted to be the last one standing. He wanted to prove one thing. That he had caught everything that man had taught him.",
"压倒性的平推。从头到尾没有一个人把他逼退过半步。": "An overwhelming sweep. From start to finish, no one forced him back half a step.",
"他倒了。可倒下的时候，他听见会台上有人小声说：那个人，是恒永者的徒弟。": "He went down. But as he fell he heard someone on the stage say quietly: that one is the Eternal's disciple.",
"半日灭绝": "Extermination in Half a Day",
"十七岁，授位刚过。妹妹沫雪儿被邪教抓走，准备献祭。他赶到的时候，祭坛已经点起来了。": "Seventeen, the seat newly conferred. His sister Mo Xue'er had been taken by the Cult for sacrifice. When he arrived, the altar was already lit.",
"他被打退了。思源站到了他前面。合围之后，这个邪教仍然没有活过当天。半天，一个不留。": "He was driven back. Siyuan stepped in front of him. Once they closed the ring, that Cult still did not live past the day. Half a day. Not one left.",
"雪化了": "The Snow Melted",
"他冲上祭坛的时候，血脉里的东西醒了。": "When he charged onto the altar, something in his bloodline woke.",
"他觉醒了两样东西：一道「S」行风痕，和艾克斯—德洛歌之眼。": "Two things awakened in him. An \"S\"-shaped wind scar, and the Eye of X—Delgo.",
"战场上没人看清他是怎么动的。他后来自己也不太记得。他记得的只有一样：沫雪儿活着。": "No one on the field saw how he moved. Later he himself barely remembered. He remembered one thing. Mo Xue'er was alive.",
"——那年他十七岁，第一次知道什么叫「不值得谈条件的事」。": "He was seventeen that year, and learned what a thing not worth bargaining over was.",
"十八岁，他和思源一起做了整整一年的邪教追缴。": "At eighteen he spent a full year hunting the Cult with Siyuan.",
"十九岁思源退休。从那一年起，他成了组织主要且唯一的最强战力。": "At nineteen Siyuan retired. From that year on he was the Organization's main and only strongest fighter.",
"把猎杀邪教写进常规日程": "Put Cult-hunting on the regular schedule",
"他把「追缴」两个字留在了自己的日程表上。此后二十多年，那一行就没被划掉过。": "He kept the word \"pursuit\" on his schedule. For more than twenty years after, that line was never struck out.",
"把妹妹接到自己隔壁住": "Move his sister into the room next door",
"他在自己房间隔壁给沫雪儿留了一间。门上没锁，因为他说：这次我记得了。": "He kept the room next to his for Mo Xue'er. No lock on the door, because he said: this time I remembered.",
"去问思源：那天你为什么来": "Ask Siyuan: why did you come that day",
"「因为你是我徒弟。」思源说，「就这么简单。别想复杂。」": "\"Because you are my disciple,\" Siyuan said. \"It is that simple. Do not make it complicated.\"",
"换心之前": "Before the Heart",
"二十八岁。某个邪教的最高祭司站在他面前，笑着说：恒永者的心脏，正好用来祭。那不是他第一次被洞穿，却是唯一一次被洞穿。": "Twenty-eight. The high priest of some Cult stood before him and said with a smile: the Eternal's heart will do nicely for the sacrifice. It was not the first time he had been pierced through. It was the only time.",
"他倒下去的时候还在算：今天没人值班，妹妹的信还没写完。后来他再睁开眼，胸腔里跳的已经不是原来那颗心了。": "Going down, he was still counting: no one is on duty today, and the letter to his sister is not finished. When he opened his eyes again, the thing beating in his chest was no longer his own heart.",
"他倒下了。可那颗被换进胸腔的冰晶心脏不接受死亡。三天后他站起来，样貌停在了十八岁。": "He fell. But the frostcrystal heart put into his chest would not accept death. Three days later he stood up, his face fixed at eighteen.",
"回来的第一个月": "The First Month Back",
"十三岁他被抓了回来。第二天早上，排班表上照旧有他的名字。": "At thirteen he was caught and brought back. The next morning his name was on the duty roster as usual.",
"没有人提他逃过的事，也没有人刻意不接他的话。": "No one mentioned that he had run. No one deliberately left his words hanging either.",
"只是食堂那一份，总是先盛好，放在最靠里的那张桌上。": "Only his portion in the mess hall was always served first, and set on the table farthest in.",
"他坐下来的时候，旁边的人往边上挪了半寸，把地方让出来。": "When he sat down, the man beside him shifted half an inch and made room.",
"他吃得很快，比谁都早走。就这样过了一个月。": "He ate fast and left before anyone. That went on for a month.",
"一个月后他第一次主动开口，问值夜要怎么换班。": "A month later he spoke first, asking how night watch shifts were swapped.",
"「跟以前一样。写名字就行。」": "\"Same as before. Just write your name.\"",
"他写完，笔尖在纸上停了一下。没有人看他，也没有人走开。": "He finished writing. The tip of the pen paused on the paper. No one looked at him. No one walked away.",
"那两年，档案上只有一行字：在外，未归。": "For those two years the file held one line: Away. Not returned.",
"他回来的当天，有人在那行字旁边打了一个勾。": "The day he came back, someone put a check beside that line.",
"把自己的班排得比谁都多": "Take more shifts than anyone",
"他连值了半个月的夜。排班的人本来想拦，想了想，没拦——有些账得让人自己还。": "He took night watch for half a month straight. The man making the roster meant to stop him, thought about it, and did not. Some debts have to be paid by the man himself.",
"先去训练场站满一个时辰": "First stand in the training ground for two full hours",
"他站到腿麻。路过的人一个都没停下看他。第二天他照旧去站。": "He stood until his legs went numb. Not one passerby stopped to look. The next day he went and stood again.",
"去把档案里那两年的空白补上": "Fill the two blank years in the file",
"他在表格里写了一行：十一岁到十三岁，在外。写完合上册子，没有解释。": "He wrote one line in the form: eleven to thirteen, away. He closed the ledger and offered no explanation.",
"练手": "Practice",
"沫雪儿在罗求恩那里学医。晚上回来，她会拿哥哥练手。": "Mo Xue'er studied medicine under Luo Qiu'en. Coming home at night, she practiced on her brother.",
"第一课是包扎。她包得很紧，紧到他自己都笑了一下。": "The first lesson was bandaging. She wrapped it tight. Tight enough that he smiled once.",
"第二课是认穴位。她在他胳膊上按了很久，按错了好几个。": "The second was finding pressure points. She pressed along his arm for a long time and got several wrong.",
"「你别动。」": "\"Do not move.\"",
"他真的没动。等她按完，胳膊上留了一排红印。": "He did not move. When she finished, a row of red marks was left on his arm.",
"第二天罗求恩问她：你哥什么时候开始让人在他身上乱按的？": "The next day Luo Qiu'en asked her: since when does your brother let people press all over him?",
"「他不让。他就是不躲。」": "\"He does not allow it. He just does not move away.\"",
"后来她学得慢了些，但再也没有按错过。": "She learned more slowly after that, but she never pressed the wrong point again.",
"兄妹两个的房间挨着，中间那道门一直没装锁。": "The brother's and sister's rooms were side by side. The connecting door never had a lock put on it.",
"他说过一句话：门锁上，出事的时候就来不及了。": "He said it once: lock the door, and when something happens there is no time.",
"给她做一个专门的练手袋": "Make her a practice bag of her own",
"袋子是他自己缝的，针脚很粗。她收下了，用了很多年，破了也是自己补。": "He sewed the bag himself, with coarse stitches. She kept it and used it for years. When it tore she mended it herself.",
"让她先把药箱清点一遍": "Have her inventory the medicine box first",
"药箱里的东西她一样一样报名字，他一样一样记。她那晚报了三十七样，他记全了。": "She named each item in the box, one by one, and he recorded each one. She called out thirty-seven that night. He got them all.",
"陪她去罗求恩那里听课": "Go with her to Luo Qiu'en's lecture",
"他坐在最后面听了两个时辰，一句话没说。散课的时候罗求恩说：你哥比你认真。": "He sat at the very back for four hours and said nothing. As the class broke up, Luo Qiu'en said: your brother is more serious than you.",
"7岁丧父，8岁被10岁的思源接进组织，才知道那个话不多的少年是自己父亲用命护住的搭档。11岁叛逃，13岁被抓回——那天思源没有罚他，只把剑鞘内侧的名字又多刻了一个。16岁在候补战中压倒平推，思源亲自授位。17岁妹妹被邪教抓走，他觉醒血脉，与思源半天灭尽该教。28岁被邪恶之力洞穿心脏，思源带回「永恒的冰晶之主宰的心脏」为他换心。42岁退休，把第五任交到程墨歌手里。": "Lost his father at seven. At eight he was brought into the Organization by Siyuan, then ten, and learned that the quiet boy was the partner his father had shielded with his life. Defected at eleven, dragged back at thirteen. That day Siyuan did not punish him. He only carved one more name into the inside of the scabbard. At sixteen he swept the candidate battle, and Siyuan conferred the seat himself. At seventeen his sister was taken by the Cult, his bloodline awakened, and he and Siyuan wiped that Cult out in half a day. At twenty-eight an evil force pierced his heart. Siyuan brought back the heart of the eternal Lord of Frostcrystal and replaced it. He retired at forty-two, handing the fifth seat to Cheng Moge.",
"「他说他不罚我。他只是又刻了一个名字。」": "\"He said he would not punish me. He only carved one more name.\"",
"李耀阳之子 · 思源之侄": "Son of Li Yaoyang · Nephew of Siyuan",
"父亲替他挡住的那一击，思源替他记了一辈子。": "The blow his father blocked for him, Siyuan remembered for a lifetime on his behalf.",
"觉醒血脉「S」行风痕与艾克斯-德洛歌之眼；28岁换心，成为新一任永恒的冰晶之主宰。": "Awakened the bloodline \"S\"-shaped wind scar and the Eye of X—Delgo. At twenty-eight his heart was replaced, making him the new eternal Lord of Frostcrystal.",
"20 岁：恒永者后补之间的战斗胜出后，由思源亲自授位": "Age 20: after winning the battle between Eternal candidates, the seat was conferred by Siyuan himself",
"降神·李耀辉": "Descent · Li Yaohui",
"低温先到，声音后到。冰晶从地表一路生长，把那具躯体钉在原地。": "The cold arrived first, the sound after. Frostcrystal grew along the ground and nailed that body in place.",
"恒组织不养独行的人。去征召两个能跟你一起走出分部大门的人。": "The Heng Organization does not keep men who walk alone. Go recruit two who can walk out of the branch gates with you.",
"七岁那年在分部天台上，他和一个不认识的人聊了很久。那人走的时候，把一枚恒永者身份牌落在了地上。\n他花了十五年，才把这块牌子还回去。": "At seven, on the rooftop of the branch, he talked for a long time with a man he did not know. When the man left, he dropped an Eternal identity tag on the ground.\nIt took him fifteen years to give that tag back.",
"「那不是李耀辉。那是李耀辉的师父。」": "\"That was not Li Yaohui. That was Li Yaohui’s Master.\"",
"七岁的天台": "The Rooftop at Seven",
"妹妹出生那天，分部请来总部弑神团的一员为她赐福。": "The day his sister was born, the branch brought in a member of the Godslayer Corps from headquarters to bless her.",
"他一个人爬到了天台上，因为下面太吵了。": "He climbed to the rooftop alone. It was too loud below.",
"天台上已经有人了。那人靠着栏杆，看着远处的灯。": "Someone was already there. The man leaned on the railing, watching the lights in the distance.",
"他们聊了很久，聊得很开心。天亮之前，那人走了。": "They talked for a long time, and he enjoyed it. Before dawn, the man left.",
"走的时候，地上留了一枚牌子。": "When he left, a tag was left on the ground.",
"把它收起来，将来亲自还给他": "Pick it up. Give it back to him in person one day",
"他把牌子贴胸收好。他给自己定了一个目标：把这个重要的东西送回去。": "He tucked the tag against his chest. He set himself one goal: to return this important thing.",
"追出去，问他叫什么": "Run after him and ask his name",
"他追出两条街，只看见一个背影消失在传送光里。他把牌子握得更紧了。": "He chased him two streets. He saw only a back disappearing into the transfer light. He gripped the tag tighter.",
"先看牌子上的字": "Look at the words on the tag first",
"牌子上刻着四个字：恒永者。他把这四个字记了十五年。": "Four words were carved on the tag: Eternal. He remembered those four words for fifteen years.",
"十岁的战场": "The Battlefield at Ten",
"半径十公里的小型战场。这是他第一次真正上战场。": "A small battlefield, ten kilometers across. It was his first time truly at war.",
"他明白了：战场上要么杀死别人，要么把敌人打残后俘虏。这就是战争。他不喜欢战争。": "He understood. On a battlefield you either kill, or cripple the enemy and take him prisoner. That was war. He did not like war.",
"还回去": "Give It Back",
"十五岁，第一次恒[X]大规模战争爆发。他自愿参战。": "At fifteen, the first large-scale Heng–[X] war broke out. He volunteered.",
"在战场上，他终于又见到了那个人。他跑过去，把牌子递了出去。": "On the battlefield he saw the man again at last. He ran over and held the tag out.",
"那人没有接。那人只是从口袋里取出一根细链，把牌子穿了过去，挂在了他的脖子上。": "The man did not take it. He took a thin chain from his pocket, threaded the tag onto it, and hung it around his neck.",
"「你先戴着。」": "\"Wear it for now.\"",
"随后那人转身，走向了[X]战队的首领。那一场，双方打了一年。": "Then the man turned and walked toward the Leader of the [X] squad. That one fight lasted a year.",
"最后那人用出极其强大的力量，把[X]首领打成重伤。战争结束了。": "In the end the man brought out enormous power and left the [X] Leader badly wounded. The war was over.",
"而他也在那一年才知道——他见到的那个人，不是李耀辉。": "And that year he learned it — the man he had met was not Li Yaohui.",
"那是李耀辉的师父，思源。": "It was Li Yaohui’s Master, Siyuan.",
"把项链收进衣服里，继续练": "Tuck the chain under his clothes and keep training",
"他练得更狠了。他终于知道，自己要追的不是一个人，是一条已经传了三代的线。": "He trained harder. He finally knew that what he was chasing was not one man, but a line three generations long.",
"去找李耀辉，说想拜师": "Go to Li Yaohui and ask to be his disciple",
"十七岁那年他去见了思源。思源知道他崇拜李耀辉，就把李耀辉叫到了办公室。\n他万万没想到，李耀辉开口的第一句话是：「跟我学吧。」": "At seventeen he went to see Siyuan. Siyuan knew he admired Li Yaohui, so he called Li Yaohui into the office.\nHe had not expected it. Li Yaohui’s first words were: \"Study under me.\"",
"在训练场上把这一年的仗复盘一遍": "Go over that year of war again on the training ground",
"他把那一年的战报一页页抄了下来。抄完之后，他不再只是个粉丝，他成了个能看战场的人。": "He copied that year’s battle reports page by page. When he finished, he was no longer only a follower. He could read a battlefield.",
"星空里的任务": "The Mission in the Stars",
"二十五岁，师父给了他一个任务：去一片无际的星空。": "At twenty-five, his Master gave him a mission: go to a boundless field of stars.",
"他回来了。他不知道自己变强了多少，只知道回来那天，师父看他的眼神变了。": "He came back. He did not know how much stronger he had become. He only knew that on the day he returned, his Master looked at him differently.",
"毁灭神王": "The God-King of Destruction",
"四十七岁。毁灭神王与死亡神王同时降下。它们说：「你师父的师父砍过神，所以你也想试试？」": "At forty-seven. The God-King of Destruction and the God-King of Death descended together. They said: \"Your Master’s Master cut down a god. So you want to try as well?\"",
"毁灭神王倒了。他回头，另一个还在。": "The God-King of Destruction fell. He turned. The other was still there.",
"死亡神王": "The God-King of Death",
"死亡神王张开了手。它说：「我可以把你在意的人还给你。」": "The God-King of Death opened its hand. It said: \"I can give back the ones you care about.\"",
"他杀了它。他没有要那个交易。他后来只说了一句：「我师父教我的第一件事，是不拿别人的命做交易。」": "He killed it. He did not take the bargain. Later he said only one thing: \"The first thing my Master taught me was not to trade in other people’s lives.\"",
"他倒下了。可他倒下之前，把两位神王的命格一起钉进了虚空。组织记录：第五任恒永者于47岁击杀毁灭神王与死亡神王。": "He fell. But before he fell, he nailed the fates of both God-Kings into the void. Organization record: the fifth Eternal killed the God-King of Destruction and the God-King of Death at forty-seven.",
"第五任": "The Fifth",
"二十六岁，任务完成，师父让他参加恒永者的竞选。": "At twenty-six, the mission done, his Master told him to enter the election for Eternal.",
"在大选里，他碾压了所有人。他用着让人不得不佩服的实力和品德，当上了第五任恒永者。": "In the election he crushed everyone. With a strength and character no one could help but respect, he became the fifth Eternal.",
"他的父母和妹妹来到总部看他。父母决定把妹妹留在他身边生活，自己回了家乡养老。": "His parents and sister came to headquarters to see him. His parents decided to leave his sister to live at his side, and went home to retire.",
"他的样貌和他妹妹的样貌，一直停在十八岁和二十岁。": "His face and his sister’s face stopped at eighteen and twenty.",
"——他和他妹妹，分别在二十七岁和二十岁获得了永生。": "— He and his sister gained immortality at twenty-seven and twenty.",
"选拔前夜": "The Night Before the Selection",
"二十五岁，他从那片星空里回来了。": "At twenty-five, he came back from that field of stars.",
"回来那天，师父在走廊尽头等他。师父只说了两句话。": "On the day he returned, his Master was waiting at the end of the corridor. His Master said only two things.",
"「任务完成得不错。」": "\"The mission was done well.\"",
"「去参加恒永者的竞选。」": "\"Enter the election for Eternal.\"",
"他站在原地没动。他知道那句话后面是什么：竞选赢了，他就得接师父的位子。": "He stood where he was and did not move. He knew what came after that sentence: if he won the election, he would have to take his Master’s seat.",
"——那位子，师父坐了二十六年。": "— His Master had held that seat for twenty-six years.",
"当晚他去了训练场。没有人陪他，他一个人练到天亮。": "That night he went to the training ground. No one went with him. He trained alone until dawn.",
"去找师父，问自己够不够": "Go to his Master and ask whether he was good enough",
"「不用问。」李耀辉把剑递给他，「够不够，会台上说。」": "\"No need to ask.\" Li Yaohui handed him the sword. \"Whether you are enough, the stage will say.\"",
"把候选人名单抄一遍": "Copy the list of candidates through once",
"名单上有四十三个人。他把每个人的战法抄了一遍，抄到最后手是抖的。": "There were forty-three names on the list. He copied each man’s way of fighting. By the end his hand was shaking.",
"把项链解下来，放在桌上": "Take off the chain and lay it on the table",
"他放了一夜，天亮又戴回去了。他想起那年那人说过的话——「你先戴着。」": "It lay there all night. At dawn he put it back on. He remembered what the man had said that year — \"Wear it for now.\"",
"大选": "The Election",
"大选是组织正式的大会，所有分部的人都到了。会台上一共有四十三位候选人。规则只有一条：站到最后的人，成为下一任恒永者。": "The election was a formal assembly of the Organization. Everyone from every branch came. Forty-three candidates stood on the stage. There was one rule: the one left standing becomes the next Eternal.",
"他被打倒过一次。他爬起来，把最后一轮打完了。会台上最后站着的是他——全场没有说话，只是都站起来了。": "He was knocked down once. He got up and fought the last round to the end. He was the one left standing on the stage — no one in the hall spoke. They only stood.",
"会台之后": "After the Stage",
"大选结束后第三天，一处裂隙在总部外围张开。新任恒永者没有等命令，一个人去了。": "Three days after the election, a rift opened on the outer edge of headquarters. The new Eternal did not wait for orders. He went alone.",
"他回来的时候身上还在滴水。他把报告交上去，报告只有一行字：已清。": "He was still dripping when he returned. He handed in his report. It held one line: Cleared.",
"他被那东西吞进去过一次，又自己从里面撕开了一道口子出来。第二天，裂隙被封了。": "The thing swallowed him once, and he tore his own way out from the inside. The next day the rift was sealed.",
"授位": "The Investiture",
"授位那天，李耀辉把剑抽出来，让他看鞘的内侧。": "On the day of the investiture, Li Yaohui drew the sword and showed him the inside of the scabbard.",
"那里刻着一排名字。最上面一行，是三任恒永者的师父。最下面一行，是他师父的名字。": "A row of names was carved there. The top line was the Master of three Eternals. The bottom line was his own Master’s name.",
"「以后你的名字刻在下一行。轮到你的时候，你自己刻。」": "\"Your name goes on the next line. When your turn comes, you carve it yourself.\"",
"他的父母和妹妹来到了总部，见到了成为第五任恒永者的他。": "His parents and sister came to headquarters and saw him as the fifth Eternal.",
"把师父的名字再看一遍，然后收剑": "Look at his Master’s name once more, then sheathe the sword",
"他看了很久，然后重新把剑收好。他没有哭。他只是把腰挺直了。": "He looked for a long time, then sheathed the sword again. He did not weep. He only straightened his back.",
"给妹妹在总部找一间房子": "Find his sister a room at headquarters",
"他把妹妹安置在了离自己最近的那栋楼。搬完东西那天，他在楼下站到很晚。": "He settled his sister in the building nearest his own. On the day the move was finished, he stood downstairs until late.",
"写信给父母，写完却没寄": "Write to his parents, and not send it",
"信写完了，他折好放进抽屉。有些话他打算当面说——后来他真的当面说了。": "The letter was finished. He folded it into the drawer. Some things he meant to say in person — and later he did say them in person.",
"信寄出去之前": "Before the Letter Was Sent",
"他在总部分到的第一间宿舍很小，桌子靠墙，抽屉只有一格。": "The first room headquarters gave him was small. The desk stood against the wall. The drawer had one compartment.",
"到总部的第二个月，他给家里写了第一封信。": "In his second month at headquarters, he wrote his first letter home.",
"他写了两张。一张写他每天都做些什么，写得很多；另一张抄了一遍，把不合规矩的地方都划掉，最后剩四行。": "He wrote two sheets. One said what he did each day, and it was long. He copied it onto the other, crossed out everything that broke the rules, and four lines were left.",
"寄出去的是那四行。抄好的那张他折好，压在抽屉最底下。": "The four lines were what he sent. He folded the copy and pressed it under everything in the drawer.",
"父亲回信写：家里都好。母亲在信尾添了一句：你妹妹会走路了。": "His father wrote back: the family is well. At the end his mother added one line: your sister can walk now.",
"——他走的时候妹妹四岁。他算了一下，妹妹今年六岁。": "— When he left, his sister was four. He worked it out. This year she was six.",
"他把回信也压进抽屉。这一格后来满了，他就换了一个盒子。": "He pressed the reply into the drawer as well. The compartment filled, so he moved to a box.",
"很多年以后，那个盒子被搬到了他妹妹住的那栋楼里。": "Many years later, that box was moved into the building where his sister lived.",
"她没有拆。她只是把它放在了书架上，和自己的课本并排。": "She did not open it. She set it on the shelf, beside her own textbooks.",
"把真实的生活也寄一份回去": "Send a copy of his real life home as well",
"他重新抄了一遍，把「每天都做些什么」也装了进去。寄出去以后他又后悔了半夜。": "He copied it again and put in what he did each day as well. After he sent it, he regretted it half the night.",
"只寄家里能看懂的那一页": "Send only the page his family could understand",
"他一直是这么做的。他觉得信这种东西，要让收信的人一眼看完，剩下的自己留着。": "That was what he had always done. A letter, he thought, should be read through at a glance. The rest he kept.",
"把两张都收着，回家时当面说": "Keep both sheets and say it in person when he went home",
"他把两张并在一起放。他想过：等回去那天，念给他们听。": "He kept the two sheets together. He thought: on the day he went back, he would read them aloud.",
"跟着李耀辉的第一天": "The First Day with Li Yaohui",
"第一天上午在兵装库。李耀辉让他先练收剑。": "The first morning was in the armory. Li Yaohui had him practice sheathing first.",
"「一百次。」": "\"One hundred times.\"",
"他收了一百次。李耀辉一次都没看，一直在跟旁边的锻工说话。": "He sheathed it a hundred times. Li Yaohui did not watch once. He talked the whole time with the smith beside him.",
"锻工在敲一块不知道做什么用的铁。李耀辉问那是什么，锻工说，还没定。": "The smith was hammering a piece of iron no one knew the use of. Li Yaohui asked what it was. The smith said it was not decided yet.",
"第二天还是收剑。第三天也是。他数到第七百次的时候，李耀辉走过来，说了一句：行了。": "The second day was sheathing again. So was the third. When he counted to seven hundred, Li Yaohui walked over and said one thing: enough.",
"下午是会议。他坐在最后一排，负责倒水。": "The afternoon was a meeting. He sat in the last row and poured water.",
"晚上李耀辉问他：今天会上说了什么。他答不上来，被叫回去重听了一遍记录。": "That evening Li Yaohui asked him what had been said at the meeting. He could not answer. He was sent back to listen to the record again.",
"一个月以后，他收剑不用看鞘口。": "A month later, he could sheathe the sword without looking at the mouth of the scabbard.",
"李耀辉那天在门口站了一会儿，什么也没说。": "That day Li Yaohui stood in the doorway a while and said nothing.",
"练完收剑，把会议记录抄一遍": "After sheathing practice, copy the meeting record through once",
"他把那场会抄了三遍。第三遍的时候，他终于听出来哪一句是重点。": "He copied that meeting three times. On the third, he finally heard which sentence mattered.",
"去问锻工那块铁到底是干什么的": "Ask the smith what that iron was actually for",
"锻工没答，只让他帮着拉了两个时辰的风箱。他学会了怎么让炉子不熄。": "The smith did not answer. He only had him work the bellows for four hours. He learned how to keep the furnace from going out.",
"问李耀辉：什么时候教我剑法": "Ask Li Yaohui when he would teach him the sword arts",
"「收剑收够了，剑自己会来找你。」李耀辉说完就走了。他没懂。三个月后他懂了。": "\"When you have sheathed it enough, the sword will come to you.\" Li Yaohui said it and left. He did not understand. Three months later he did.",
"他7岁在天台见到恒永者，捡到一枚身份牌，之后两年把它当成目标。15岁第一次恒[X]战争爆发，他终于把身份牌还回去，对方却把它做成项链挂在他脖子上——那一刻他才知道，他见到的不是李耀辉，而是李耀辉的师父思源。26岁竞选，碾压所有人，成为第五任。47岁，他独自击杀了毁灭神王和死亡神王。": "At seven he met an Eternal on a rooftop and picked up an identity tag, and for the next two years he made it his goal. At fifteen the first large-scale Heng–[X] war broke out, and he finally gave the tag back — but the man turned it into a chain and hung it around his neck. In that moment he learned that the man he had met was not Li Yaohui, but Li Yaohui’s Master, Siyuan. At twenty-six he entered the election, crushed everyone, and became the fifth. At forty-seven he killed the God-King of Destruction and the God-King of Death alone.",
"样貌停在18岁 · 27岁获永生": "Face stopped at 18 · Gained immortality at 27",
"7岁那年在天台上见到的那个人，把身份牌留给了他。": "The man he met on the rooftop at seven left him his identity tag.",
"李耀辉的徒弟，五年学尽全部恒之技法。47岁击杀毁灭神王与死亡神王。": "Disciple of Li Yaohui. Learned every Heng technique in five years. At forty-seven he killed the God-King of Destruction and the God-King of Death.",
"20 岁：恒永者竞选碾压所有人之后就任": "Age 20: took office after crushing everyone in the election for Eternal",
"降神·程墨歌": "Descent · Cheng Moge",
"他打起来有种学徒的认真——每一招都在确认自己有没有学对。": "He fights with an apprentice’s seriousness — every move checking whether he has learned it right.",
"东边那群戴兜帽的东西，把活人雕成柱子摆在路口。清掉十四个。": "Those hooded things in the east carve living people into pillars and set them at the crossroads. Clear fourteen of them.",
"他碾压了所有人。他用着让人不得不佩服的实力和品德，当上了第五任恒永者。": "He crushed everyone. With a strength and character no one could help but respect, he became the fifth Eternal.",
"父母决定把妹妹留在他身边生活，自己回了家乡养老。": "His parents decided to leave his sister to live at his side, and went home to retire.",
"他从一片虚无里诞生。思源在他力量扩散出去之前找到他，封住他，把他带回组织。\n十七岁那年他给自己定了个规矩：同时打赢三位恒永者，就成第六任，然后去娶他喜欢的女孩。他打了一百一十七万多次。": "He was born out of a stretch of the Void. Before his power could spread, Siyuan found him, sealed him, and brought him back to the Organization.\nAt seventeen he made himself a rule: defeat three Eternals at once, become the Sixth, then go marry the girl he loved. He fought 1,170,000 times.",
"「打完这一场，我就能娶她了。」": "\"Win this one, and I can marry her.\"",
"虚无里睁开的眼睛": "The Eye That Opened in the Void",
"他诞生的一瞬间，那股力量就往外扩散了。": "The instant he was born, that power spread outward.",
"对思源来说它很小；对其他任何生命体来说，它极其致命。": "To Siyuan it was small. To any other living being it was fatal.",
"在他力量还没有完全扩散出来的时候，思源已经到了。": "Before his power had fully spread, Siyuan had already arrived.",
"思源把他的力量封住，然后把他抱了起来。两岁时，思源给他起了一个名字。": "Siyuan sealed his power, then picked him up. At two years old, Siyuan gave him a name.",
"「你叫萧冉。」": "\"You are Xiao Ran.\"",
"问他：我是什么": "Ask him: what am I",
"「你是一个还没有被写好的东西。」思源说，「所以你有机会写成别的。」": "\"You are a thing not yet written,\" Siyuan said. \"So you have a chance to be written into something else.\"",
"先学着模仿他的一招": "Learn to copy one of his moves first",
"他看了一眼，模仿出了八成的样子。思源愣了一下，然后笑了。": "He watched once and copied about eighty percent of it. Siyuan paused, then laughed.",
"记住这个名字，不再问别的": "Remember the name. Ask nothing else.",
"他没有再问。他只是把这两个字写了一遍又一遍，直到写熟。": "He did not ask again. He only wrote the two words over and over, until his hand knew them.",
"八岁到十六岁的八年": "Eight Years, From Eight to Sixteen",
"思源带着他在外面玩了八年。八年里他了解了很多东西，也第一次有了和其他人一样的情感。": "Siyuan took him out into the world for eight years. In those eight years he learned many things. For the first time he had feelings like other people.",
"打完这一场，他第一次觉得：力量这东西，也可以用来护住一个人。": "After this fight, he thought for the first time: power can also be used to shield a person.",
"十七岁的自我训练": "Self-Training at Seventeen",
"「赢了，我就是第六任。」——对面那个影子，用的是和他一样的虚无之力，只是比他更狠。": "\"If I win, I am the Sixth.\" The shadow across from him used the same Void power as he did, only more ruthlessly.",
"影子散了。他撑着膝盖喘气，想着：还早。": "The shadow scattered. He braced his hands on his knees and breathed. Not yet.",
"117万次": "1,170,000 Times",
"他给自己定的规矩是：同时对阵第五任、第四任、第三任恒永者。": "The rule he set for himself: fight the Fifth, the Fourth and the Third Eternal at the same time.",
"打了117万多次，没赢一场。": "He fought 1,170,000 times. He did not win one.",
"每一次他都在变强，每一次他都会在完全认真的思源那里栽倒。": "Each time he grew stronger. Each time he fell to Siyuan at full seriousness.",
"一次又一次。十九岁那年，他彻底爆发了。": "Again and again. At nineteen he erupted.",
"思源看着他这样，也用出了那具躯体的最强形态。": "Seeing him like this, Siyuan used the strongest form of that body.",
"邪神王的力量，再一次出现在了[恒]组织。": "The power of the Cult God-King appeared once more in the Heng Organization.",
"不退，正面撞上去": "Do not retreat. Charge straight in.",
"他被压得跪了下去。但他没有倒。思源收势的时候，眼神里第一次有了别的东西。": "He was pressed down onto his knees. He did not fall. When Siyuan withdrew, something else was in his eyes for the first time.",
"赌一次：把封印全放开": "Gamble once: release the seal completely",
"他把封在身上的东西掀开了一角。战场安静了半秒——半秒之后他还是被压了回去。": "He lifted a corner of what was sealed inside him. The battlefield went quiet for half a second. Half a second later he was pressed back down.",
"先把李雅惠的名字念一遍": "Say Li Yahui's name once first",
"他念了一遍那个名字。念完之后，他的力量第一次没有乱。": "He said that name once. Afterward his power was steady for the first time.",
"邪神王模式": "Cult God-King Mode",
"那不是他认识的思源。那是他从邪神王那里拿走的、一直不肯用的东西。": "That was not the Siyuan he knew. That was what he had taken from the Cult God-King and had never been willing to use.",
"他还是输了。但思源、李耀辉和程墨歌都很欣慰——他们决定提前结束他的训练。": "He still lost. But Siyuan, Li Yaohui and Cheng Moge were pleased. They decided to end his training early.",
"他输了。输在他意料之中的地方。可这一次，倒下去之前他看到了三个人同时点头。": "He lost. He lost where he had expected to. But this time, before he went down, he saw the three of them nod at once.",
"会台上的女孩": "The Girl on the Stage",
"二十岁，在[恒]组织恒永者继承大会上，他成为了第六任恒永者。": "At twenty, at the Heng Organization succession assembly for the Eternals, he became the Sixth Eternal.",
"大会上，他也见到了自己喜欢的那个女孩。": "At the assembly he also saw the girl he loved.",
"那名女孩叫李雅惠，是李耀辉的曾孙女。": "The girl was named Li Yahui. She was Li Yaohui's great-granddaughter.",
"他没想到。但不管李雅惠到底是谁的女儿，他都会爱着她，永远保护着她。": "He had not expected it. But no matter whose daughter Li Yahui was, he would love her, and protect her always.",
"一百一十七万次": "One Million One Hundred Seventy Thousand Times",
"十七岁他回到组织，开始了自我训练。": "At seventeen he returned to the Organization and began his self-training.",
"他给自己立了一条规矩：同时打赢第三任、第四任、第五任恒永者，就做第六任。": "He set himself one rule: defeat the Third, Fourth and Fifth Eternal at once, and he would be the Sixth.",
"——然后去娶他喜欢的那个女孩。": "—Then go marry the girl he loved.",
"思源那时是第三任。李耀辉是第四任。程墨歌是第五任。": "Siyuan was the Third then. Li Yaohui was the Fourth. Cheng Moge was the Fifth.",
"三个人一起上场。有时是三个人，有时是一个人轮流。": "The three entered the field together. Sometimes all three, sometimes one after another.",
"李耀辉的冰晶封过他的虚无；程墨歌的技法压过他的模仿。": "Li Yaohui's ice crystal had sealed his Void. Cheng Moge's technique had suppressed his mimicry.",
"但每一场，他最后都会在完全认真的思源那里栽倒。": "But every fight, he fell in the end to Siyuan at full seriousness.",
"一百一十七万多次。一场没赢。": "More than 1,170,000 times. Not one win.",
"每一次他都在变强。每一次，还是栽在同一个地方。": "Each time he grew stronger. Each time he fell in the same place.",
"把每一次的败因记下来": "Write down the cause of every loss",
"他记了一百多万条。后来那些记录堆满了三间屋子，他一条都没删。": "He wrote over a million entries. In time the records filled three rooms. He deleted none of them.",
"先只盯着李耀辉打": "Focus only on Li Yaohui for now",
"他和第四任打了整整三年。三年后他终于能在冰晶封住他之前先动——然后思源还是赢了。": "He fought the Fourth for three full years. After three years he could finally move before the ice crystal sealed him. Then Siyuan still won.",
"去问思源：我到底差在哪": "Ask Siyuan: where exactly do I fall short",
"「你不差。」思源说，「你只是还没真的输过。你每次都在保命，不是在下注。」": "\"You do not fall short,\" Siyuan said. \"You have not truly lost yet. Every time you are keeping yourself alive. You are not making a bet.\"",
"一百一十七万次之后": "After 1,170,000 Times",
"十九岁那年，他彻底爆发了。思源看着他这样，也用出了那具躯体的最强形态——邪神王的力量，再一次出现在了[恒]组织。": "At nineteen he erupted. Seeing him like this, Siyuan used the strongest form of that body. The power of the Cult God-King appeared once more in the Heng Organization.",
"他输了。倒在会台上的时候，他看见三个人同时点了点头，然后他就什么都不记得了。": "He lost. Going down on the stage, he saw the three of them nod at once. After that he remembered nothing.",
"继承大会": "The Succession Assembly",
"二十岁。[恒]组织恒永者继承大会。": "Twenty. The Heng Organization succession assembly for the Eternals.",
"思源、李耀辉、程墨歌并排站着。三个人把他叫到台上。": "Siyuan, Li Yaohui and Cheng Moge stood in a row. The three of them called him onto the stage.",
"「你的训练结束了。不是因为你能赢我们了。」": "\"Your training is over. Not because you can beat us now.\"",
"「是因为你现在会为了赢，把自己押上去。」": "\"Because now you will stake yourself to win.\"",
"大会最后一项，是念名字。他从第三任那里把剑接过来，看了一遍鞘的内侧。": "The last item of the assembly was the reading of names. He took the sword from the Third and looked once at the inside of the scabbard.",
"那里刻着一排名字。他成了第六行。": "A row of names was carved there. He became the sixth line.",
"大会上，他也见到了自己喜欢的那个女孩。那名女孩叫李雅惠，是李耀辉的曾孙女。": "At the assembly he also saw the girl he loved. The girl was named Li Yahui. She was Li Yaohui's great-granddaughter.",
"把那一百一十七万条记录烧掉": "Burn the 1,170,000 records",
"他烧了一夜。天亮的时候他只留下一张纸，上面写着三个名字。": "He burned them all night. At dawn he kept one sheet of paper. Three names were written on it.",
"在剑鞘内侧的名字下面留出一行空白": "Leave a blank line under the names inside the scabbard",
"他量了一下位置，往后留了一整行。他说：下一任来的时候，得有地方刻。": "He measured the space and left a full line after it. He said: when the next one comes, there must be room to carve.",
"走下台，先去找李雅惠": "Step off the stage and find Li Yahui first",
"他走下台，穿过整片会台。他没有说话，只是站在她面前。她笑了。": "He stepped down and crossed the whole stage. He said nothing. He only stood in front of her. She smiled.",
"认字": "Learning to Read",
"思源教他认字的时候，他五岁。": "He was five when Siyuan taught him to read.",
"那不是课本。思源找了一根树棍，在地上画。": "It was not a textbook. Siyuan found a stick and drew on the ground.",
"「萧。冉。你的名字。」": "\"Xiao. Ran. Your name.\"",
"他看了一遍，写了一遍。写出来的是反的，笔画都往左边倒。": "He looked once, then wrote once. It came out mirrored. Every stroke leaned left.",
"思源让他重写。重写到第七遍，地上那片土被刮平了，只好换一块地方。": "Siyuan made him write it again. By the seventh time the soil there was scraped flat, and they had to move to another spot.",
"后来有一本很薄的册子，是思源自己抄的。他照着抄，抄满一页才许翻下一页。": "Later there was a very thin booklet, copied out by Siyuan himself. He copied from it. Only when a page was full was he allowed to turn the next.",
"「不用好看。要让别人认得出来。」": "\"It does not need to look good. It needs to be recognizable.\"",
"——他抄的第一句话是「萧冉，你的名字」。": "—The first sentence he copied was \"Xiao Ran, your name.\"",
"那本册子后来一直放在他的柜子里。": "That booklet stayed in his cabinet afterward.",
"他自己写的字始终不好看。他也没有再练过。": "His own writing never looked good. He never practiced it again.",
"照着册子一笔一笔抄": "Copy the booklet stroke by stroke",
"他抄得很慢。思源不催他，就在旁边坐着。那年他抄完了整本。": "He copied slowly. Siyuan did not hurry him, only sat beside him. That year he copied out the whole booklet.",
"去模仿思源的笔迹": "Imitate Siyuan's handwriting",
"他模仿出了八九分。思源看了半天，把册子收了回去，说：「这个不用学。」": "He got eight or nine parts of ten. Siyuan looked for a long while, took the booklet back, and said: \"This you do not need to learn.\"",
"问思源：我的名字是什么意思": "Ask Siyuan: what does my name mean",
"「没有什么意思。」思源说，「名字是你自己写出来的。」": "\"It means nothing,\" Siyuan said. \"A name is something you write out yourself.\"",
"会台散场之后": "After the Stage Empties",
"继承大会散场以后，会台上剩着椅子、水杯和一堆没人收的纸。": "After the succession assembly broke up, the stage was left with chairs, cups, and a pile of paper no one had collected.",
"他在前排的椅子旁边站了很久，因为他不知道自己该往哪边走。": "He stood a long time by a chair in the front row, because he did not know which way to go.",
"李雅惠没有走。她站在登记台那边，跟一个记录员在核对名单。": "Li Yahui had not left. She stood by the registration desk, checking a list with a record-keeper.",
"等那个人走了，他走过去问：「你是记录员吗。」": "When the man left, he walked over and asked: \"Are you the record-keeper.\"",
"「今天算。今天所有没定的事，都归我记。」": "\"Today I am. Everything undecided today is mine to record.\"",
"她把一本册子递过来。上面空着一行，就在他名字的后面。": "She handed him a booklet. One line was blank, right after his name.",
"他写完以后想还给她。她说：「留着。你以后每天都有事，得写下来。」": "When he finished he tried to give it back. She said: \"Keep it. From now on you will have something every day. It has to be written down.\"",
"他回去以后把册子放在桌上，翻到第一页。": "Back in his room he put the booklet on the table and turned to the first page.",
"那一页是他自己写的名字。他写的字，还是反的。": "That page held his own name. His writing was still mirrored.",
"把她递来的册子一直用下去": "Keep using the booklet she handed him",
"那本册子他写了很多年。他没有换过。": "He wrote in that booklet for many years. He never replaced it.",
"问她：那一行你早就画好了吗": "Ask her: was that line drawn long ago",
"「画好了。」她说，「画了三年。」": "\"It was,\" she said. \"I drew it three years ago.\"",
"留下来帮她把会台上的纸收完": "Stay and help her clear the paper off the stage",
"两个人收了半个时辰。最后一把椅子上还搭着一件没人认领的外套，她把它叠好放在了台边。": "The two of them cleared for an hour. On the last chair hung a coat no one had claimed. She folded it and set it at the edge of the stage.",
"他从一片虚无里诞生，思源在他力量扩散之前找到他、封住他、把他带回组织。2岁得名，5岁开始受训，8岁起跟着思源在外面玩了八年，也第一次有了和其他人一样的情感。17岁回组织自我训练：同时对阵第五、第四、第三任恒永者，赢了就成第六任，然后娶他喜欢的女孩。他打了117万多次，一场没赢。最后思源启用了那具躯体的最强形态——邪神王模式。他还是输了，但三位恒永者都很欣慰，决定提前结束训练，让他成为第六任。": "He was born out of a stretch of the Void. Before his power could spread, Siyuan found him, sealed him, and brought him back to the Organization. He was named at two, trained from five, and from eight spent eight years outside with Siyuan, where he had feelings like other people for the first time. At seventeen he returned to the Organization for self-training: fight the Fifth, the Fourth and the Third Eternal at once; win, and he becomes the Sixth, then marries the girl he loves. He fought 1,170,000 times and never won one. In the end Siyuan used the strongest form of that body, Cult God-King Mode. He still lost, but the three Eternals were pleased, and decided to end his training early and make him the Sixth.",
"生于虚无 · 样貌停在少年": "Born of the Void · Appearance frozen at boyhood",
"思源给他起的名字。李雅惠是他的妻子，萧雅辉是他的儿子。": "Siyuan gave him his name. Li Yahui is his wife. Xiao Yahui is his son.",
"虚无之力；与三位恒永者打了117万多次，一次没赢，却一次比一次强。": "Void power. He fought the three Eternals more than 1,170,000 times and never won once, yet grew stronger every time.",
"20 岁：恒永者继承大会": "Age 20: the Eternal succession assembly",
"降神·萧冉": "Descent · Xiao Ran",
"一片虚无从你脚下铺开。所有被写好的规则，在这里都作废。": "A stretch of the Void spreads out from under your feet. Every rule already written is void here.",
"走完第二传。我们得知道第二个「恒」是怎么死的——那对所有人都有用。": "Finish the Second Tale. We need to know how the second Heng died. That will be useful to everyone.",
"他出生在澜望星的一个贫民家里。七岁那年他在田园小路上遇见了思莉娅。\n十四岁那年她要走了，隔着传送台，她只用了口型说了七个字。": "He was born to a poor family on Lanwang. At seven he met Siliya on a country road.\nAt fourteen she was leaving. Across the teleport stage, she mouthed seven words.",
"「我会在[恒]组织等着你的。」": "\"I will be waiting for you in the [Heng] Organization.\"",
"田园小路": "The Country Road",
"他走在田园小路上，抱着家里让他去换的一袋盐。": "He walked the country road, carrying a bag of salt his family had sent him to trade.",
"路的另一头，一个女孩正抱着一摞书，走得很慢。": "At the far end, a girl was carrying a stack of books and walking slowly.",
"他看了一会儿，然后走上去，帮她拿了一半。": "He watched for a while, then walked up and took half the load.",
"那天他们聊了很多。他知道了她叫思莉娅。": "That day they talked a great deal. He learned her name was Siliya.",
"他还不知道，这个名字背后是整个[恒]组织。": "He did not yet know that behind the name stood the whole [Heng] Organization.",
"问她看的是什么书": "Ask what books she is reading",
"她把书递给他看。他一个字也没看懂，但他把书名记住了。": "She handed him the book. He understood not one word, but he remembered the title.",
"把自己会的那点招式演给她看": "Show her the few moves he knows",
"他演了三招，摔了两次。她笑得眼睛都弯了。": "He performed three moves and fell twice. She laughed until her eyes curved.",
"什么都不说，陪她走完这段路": "Say nothing, and walk the rest of the road with her",
"他们走得很慢。那天他回家的时候天已经黑透了，但心里很亮。": "They walked slowly. He got home after dark, but he felt bright inside.",
"后山上的三年": "Three Years on the Back Hill",
"他每天跑到后山，反复练习他偷看来的那些招数。没有师父，只有树，和树上的刻痕。": "Every day he ran to the back hill and drilled the moves he had stolen by watching. No Master. Only trees, and the marks cut into them.",
"树皮被他砍掉了一整面。他把招数练熟了。": "He stripped one whole side of bark from a tree. He had the moves down.",
"偷看": "Watching in Secret",
"十一岁那年，他去找思莉娅，看见思源正在教她恒组织专属的剑法。": "At eleven he went to find Siliya and saw Siyuan teaching her swordplay reserved for the Heng Organization.",
"思源早就感知到了他，但并没有驱赶。": "Siyuan had sensed him long before, and did not drive him off.",
"——只是放纵他在树后偷偷地看着。": "— He simply let him watch from behind the tree.",
"就这样过了三年。他几乎也会使用一些[恒]组织的专属剑法了。": "Three years passed this way. He could almost use some of the sword arts reserved for the [Heng] Organization.",
"继续躲着，把每一招都记牢": "Stay hidden, and commit every move to memory",
"他把每一招都记在脑子里，回家以后再练。三年，他记住了三十七招。": "He fixed each move in his head and drilled it at home. In three years he memorized thirty-seven moves.",
"走出来，光明正大地求教": "Step out and ask to be taught, openly",
"他走了出去，低着头。思源看了他一眼，说：「站好。偷看的人，姿势都不正。」": "He stepped out, head down. Siyuan glanced at him. \"Stand straight. Men who watch in secret never hold their stance.\"",
"把招数教给分部里其他穷孩子": "Teach the moves to the other poor children in the branch",
"他明白了：这套东西之所以强，是因为它可以被教给任何人。": "He understood: this art was strong because it could be taught to anyone.",
"测试那一天": "The Day of the Test",
"在场的几乎都是贵族子弟，没有一个瞧得起他。测试只考力量、速度、反应。": "Nearly everyone present was a noble's child, and not one thought him worth a glance. The test measured only strength, speed, and reflex.",
"他以力量和速度方面的压倒性优势，拿下综合能力第二。他进了分部。": "He took second overall on overwhelming strength and speed. He entered the branch.",
"吞噬文明的种族": "The Race That Devours Civilizations",
"二十一岁，一个可以轻易摧毁任何文明的种族出现了。[恒]组织与[X]战队第一次联合。": "At twenty-one, a race appeared that could destroy any civilization at will. The [Heng] Organization and [X] Team joined forces for the first time.",
"战场静了一瞬。宇宙裂开一道大口子——一个长得很像思源的少年，从裂口里走了出来。": "The battlefield went still for an instant. The universe split open — and a youth who looked much like Siyuan walked out of the gap.",
"金色的手掌": "The Golden Palm",
"那名少年身边站着[恒]组织的首领思晓雅。她是思莉娅的祖奶奶。": "Beside the youth stood Si Xiaoya, Leader of the [Heng] Organization. She was Siliya's great-grandmother.",
"少年伸出手。巨大的金色手掌出现在战场的正上方。": "The youth reached out. A vast golden palm appeared directly above the battlefield.",
"少年的眼睛变成了银绿色。战场上燃烧起银绿色的火焰。": "The youth's eyes turned silver-green. Silver-green flame burned across the battlefield.",
"每一个战死的[恒]组织成员和[X]战队成员，全部复活了过来。": "Every fallen member of the [Heng] Organization and [X] Team came back to life.",
"第三任恒永者思源慢慢地从那名少年身后走了出来。": "Siyuan, the third Eternal, walked slowly out from behind the youth.",
"他手里拿着那些怪物首领的头颅，身上却没有一道伤。": "He carried the heads of the monster leaders, and did not have a single wound on him.",
"去看那些复活的人是谁": "Go see who the risen are",
"他在人群里认出了几个自己分部的成员。他们昨天还在他旁边倒下，现在正站在他旁边喘气。": "He recognized several members of his own branch in the crowd. They had fallen beside him yesterday. Now they stood beside him, breathing.",
"去问思源：他是谁": "Ask Siyuan who he is",
"思源看了一眼那个少年，只说：「我儿子。」然后补了一句：「刚才那个是他，不是我。」": "Siyuan glanced at the youth. \"My son,\" he said. Then he added, \"That was him just now. Not me.\"",
"跟着李耀辉继续打": "Keep fighting alongside Li Yaohui",
"他和李耀辉互相照应。战场上几乎没有怪物能靠近他们。": "He and Li Yaohui covered each other. Almost nothing on that battlefield could come near them.",
"第七任": "The Seventh",
"这场战争让所有恒永者都身心疲惫。": "The war left every Eternal worn in body and mind.",
"除了第四任和第三任几乎没事，第五任和第六任都死了一遍。": "Except for the fourth and the third, who came through almost untouched, the fifth and the sixth each died once.",
"在第七任恒永者的继任典礼上，第三任、第四任、第五任、第六任全部在场。": "At the succession ceremony of the seventh Eternal, the third, fourth, fifth, and sixth were all present.",
"连[X]战队的首领也在场。": "Even the Leader of [X] Team was present.",
"——二十四岁，他成为了第七任恒永者，也成为思源身边又一位徒弟。": "— At twenty-four he became the seventh Eternal, and another disciple at Siyuan's side.",
"偷来的招数": "Stolen Moves",
"偷看的第三年。那天夜里，邪教的采生者摸进了田园。他把看了一千多天的招数，第一次用在人身上。": "The third year of watching. That night, a life-taker of the Cult slipped into the fields. For the first time he used on a man the moves he had watched for more than a thousand days.",
"他杀得很生，三招里错了两招。可他只用了三招。——偷来的东西，也能救命。": "He killed clumsily, botching two of three moves. But he needed only three. — What is stolen can still save a life.",
"他倒在田埂上，等到天亮才爬起来。第二天夜里，他还去后山。": "He fell on the field ridge and did not get up until dawn. The next night he went to the back hill again.",
"传送台前的七个字": "Seven Words Before the Teleport Stage",
"十四岁。思莉娅要离开澜望星了。": "Fourteen. Siliya was leaving Lanwang.",
"他一路跑到传送台，跑丢了一只鞋。": "He ran all the way to the teleport stage and lost a shoe on the way.",
"他这才知道，这个每天和他一起走田园小路的女孩，是全[恒]组织的大小姐。": "Only then did he learn that the girl who walked the country road with him every day was the eldest daughter of the whole [Heng] Organization.",
"她即将踏进去的时候，回头了。": "She was about to step in, and turned back.",
"她没有出声。她只是动了动嘴唇。": "She made no sound. She only moved her lips.",
"白光收拢。她笑着走了。": "The white light closed. She left smiling.",
"同一天，他在家里收到一封邀请函。[恒]组织的。测试在下个月。": "The same day, an invitation reached him at home. From the [Heng] Organization. The test was next month.",
"他后来才知道，那封邀请函不是思莉娅替他求的。": "Only later did he learn that Siliya had not begged the invitation for him.",
"是思源写的。上面只有一行字。": "Siyuan had written it. It held a single line.",
"「偷看的人，来考一次。」": "\"You who watched in secret. Come and take the test.\"",
"十八岁那年，他凭分部的功勋被总部点了名。也是思源的一句话，他就直接进了总部。": "At eighteen, headquarters named him on the strength of his branch service. One word from Siyuan, and he went straight into headquarters.",
"他走出传送台第七步，看见思莉娅站在台子前面。她一直在等。": "On the seventh step out from the teleport stage, he saw Siliya standing in front of it. She had been waiting all along.",
"去后山，把偷来的招数再练一遍": "Go to the back hill and drill the stolen moves once more",
"他练到测试的前一夜。他不知道自己练成了没有。他只知道，他没有停。": "He drilled until the night before the test. He did not know whether he had mastered it. He only knew he had not stopped.",
"把邀请函拿给父母看": "Show the invitation to his parents",
"父母笑了一晚，也愁了一晚。家里没有能让他变强的东西。他说：后山有。": "His parents laughed for one evening, and worried for one evening. There was nothing in the house that could make him stronger. He said: the back hill has.",
"把那七个字刻在床头的木板上": "Carve those seven words into the board at his bedside",
"字刻得很丑。第二天他起来，又练了一百遍起手式。": "The carving was ugly. He rose the next day and drilled the opening stance a hundred times more.",
"继任典礼": "The Succession Ceremony",
"二十四岁。继任典礼进行到一半，战场裂口里最后一只东西爬进了会台。会台上没有人动。": "Twenty-four. Halfway through the succession ceremony, the last thing from the battlefield rift crawled onto the stage. No one on the stage moved.",
"他在会台外面把那只东西按死，血没有溅进会台一步。第三任、第四任、第五任、第六任全都在场，连[X]战队的首领也在场——他们把这一击留给了他。会后有人问思源为什么选这个人，思源只说了一句：「他的天赋，是我的128倍。」": "He pinned the thing dead outside the stage. Not one drop of blood reached the stage. The third, fourth, fifth, and sixth were all present, and so was the Leader of [X] Team — they left this blow to him. Afterward someone asked Siyuan why he had chosen this man. Siyuan said one thing: \"His gift is 128 times mine.\"",
"一袋盐的路": "The Road for a Bag of Salt",
"家里让他去换一袋盐，顺路买半包糖。": "His family sent him to trade for a bag of salt, and to buy half a pack of sugar on the way.",
"母亲数了铜板，数了两遍，把多出来的一枚收了回去。": "His mother counted the coppers twice, and put the extra one back.",
"妹妹在门口等着。她只关心糖。": "His sister waited at the door. She cared only about the sugar.",
"从家到杂货铺要走四十分钟。路上能看见分部的运输舰从头顶过去，低得能听见声音。": "Home to the general store was a forty-minute walk. On the way you could see the branch transports pass overhead, low enough to hear.",
"分部就在那条路的尽头。他从来没进去过。学费是家里半年的收入。": "The branch stood at the end of that road. He had never gone in. The tuition was half a year of the family's income.",
"吃饭的时候父母又说了一次：今年还是算了。": "At the meal his parents said it again: this year, better to let it go.",
"他说：嗯。然后他把糖分了两份，一份给了妹妹。": "He said: yeah. Then he split the sugar in two and gave his sister one part.",
"他没有告诉他们，他每天都会绕到分部门口站一会儿，看墙上贴出来的名单。": "He did not tell them that every day he detoured to the branch gate and stood a while, reading the name lists posted on the wall.",
"十八岁被总部点名那天，他背的包袱里有一本抄得起了毛边的册子。": "On the day headquarters named him at eighteen, the bundle on his back held a ledger worn fuzzy at the edges from copying.",
"总部的长官接过去翻了一遍，什么都没问。": "The headquarters officer took it and flipped through it, and asked nothing.",
"把墙上的名字抄进自己的本子里": "Copy the names on the wall into his own ledger",
"他抄了小半年。抄到最后，那面墙上的名字他都认得。": "He copied for half a year or so. By the end he knew every name on that wall.",
"去杂货铺问刻名字的木牌多少钱": "Ask at the general store what a name-board costs",
"太贵了。他把铜板收回去，回家自己找了块削平的木板，用刀刻了三个字。": "Too expensive. He put the coppers back and found a smoothed board at home, and cut three words into it with a knife.",
"回家告诉父母：我不去了": "Go home and tell his parents: I'm not going",
"他说得很平静。母亲背过身去洗碗，洗了很久。": "He said it calmly. His mother turned away to wash dishes, and washed for a long time.",
"传送台前": "Before the Teleport Stage",
"总部的传送台在二层。每天有六班。": "Headquarters' teleport stage was on the second floor. Six departures a day.",
"思莉娅从早上就站在台子旁边。值班员换了三班，她还在。": "Siliya stood beside the stage from morning. The attendant changed shifts three times. She was still there.",
"值班员问她等谁。她说等一个从外圈来的人。": "The attendant asked whom she was waiting for. She said, a person from the outer ring.",
"「哪一班？」": "\"Which departure?\"",
"「我不知道。他自己也不知道。」": "\"I do not know. Neither does he.\"",
"她把手里的册子交给值班员，说：如果我走了，人来了，就给他。": "She handed the ledger in her hands to the attendant. If I leave and he comes, give it to him.",
"那本册子上抄的是一本字帖，每一页都是她自己写的。她写字本来就比他好看。": "The ledger held a copied copybook, every page in her own hand. Her writing had always been better than his.",
"——他走出传送台第七步的时候，看见她还站在那里，脚边放着一只空的杯子。": "— On the seventh step out from the teleport stage, he saw her still standing there, an empty cup at her feet.",
"他在总部第一次吃饭是在台子旁边的窗口。": "His first meal at headquarters was at the window beside the stage.",
"那天的菜很难吃。他全吃完了。": "The food that day was bad. He ate all of it.",
"走过去，把那本册子接过来": "Walk over and take the ledger",
"他接过来翻开。第一页上写着两个字：澜望。那是他家乡的名字。": "He took it and opened it. The first page held two words: Lanwang. The name of his homeworld.",
"先低头看自己的鞋": "Look down at his own shoes first",
"他低头看了一下。来的时候他跑丢过一只鞋，后来一直记着这件事。她说：这次没丢。": "He looked down. He had lost a shoe running there once, and never forgot it. She said: not this time.",
"问她等了多久": "Ask how long she has waited",
"「没算。」她说，「值班员换了三班，一天六班。」——她其实算过。": "\"I did not count,\" she said. \"The attendant changed shifts three times. Six departures a day.\" — She had counted.",
"7岁在田园小路上遇见思莉娅，11岁躲在树后偷看思源教剑，偷学了三年。14岁思莉娅要走了，他在传送台前知道了她的身份，她只用了口型说：「我会在[恒]组织等着你的。」测试那天，贵族子弟们没有一个瞧得起他，他拿下综合第二。18岁因分部功勋被思源一句话调进总部。20岁与思莉娅结婚。21岁目睹[恒]与[X]的联合，23岁在战场上看着金色的手掌把战死者全部复活。": "At seven he met Siliya on a country road. At eleven he hid behind a tree and watched Siyuan teach the sword, and stole three years of lessons. At fourteen Siliya was leaving; before the teleport stage he learned who she was, and she only mouthed: \"I will be waiting for you in the [Heng] Organization.\" On the day of the test, not one noble's child thought him worth a glance. He took second overall. At eighteen his branch service and one word from Siyuan moved him into headquarters. At twenty he married Siliya. At twenty-one he witnessed the union of [Heng] and [X]. At twenty-three he watched a golden palm raise every war dead on the battlefield.",
"澜望星出身 · 贫民之子": "Of Lanwang · Son of the Poor",
"思莉娅比他大两天。思源在台上看着自己的孙女站在传送台前等他。": "Siliya was two days older than him. Siyuan watched from the stage as his granddaughter stood before the teleport stage, waiting.",
"从分部基层功勋直达总部，与李耀辉配合几近无隙。": "From rank-and-file branch service straight to headquarters. With Li Yaohui, his coordination was all but seamless.",
"24 岁：第七任恒永者继任典礼，第三、四、五、六任与 [X] 战队首领全部在场": "Age 24: the succession ceremony of the seventh Eternal. The third, fourth, fifth, and sixth, and the Leader of [X] Team, all present",
"降神·罗岚·倩安": "Descent · Luo Lan · Qian'an",
"他学东西快得不像话——这一招他只看过一遍。": "He learns absurdly fast — he saw this move only once.",
"我要八块折断的剑刃。别问我做什么——问了我也不会说。": "I want eight broken sword blades. Do not ask me what for — ask, and I still will not say.",
"她听着祖父的故事长大。十岁那年她想学恒之技法，祖父摸了摸她的头，说女孩家家别想着撑天。\n她没听进去。她用了187年，把这句话还了回去。": "She grew up on her grandfather's stories. At ten she wanted to learn the Heng arts. Her grandfather patted her head and said a girl should not think about holding up the sky.\nShe did not take it in. It took her 187 years to hand the words back.",
"「撑天者累的时候，稳固天下的人，也可以是我。」": "\"When the one holding up the sky is tired, the one who steadies the world can also be me.\"",
"祖父的手": "Her Grandfather's Hand",
"十岁那年，她终于见到了自己的祖父。": "At ten she finally met her grandfather.",
"她把自己的想法一口气说完：我要学恒之技法，我要成为像您和父亲那样的人。": "She said all of it in one breath: I want to learn the Heng arts. I want to become someone like you and my father.",
"祖父听完了。他没有教她，只是伸手摸了摸她的头。": "Her grandfather listened to the end. He did not teach her. He only reached out and patted her head.",
"「女孩家家的别想着怎么撑住这片天。只要你能在撑天者累的时候稳固天下就行了。」": "\"A girl should not think about how to hold up this sky. It is enough that you steady the world when the one holding up the sky is tired.\"",
"不服：我要自己走一遍": "Defiant: I will walk the whole road myself",
"她没有听进去。她只是更加想要跟着他学习。\n无奈之下，思源在下次离开组织的时候，带着她一起走了。": "She did not take it in. She only wanted more to learn from him.\nIn the end Siyuan had no choice. The next time he left the Organization, he took her with him.",
"先答应他，再偷偷练": "Agree first, then train in secret",
"她点头说好，回去就把五脉的谱背了下来。她背了整整九年。": "She nodded and said yes. Back home she memorized the charts of the five lineages. It took her nine years.",
"问他：那稳固天下的人，算不算撑天的人": "Ask him: does the one who steadies the world count as one who holds up the sky",
"祖父愣了一下，很久没说话。最后他说：「算。」——那是他第一次改口。": "Her grandfather paused. For a long time he said nothing. At last he said: \"Yes.\" That was the first time he took it back.",
"八十年": "Eighty Years",
"思源带着她走了八十年。八十年里她见过的东西，比一个分部图书馆还多。": "Siyuan took her with him for eighty years. In those eighty years she saw more than a branch library holds.",
"她九十岁了。她对思源说：我想自己去分部。用最低的身份。": "She was ninety. She told Siyuan: I want to go to a branch on my own. With the lowest rank.",
"从最底层": "From the Bottom",
"她隐瞒身份，进入第7分部，从最低层级做起。": "She hid her identity and entered the 7th branch, starting at the lowest level.",
"又是八十年。她一路做到了高层级。": "Another eighty years. She worked her way up to the upper levels.",
"一百七十岁，她成为了恒组织第7分部掌舵。": "At one hundred and seventy she became the head of the 7th branch of the Heng Organization.",
"这期间她为整个组织谋得了巨大的利益：组织更加和谐，其他中立组织向恒组织更加靠拢。": "In that time she won the whole Organization great gains. It grew more unified, and other neutral organizations drew closer to Heng.",
"把「功勋」全换成组织的基础建设": "Trade all her \"merit\" for the Organization's basic infrastructure",
"她没有给自己留一份。她说：撑天的人不用我修房子，我要修的是地基。": "She kept none for herself. She said: the one who holds up the sky does not need me to build his house. What I build is the foundation.",
"先去把分部里最难的账平掉": "Settle the branch's hardest accounts first",
"她把分部的账目全部重排了一遍。三年之后，第7分部的效率是总部前十。": "She reworked every account in the branch. Three years later the 7th branch ranked in the top ten of headquarters for efficiency.",
"亲自去接那些从异界带回来的孩子": "Go herself to receive the children brought back from other worlds",
"她记住了每一个孩子的生日。她说：祖父当年也是这么记住我的。": "She memorized every child's birthday. She said: that is how my grandfather remembered me.",
"黑马": "Dark Horse",
"第八任恒永者选任期间，她像一匹黑马，冲在了最前线。": "During the selection of the eighth Eternal she ran at the front like a dark horse.",
"她是恒永者任选中第一个各项能力除了战力以外全部满分的人。": "She was the first in an Eternal selection to score full marks in every category but combat.",
"父女拔刀": "Father and Daughter Draw Blades",
"「你知不知道你抢的是谁的位子。」——罗岚·倩安站在她对面，手已经按在了刀上。": "\"Do you know whose seat you are taking.\" Luo Lan · Qian'an stood across from her, hand already on the blade.",
"她输了。她没法击败自己的父亲。第八任恒永者的位置，再次空缺。": "She lost. She could not defeat her own father. The seat of the eighth Eternal stood vacant again.",
"万古神骸域": "The Domain of Ancient Godbones",
"一个恒永者除了思源以外基本都不敢轻易进入的区域。她独自走了进去。": "A region no Eternal but Siyuan dared enter lightly. She walked in alone.",
"她在里面活到了196岁。无数陨落的神明认可了她——她成了恒永者中第一位成神的存在。": "She lived to one hundred and ninety-six inside. Countless fallen gods acknowledged her. She became the first of the Eternals to ascend.",
"神骸把她压回了入口。她坐在域外想了三天，然后又走了进去。": "The godbones pressed her back to the entrance. She sat outside the Domain for three days, then walked in again.",
"一句话": "One Sentence",
"她回到恒组织，当众与父亲拔刀相向。": "She returned to the Heng Organization and drew blades against her father before everyone.",
"就在她即将刺杀的瞬间，萧冉出手制止了这场父女闹剧。": "At the instant before the strike, Xiao Ran moved and stopped this farce between father and daughter.",
"三名恒永者同意让她面壁首任恒永者石像思过100年。": "Three Eternals agreed she should be confined before the stone statue of the first Eternal for 100 years.",
"最终，被第三任恒永者思源一句话否决。": "In the end the third Eternal, Siyuan, struck it down with one sentence.",
"「有弑父之举，就罚她上任后100年内不得行使恒永者之权，跟我出去历练。」": "\"For an attempt at patricide, she is barred from exercising an Eternal's authority for 100 years after taking office. She comes with me to temper herself.\"",
"「至于倩安——去面壁500年。想清楚你是怎么教女儿的。」": "\"As for Qian'an. Five hundred years of confinement. Think through how you raised your daughter.\"",
"197岁那年，她成为第八任恒永者，成为第一位女性恒永者兼政治系恒永者，实力排行恒永者第三。": "At one hundred and ninety-seven she became the eighth Eternal, the first woman Eternal and the first political Eternal, ranked third among Eternals in strength.",
"在那之后，她跟着思源历练去了。": "After that she went with Siyuan to temper herself.",
"域中一百九十六年": "One Hundred and Ninety-Six Years in the Domain",
"万古神骸域。一个恒永者除了思源以外基本都不敢轻易进去的区域。她一个人走了进去。里面的东西不问她为什么来，只问她撑不撑得住。": "The Domain of Ancient Godbones. A region no Eternal but Siyuan dared enter lightly. She walked in alone. What was inside did not ask why she came. It only asked whether she could hold.",
"她在里面待到了196岁。陨落的神明一个接一个地认可了她。恒永者中第一位成神者，从这里走出来。": "She stayed inside until one hundred and ninety-six. The fallen gods acknowledged her one after another. The first of the Eternals to ascend walked out from here.",
"她第一次进去，只撑了七天。第八天她自己走出来的，走出去的时候还站得直。": "The first time she went in she lasted seven days. On the eighth she walked out on her own, and she was still standing straight.",
"任选后空着的位置": "The Seat Left Empty After the Selection",
"她赢了选举，又输给了自己的父亲。第八任恒永者的位置，再次空着。邪教就在这一年动了。": "She won the selection, then lost to her own father. The seat of the eighth Eternal stood empty again. That was the year the Cult moved.",
"她把第7分部守住了。她没有恒永者的名号，也没有恒永者的权。她只有一个分部，和一群愿意跟着她的人。": "She held the 7th branch. She had no title of Eternal and no authority of one. She had one branch, and people willing to follow her.",
"第7分部的墙倒了一面。她带人退到第二道墙后面，把伤员放在了最里面。": "One wall of the 7th branch fell. She led the retreat behind the second wall and put the wounded deepest inside.",
"刀尖停在半寸": "The Blade Stops Half an Inch Short",
"196岁那年，她从万古神骸域出来。": "At one hundred and ninety-six she came out of the Domain of Ancient Godbones.",
"她回到[恒]组织，当着所有人的面，跟自己的父亲拔刀相向。": "She returned to the [Heng] Organization and, before everyone, drew blades against her father.",
"这是[恒]组织有史以来第一次，恒永者与恒永者之间的战斗。父女之间。": "It was the first time in the history of the [Heng] Organization that Eternal fought Eternal. Father against daughter.",
"刀尖离罗岚·倩安的喉咙还有半寸。": "The tip of the blade was half an inch from Luo Lan · Qian'an's throat.",
"「够了。」": "\"Enough.\"",
"第六任恒永者萧冉出手，止住了这场闹剧。": "The sixth Eternal, Xiao Ran, moved and stopped the farce.",
"三名恒永者主张：罚她面壁第一任恒永者石像，100年。第三任恒永者思源否决了。": "Three Eternals proposed she be confined before the stone statue of the first Eternal for 100 years. The third Eternal, Siyuan, vetoed it.",
"197岁，她成为第八任恒永者。第一位女性恒永者，第一位政治系恒永者。实力排在恒永者第三。": "At one hundred and ninety-seven she became the eighth Eternal. The first woman Eternal. The first political Eternal. Third among Eternals in strength.",
"「这次出去，我不教你招式。」": "\"This time out, I will not teach you technique.\"",
"「我教你看，一个人是怎么撑住的。」": "\"I will teach you to watch how a person holds.\"",
"先去看父亲面壁的那面墙": "Go first to the wall where her father is confined",
"她站在墙外看了很久，没有说话。她父亲也没有回头。她转身走了。": "She stood outside the wall a long time and said nothing. Her father did not turn around. She turned and left.",
"把第7分部的账本交给接班人": "Hand the 7th branch's ledger to her successor",
"她把每一页都签了名。她说：地基是我修的，房子不是我的。": "She signed every page. She said: I built the foundation. The house is not mine.",
"跟着思源走出组织大门": "Walk out the Organization's gate behind Siyuan",
"她跟在他后面。一百年，她一句怨言也没有。——她终于学会了怎么在撑天者累的时候，稳固天下。": "She followed behind him. For a hundred years she never once complained. She had finally learned how to steady the world when the one holding up the sky is tired.",
"抄错的会议记录": "The Meeting Minutes She Copied Wrong",
"她进第7分部的时候，报的是最低层级。分到的活是抄会议记录。": "When she entered the 7th branch she registered at the lowest level. She was assigned to copy meeting minutes.",
"第一周，她把同一份记录抄错了三遍。": "The first week she copied the same minutes wrong three times.",
"第一遍漏了一段；第二遍把「暂缓」抄成了「照办」；第三遍都对，但抄在本子的反面。": "The first time she dropped a paragraph. The second she copied \"hold off\" as \"carry out.\" The third was correct, but written on the back of the notebook.",
"档案室的前辈把三遍一起摔在她桌上，问她：你是不会写字还是不会听话。": "The senior from the archives threw all three on her desk and asked: can you not write, or can you not listen.",
"「都不会。」": "\"Neither.\"",
"那个人气得笑了一下，让她重抄。那天她抄到很晚，走廊的灯都灭了。": "The man laughed once out of anger and told her to copy it again. She copied late that night. The hallway lights went out.",
"第二天她把一个月的记录一起交了上来。前辈翻了一遍，说：这次只错了一个字。": "The next day she handed in a month of minutes at once. The senior flipped through them and said: one character wrong this time.",
"她在最低的工位上坐了很久。": "She sat at the lowest desk for a long time.",
"档案室的灯管是整层最暗的一根。她没有让人换。": "The tube light in the archives was the dimmest on the floor. She did not have it changed.",
"把那一个字也改掉，重抄第七遍": "Fix that one character too. Copy it out a seventh time",
"她把那一段拆开重抄了七遍。后来那一段被台长留下了，说是全分部最清楚的一份。": "She broke that passage apart and copied it seven times. Later the head of the stage kept it, saying it was the clearest copy in the whole branch.",
"去问前辈：为什么「暂缓」和「照办」不能抄混": "Ask the senior: why can \"hold off\" and \"carry out\" not be mixed up",
"「因为底下的人只看这两个字。」前辈说，「他们不看全文。」她把这句记在了本子第一页。": "\"Because the people below only read those two characters,\" the senior said. \"They do not read the rest.\" She wrote that line on the first page of her notebook.",
"先弄清整层楼每个工位在做什么": "First learn what every desk on the floor does",
"她花了两周，把整层楼的活路走了一遍。她画的图后来一直贴在档案室的柜门内侧。": "She spent two weeks walking the whole floor's work routes. The chart she drew stayed taped inside the archive cabinet door.",
"八十年里的一本账": "One Ledger from Eighty Years",
"思源带她出去的时候，第一件事是让她在每个地方记账。": "When Siyuan first took her out, the first thing he had her do was keep accounts everywhere.",
"账上写：今天住了哪里，吃了什么，花了多少，跟谁说了话。": "The ledger recorded: where she stayed today, what she ate, what she spent, who she spoke to.",
"他从不看她写了什么。他只看月底她能不能把总数对上。": "He never read what she wrote. He only checked whether the totals balanced at month's end.",
"有一次在星港，船晚了十一天。她天天去柜台问班次，问回来就记一行。": "Once at the starport the ship was eleven days late. Every day she went to the counter to ask about departures, and every time she came back she wrote a line.",
"那十一天的账她算错了一笔，差三个铜板。": "In those eleven days she got one entry wrong, off by three copper coins.",
"「补上。账不平，别的都别谈。」": "\"Make it up. If the ledger does not balance, we discuss nothing else.\"",
"——八十年，她记的账摞起来很高。": "Eighty years. The ledgers she kept stacked high.",
"那天夜里她又把总数算了一遍。": "That night she added the totals again.",
"平了。她在最后一行的下面画了一道横线。": "It balanced. She drew a line under the last row.",
"把八十年每一笔都留着": "Keep every entry from the eighty years",
"她一本都没扔。摞在一起，比她的行李还重。": "She threw away none of them. Stacked together they were heavier than her luggage.",
"去问他：记这些有什么用": "Ask him: what use is keeping these",
"「撑天的人不看招式。」他说，「他看的是每天有没有数。」她没有再问。": "\"The one who holds up the sky does not look at technique,\" he said. \"He looks at whether every day has its numbers.\" She did not ask again.",
"把自己算错的那几笔单独抄一份": "Copy the entries she got wrong into a separate book",
"她抄了一小本。后来她接手第7分部的账，第一件事就是拿这本去对。": "She copied a small book. Later, when she took over the 7th branch's accounts, the first thing she did was check against it.",
"她听着祖父的故事长大。10岁那年她想去学恒之技法，祖父只摸了摸她的头。她没听进去，跟着他走了80年；90岁隐瞒身份进入第7分部最低层级，170岁做到掌舵。第八任选任时她像一匹黑马冲在最前，成了恒永者任选中第一个除了战力全项满分的人。父亲因此震怒，父女拔刀相向。她败了，便只身进入万古神骸域，196岁才出来，成为恒永者中第一位成神者。最终她在即将刺杀父亲的瞬间被萧冉制止，思源一句话定下：她成为第八任，父亲去面壁500年。": "She grew up on her grandfather's stories. At ten she wanted to learn the Heng arts. Her grandfather only patted her head. She did not take it in, and followed him for 80 years. At ninety she hid her identity and entered the lowest level of the 7th branch. At one hundred and seventy she became its head. In the selection of the eighth she ran at the front like a dark horse, the first in an Eternal selection to score full marks in every category but combat. Her father was enraged, and father and daughter drew blades. She lost, and went alone into the Domain of Ancient Godbones. She came out at one hundred and ninety-six, the first of the Eternals to ascend. In the end, at the instant before she struck her father down, Xiao Ran stopped her. Siyuan settled it in one sentence: she became the eighth, and her father went to 500 years of confinement.",
"197岁受位 · 出身总部": "Took the seat at 197 · from headquarters",
"「女孩家家的别想着怎么撑住这片天。」——祖父摸了摸她的头。": "\"A girl should not think about how to hold up this sky.\" Her grandfather patted her head.",
"从第7分部最底层做到掌舵，只身入万古神骸域，得无数陨落神明认可。": "From the lowest level of the 7th branch to its head. Entered the Domain of Ancient Godbones alone. Acknowledged by countless fallen gods.",
"197 岁：第一次夺位被父亲击败、位子空缺之后，第二次就任": "Age 197: after her first bid was defeated by her father and the seat stood vacant, she took office on the second attempt",
"降神·思慧妍": "Descent · Sihuiyan",
"一整片神骸的认可压在这一击上。她没有用剑，像是不屑。": "The acknowledgement of a whole field of godbones presses on this one strike. She did not use a sword, as if she disdained to.",
"在无垠厅赢五场。连胜会让经验翻倍，输了就当没这回事。": "Win five matches in the Boundless Hall. Consecutive wins double experience. A loss, and it never happened.",
"五岁那晚他偷偷跟着思源离开了蓝星。思源发现后，答应了。\n他被带进「现实一天、里世界五年」的地方，待到九岁——六十六万六千一百二十五年。": "At five, that night, he secretly followed Siyuan away from Blue Star. Siyuan found out, and agreed.\nHe was taken to a place where one day in reality was five years in the inner world. He stayed there until he was nine. Six hundred sixty-six thousand one hundred twenty-five years.",
"「恒永者不该只在会台上。」": "\"An Eternal should not stay only on the stage.\"",
"蓝星的那一夜": "That Night on Blue Star",
"四岁那年他了解了父亲和母亲的身份，然后决定独立。": "At four, he learned who his father and mother were. Then he decided to stand alone.",
"五岁那年，他在大半夜看见思源准备离开蓝星。": "At five, in the middle of the night, he saw Siyuan preparing to leave Blue Star.",
"他跟了上去。跟了三个传送站，直到思源停下脚步，没有回头。": "He followed. Three teleport stations, until Siyuan stopped, without turning around.",
"「跟够了吗？」": "\"Followed long enough?\"",
"说出自己的目的": "State your purpose",
"先跪下再说话": "Kneel first, then speak",
"反问他：您又为什么走": "Ask him instead: why are you leaving",
"「我到处乱逛。」思源说，「你要跟着，就得跟上。」": "\"I wander.\" Siyuan said. \"If you want to follow, you keep up.\"",
"666125年": "666,125 Years",
"里世界。除了寿命，什么都可以增长；什么伤都瞬间恢复。他要在里面待到自己九岁。": "The inner world. Everything grows there except lifespan. Every wound heals in an instant. He was to stay inside until he turned nine.",
"他觉醒了虚无之力，也觉醒了祖父李耀辉的血脉「S」行风痕和艾克斯-德洛歌之眼。": "He awakened the power of Nothingness. He also awakened his grandfather Li Yaohui's bloodline, the \"S\" Wind Scar, and the Eyes of Ex-Delgo.",
"第二次全面战争": "The Second Comprehensive War",
"走出里世界的那一刻，他不会压制力量。整个多元宇宙动荡。第二次恒[X]全面战争，就此开启。": "The moment he walked out of the inner world, he could not suppress his power. The whole multiverse shook. The second Eternal[X] comprehensive war began there.",
"十岁的他冲了上去。父子二人同为虚无之主，配合得极其默契——他们把[X]首领逼到了使出最终形态。": "At ten, he charged. Father and son, both Void Lords, moved in perfect accord. They forced the [X] Leader to use his final form.",
"他被压了回来。萧冉从旁边冲出来，父子俩并肩站在一起。最终[X]首领被恒思源挡在了中间，战争止于第二次和平。": "He was driven back. Xiao Ran charged out from the side. Father and son stood shoulder to shoulder. In the end Eternal Siyuan put himself between them and the [X] Leader. The war ended in the second peace.",
"被骂": "Scolded",
"战后，李雅惠把萧冉和萧雅辉都批评了一顿。": "After the war, Li Yahui reprimanded both Xiao Ran and Xiao Yahui.",
"恒思源也被自己的妻子思晓雅骂了一顿。": "Heng Siyuan was reprimanded by his own wife, Si Xiaoya.",
"然后萧雅辉跟着恒思源，带着多名成员，去帮下层成员恢复家园。": "Then Xiao Yahui followed Heng Siyuan, took several members, and went to help the lower-ranking members rebuild their homes.",
"他在废墟里待了很久。他第一次看见：会台之外的地方，才是组织的大部分。": "He stayed in the ruins a long time. For the first time he saw it: what lay outside the stage was most of the Organization.",
"把家先修给最弱的那一户": "Rebuild first for the weakest household",
"他把最破的那间屋子最后修。他说：先让还能干活的人有地方住，弱的人我来背。": "He repaired the most broken house last. He said, let those who can still work have a place to sleep first. I will carry the weak.",
"在所有分部的公告栏上贴一份名单": "Post one list on every branch notice board",
"他把战死者的名字一个个抄出来，贴在了每一个分部。他说：记着，比纪念重要。": "He copied out the names of the war dead one by one and posted them at every branch. He said, remembering matters more than memorializing.",
"去找父亲，说想再打一次": "Go to his father and ask for another fight",
"萧冉愣了一下，然后笑了：「先吃饭。」": "Xiao Ran paused. Then he smiled. \"Eat first.\"",
"逼出最终形态": "Forcing Out the Final Form",
"十五岁，萧冉和思源一起全面训练他。训练场上的那个人，终于认真了。": "At fifteen, Xiao Ran and Siyuan trained him fully. The man on the training ground was finally serious.",
"这一次他打成了平手。组织里开始流传：萧雅辉逼出了第三任恒永者的最终形态。": "This time he fought to a draw. Word spread through the Organization: Xiao Yahui had forced out the final form of the third Eternal.",
"第九任": "The Ninth",
"十五岁那年，正巧是恒永者每800年选一次的时候。他参加了。": "At fifteen, it happened to be the year the Eternal was chosen, once every eight hundred years. He entered.",
"最终拿下全方面除了布局外的全科满分，综合第一。": "In the end he took full marks in every subject but strategy, and first place overall.",
"再加上参与过第二次恒[X]全面战争、还与第六任恒永者合作几乎将[X]首领打入下风，是大功一件。": "Add to that his part in the second Eternal[X] comprehensive war, and his work with the sixth Eternal, which almost put the [X] Leader at a disadvantage. That was one great merit.",
"最终以恒组织前100分部全掌舵者认同，他成为了第九任恒永者——第一位执法型恒永者。": "In the end, with the assent of every helmsman of the Eternal Organization's top one hundred branches, he became the ninth Eternal. The first Enforcer-type Eternal.",
"两年后，他研读了各种书，其中也有关于社会主义的书。": "Two years later he read through many books, among them books on socialism.",
"就此，他成为了第一个常常待在底层成员之间的恒永者，也成为组织内外除第三任恒永者外最知名的恒永者。": "So he became the first Eternal to spend his time among the lower-ranking members, and the most famous Eternal within and outside the Organization after the third.",
"三岁的棋": "A Game at Three",
"他一岁会说话，会走路，会跑，会识字。": "At one he could speak, walk, run, and read.",
"两岁，他学会了多元平行宇宙通用语。": "At two he learned the common tongue of the multiverse.",
"三岁那年，他坐在父亲对面下棋。他赢了。不止一次。": "At three he sat across from his father and played chess. He won. More than once.",
"「再来。」": "\"Again.\"",
"四岁，他知道了父亲是谁、母亲是谁，也知道了这个家背后站着什么。": "At four he knew who his father was, who his mother was, and what stood behind that house.",
"然后他做了一个决定：他要独立。": "Then he made a decision: he would stand alone.",
"那年冬天，他把父亲的那副棋摆回原样。": "That winter he set his father's chess set back the way it had been.",
"他没有告诉任何人：他已经决定要走了。": "He told no one: he had already decided to leave.",
"把赢父亲的那盘棋复盘三十遍": "Replay the game he won against his father thirty times",
"他发现父亲每一盘都留了三分力。他把那三分也记了下来。": "He found that his father had held back three parts of his strength every game. He recorded those three parts as well.",
"去问母亲李雅惠：蓝星外面是什么": "Ask his mother Li Yahui: what lies beyond Blue Star",
"李雅惠讲了一夜。他听完，只说了一句：我知道了。": "Li Yahui talked all night. When she finished, he said only one thing: I know.",
"每天比父亲早起一个时辰": "Rise one hour before his father every day",
"他起得比谁都早。萧冉发现的时候，他已经在院子里站了三个月的桩。": "He rose earlier than anyone. When Xiao Ran found out, he had already stood in the yard holding his stance for three months.",
"第六十六万次": "The Six Hundred Sixty-Six Thousandth Time",
"里世界。现实一天，里面五年。他从五岁待到九岁。这里没有敌人，唯一一直站在他对面的，是他自己。": "The inner world. One day in reality, five years inside. He stayed from five to nine. There was no enemy here. The only one who stood across from him was himself.",
"现实里过了四年，里面过了666125年。他觉醒了虚无之力，觉醒了祖父李耀辉的血脉「S」型风痕，也觉醒了艾克斯-德洛歌之眼。": "Four years passed in reality. 666,125 years passed inside. He awakened the power of Nothingness, the bloodline of his grandfather Li Yaohui, the \"S\" type Wind Scar, and the Eyes of Ex-Delgo.",
"他又死了一次。里世界把他拼好，推到起点。第几次了，他已经不数了。": "He died again. The inner world put him back together and pushed him to the start. Which time this was, he no longer counted.",
"父子联手": "Father and Son",
"十岁，他冲出里世界，不会压制力量。整个多元平行宇宙动荡。第二次恒与[X]的全面战争，就此开始。他冲上去，单挑[X]的那位思源。": "At ten he charged out of the inner world, unable to suppress his power. The whole multiverse shook. The second comprehensive war between Eternal and [X] began there. He charged in and faced that Siyuan of [X] alone.",
"他落了下风——十岁的身体还没有长成。萧冉冲了出来。两位虚无之主并肩站着，配合得没有一丝空隙，把[X]的那位逼到了最终形态。最后，恒思源挡在了中间，战争止于第二次和平。后来有人问他为什么当恒永者，他说：「恒永者不该只在会台上。」": "He fell behind. A ten-year-old body had not yet grown. Xiao Ran charged out. Two Void Lords stood shoulder to shoulder, moving without a single gap, and forced that one of [X] into his final form. In the end Eternal Siyuan stood between them, and the war ended in the second peace. Later someone asked him why he became an Eternal. He said, \"An Eternal should not stay only on the stage.\"",
"他退了七步，膝盖砸进地里。一只手从后面按住了他的肩。": "He fell back seven steps, his knees driving into the ground. A hand pressed down on his shoulder from behind.",
"蓝星家里的规矩": "The Rules of the House on Blue Star",
"蓝星的那个家里，东西都放得很低。": "In that house on Blue Star, everything was kept low.",
"他够得着。一岁那年，他会说话，会走路，会认字。家里人不觉得这是好事。": "He could reach it. At one he could speak, walk, and read. The family did not think this was a good thing.",
"两岁，多元平行宇宙通用语自己就会了。他坐在门槛上听大人谈事情，大人换了三种语言，他跟上了三种。": "At two the common tongue of the multiverse came to him on its own. He sat on the doorstep listening to the adults talk. The adults switched through three languages. He followed all three.",
"三岁，他坐到父亲对面下棋。": "At three he sat down across from his father to play chess.",
"赢了。第二天又赢。第三天他把棋盘收好，说这盘不算。": "He won. The next day he won again. On the third day he put the board away and said this game did not count.",
"「为什么不算。」": "\"Why does it not count.\"",
"「您留了力。」": "\"You held back.\"",
"萧冉没说话，重新摆了一盘。": "Xiao Ran said nothing. He set up the board again.",
"他四岁那年知道了父亲是谁、母亲是谁。": "At four he learned who his father was, and who his mother was.",
"也知道了这个家背后站着什么。他把箱子从床底推回了原位。": "He also learned what stood behind that house. He pushed the box back under the bed, to where it had been.",
"从此每天比父亲早起一个时辰": "From then on, rise an hour before his father every day",
"他自己在院子里站桩。李雅惠出来看过两次，第二次给他披了一件衣服。": "He held his stance in the yard alone. Li Yahui came out to look twice. The second time she put a coat over him.",
"把母亲讲过的每一门语言都记在本子上": "Write down every language his mother taught him in a notebook",
"本子记到第四本的时候，李雅惠才发现。她把前三本收进了柜子最上层。": "It was at the fourth notebook that Li Yahui found out. She put the first three on the top shelf of the cabinet.",
"四岁那天，收拾好自己的东西": "On the day he turned four, pack up his things",
"跟着思源做事的人": "The One Who Worked Under Siyuan",
"他跟着思源做事的那几年，学的第一样不是本事，是规矩。": "In the years he worked under Siyuan, the first thing he learned was not skill. It was order.",
"名册要先看点名的那一栏。名单上的人，死活得有数。": "With the ledger, read the roll-call column first. Every name on the list had to be accounted for, dead or alive.",
"发的东西先给最偏的那个分部，再按路远近往回收。": "What was handed out went to the most outlying branch first, then back along the road, near to far.",
"去别人家里，先脱鞋，再抬手。": "In someone else's house, take off your shoes first. Then raise your hand.",
"思源只讲过一遍。他记了。": "Siyuan said it once. He remembered it.",
"十五岁，他当上了第九任恒永者。会台上站着的人换了，他的座位也换了。": "At fifteen he became the ninth Eternal. The man standing on the stage had changed. So had his seat.",
"换座位的第二天，他抱着自己的凳子走下了会台。": "The day after he changed seats, he carried his own stool down off the stage.",
"第十一分部的登记处没有给他倒茶。他自己找了个空位坐下，坐了一整个下午。": "The registry office of the eleventh branch did not pour him tea. He found an empty seat himself and sat there the whole afternoon.",
"有人去问思源：他懂规矩是不是您教的。": "Someone went and asked Siyuan: did you teach him the rules.",
"「规矩不用教。看他肯不肯先脱鞋。」": "\"Rules do not need teaching. See whether he takes off his shoes first.\"",
"在第十一分部待满了一个月": "Stay a full month at the eleventh branch",
"他跟着那名登记员学怎么写名册。登记员后来跟人说：他写一天，手也抖一天。": "He learned from that registrar how to keep the ledger. The registrar later told people: he writes for a day, his hand shakes for a day.",
"把会台上那份座次表抄了一份": "Copy the seating chart from the stage",
"他抄的时候听见后面有人小声说：新来的那个，好像什么都要抄一遍。": "As he copied it, he heard someone behind him say quietly: the new one seems to copy everything once.",
"回蓝星，把家里那张棋盘带走": "Go back to Blue Star and take the chess board from home",
"棋盘带走了。箱子和本子还留在床底。": "He took the board. The box and the notebooks stayed under the bed.",
"1岁会说话走路识字，2岁懂通用语，3岁下棋赢父亲多次，4岁决定独立，5岁跟踪思源离开蓝星，被带进「现实一天、里世界五年」的地方待到9岁——666125年。走出里世界时他不会压制力量，整个多元宇宙动荡，第二次恒[X]全面战争爆发。10岁的他冲上去和[X]首领打，父子二人配合，把对方逼得使出最终形态。15岁参加竞选，除布局外全科满分。他成了第一个常常待在底层成员之间的恒永者。": "Spoke, walked and read at one. Knew the common tongue at two. Beat his father at chess several times at three. Decided to stand alone at four. At five he followed Siyuan away from Blue Star and was taken to a place where one day in reality was five years in the inner world. He stayed until nine. 666,125 years. When he walked out of the inner world he could not suppress his power. The whole multiverse shook. The second Eternal[X] comprehensive war broke out. At ten he charged in and fought the [X] Leader. Father and son together forced the other into his final form. At fifteen he entered the election and took full marks in every subject but strategy. He became the first Eternal to spend his time among the lower-ranking members.",
"5岁入里世界 · 9岁出 · 15岁受位": "Entered the inner world at five — left at nine — took the seat at fifteen",
"5岁那晚他偷偷跟着思源离开蓝星，思源发现后答应了。": "At five, that night, he secretly followed Siyuan away from Blue Star. Siyuan found out, and agreed.",
"666125年训练，觉醒虚无之力与祖父李耀辉的血脉「S」行风痕。": "666,125 years of training. He awakened the power of Nothingness and his grandfather Li Yaohui's bloodline, the \"S\" Wind Scar.",
"15 岁：每 800 年一次的恒永者选举，除布局外全科满分": "Age 15: the Eternal election held once every 800 years. Full marks in every subject but strategy",
"降神·萧雅辉": "Descent — Xiao Yahui",
"他把恒之剑法摆成了一道条款，然后当场执行。": "He laid the Heng Sword Arts out as a single clause, then executed it on the spot.",
"练到 Lv.14。别靠运气——靠练。": "Train to Lv.14. Do not rely on luck. Rely on training.",
"他一口气说完。思源转过身来看了他很久，然后说：「行。」\n思源带着他去了自己十岁那年待过的地方——现实一天，里世界五年。": "He said all of it in one breath. Siyuan turned and looked at him for a long time. Then he said, \"Fine.\"\nSiyuan took him to the place he himself had stayed at ten. One day in reality, five years in the inner world.",
"他跪了下来。思源把他拎起来：「我这里不兴这个。你要什么，站着说。」": "He knelt. Siyuan lifted him up by the collar. \"We do not do that here. If you want something, say it standing.\"",
"他用一个箱子装完了自己全部的东西，拎起来试了一下重量。然后他放下箱子，去吃饭了。": "He packed everything he owned into one box and lifted it to test the weight. Then he set the box down and went to eat.",
"他生来好看，被父母早早送进偶像圈。二十三岁成为超级明星，也得到星辰的认可。\n一百八十六岁那年，他向李耀辉申请：核弹头来袭时，西区交给我。": "He was born good-looking. His parents sent him into the idol circle early. At twenty-three he became a superstar, and the stars acknowledged him.\nAt one hundred eighty-six he applied to Li Yaohui: when the warheads come, leave the West District to me.",
"「西区交给我。」": "\"Leave the West District to me.\"",
"九岁的思源": "Siyuan at Nine",
"五岁那年，他参与了第三任恒永者纪录片，演的是九岁时期的思源。": "At five he took part in the third Eternal's documentary. He played Siyuan at nine.",
"导演让他揣摩那个角色的心境。他把思源的档案读了七遍。": "The director told him to get inside that role's state of mind. He read Siyuan's file seven times.",
"拍完最后一场——一个人拖着比他身体还大的头颅走回战线尽头——他在片场坐了很久。": "After the last scene — one person dragging a head larger than his own body back to the end of the front — he sat on the set a long time.",
"把那一幕在脑子里重演一百遍": "Replay that scene in his mind a hundred times",
"他终于懂了：那不是帅，那是有人把一件不该由孩子承担的事，一个人担完了。": "He finally understood: that was not looking good. Someone had carried a thing no child should carry, alone, to the end.",
"去问剧组的老人：当年战场上是什么样": "Ask the old man on the crew: what was the battlefield like back then",
"老人讲了两个小时，最后说：「孩子，你演不像的。你眼睛里没有那个东西。」": "The old man talked for two hours, then said: \"Kid, you will never play him right. That thing is not in your eyes.\"",
"开始加练恒之拳法和腿法": "Add extra drills in the Heng Fist Arts and Leg Arts",
"他从那天开始练拳。他说：我演过他，我就得配得上演他。": "He began training his fists that day. He said: I played him, so I have to be worth playing him.",
"星辰的认可": "The Stars' Acknowledgement",
"他二十三岁成为与师傅同级的超级明星。也是在同一天，星辰认可了他，也认可了他的妹妹。": "At twenty-three he became a superstar at his Master's level. The same day, the stars acknowledged him, and acknowledged his sister.",
"这是星辰第一次同时认可两个人。他把妹妹扛在肩上，转了一整圈。": "It was the first time the stars acknowledged two people at once. He put his sister on his shoulder and turned a full circle.",
"186岁：西区": "186: The West District",
"敌人准备对整个恒组织科技区发射核弹头。李耀辉赶到。他跑上去，申请独自抗住西区。": "The enemy prepared to fire a nuclear warhead at the whole Heng Organization tech district. Li Yaohui arrived. He ran up and applied to hold the West District alone.",
"他抗住了。星辰之力在他掌下铺成了整片夜空。他在最后还对着镜头笑了一下。": "He held it. The power of the stars spread under his palm into a whole night sky. At the end he still smiled once at the camera.",
"西区的建筑塌了一半。他跪在废墟里，第一次知道：光环挡不住核弹，力量才能。": "Half the buildings in the West District came down. He knelt in the rubble and learned for the first time: a halo cannot stop a warhead. Only power can.",
"铁幕": "Iron Curtain",
"敌军将领站在指挥舰的残骸上。他说：「一个明星，能打出什么来？」": "The enemy general stood on the wreck of his command ship. He said: \"A superstar. What can he hit?\"",
"他把那句话原样还了回去，然后从残骸上走了下来。": "He gave the words back as they were, then walked down from the wreck.",
"第十任": "The Tenth",
"二百四十五岁，恒组织再次召开恒永者竞选。": "At two hundred forty-five, the Heng Organization held the Eternal selection again.",
"他在考场展露锋芒：对敌人的准确评估、戏耍、控制、范围压制。": "He showed his edge in the trials: accurate reads of the enemy, toying, control, area suppression.",
"笔试当中他也崭露头角。综合第一。": "He stood out in the written test as well. First overall.",
"二百四十七岁，他成为第十任恒永者。": "At two hundred forty-seven he became the tenth Eternal.",
"组织给他的备注只有一行字：女粉多的离谱，到哪哪水泄不通。": "The Organization's note on him was one line: absurd numbers of female fans. Wherever he goes, the place is packed solid.",
"偶像圈": "The Idol Circle",
"他出生在恒组织的科技城区。出生那天，接生的人说了一句：这孩子长得太好了。": "He was born in the Heng Organization's tech district. The day he was born, the midwife said one thing: this child is too good-looking.",
"在这里，好看不是夸奖。好看是一份简历。": "Here, good-looking is not praise. Good-looking is a résumé.",
"四岁，父母把他送进了偶像圈。": "At four, his parents sent him into the idol circle.",
"五岁，他去演第三任恒永者纪录片里那个九岁的思源。": "At five, he played Siyuan at nine in the third Eternal's documentary.",
"剧组给了他一摞档案。他读了七遍。他学会的第一件事不是怎么演，是怎么站。": "The crew gave him a stack of files. He read them seven times. The first thing he learned was not how to act. It was how to stand.",
"六岁，他见到了第五十七任星辰宠儿——那一年，那个人是当代的超级明星。": "At six he met the fifty-seventh Child of the Stars — that year, that person was the superstar of the age.",
"他跪下去，说要拜师。那人问他：你会什么。他说：我会站在台上。": "He knelt and asked to be taken as a disciple. The man asked him: what can you do. He said: I can stand on a stage.",
"「那就先学会站着挨打。」": "\"Then learn to stand and take a beating first.\"",
"七岁到十八岁，少年榜第一没有换过人。": "From seven to eighteen, the top of the youth rankings never changed hands.",
"十九岁，妹妹将玉雪出生。她生下来，也好看至极。": "At nineteen his sister Jiang Yuxue was born. She came out beautiful beyond measure.",
"那天他把奖牌收进了抽屉。他要挡在她前面。": "That day he put his medals in a drawer. He would stand in front of her.",
"二十七岁，师傅带他去了一趟总部。五百万功勋，五万年寿。": "At twenty-seven his Master took him to headquarters once. Five million merit. Fifty thousand years of life.",
"「你以后要靠这张脸站很久。」": "\"You will have to stand on this face for a long time.\"",
"他点了头。他没说出口的是：他想靠的，其实是别的东西。": "He nodded. What he did not say: what he wanted to stand on was something else.",
"年轻时候演过九岁思源的那点东西，一直留在他身上，没有走。": "That bit of Siyuan at nine that he played when young stayed on him. It never left.",
"他后来说：演过一次，就得配得上演过。": "He said later: once you have played him, you have to be worth having played him.",
"把五万年全部押进练拳": "Put all fifty thousand years into training his fists",
"他每天先练拳，再练腿，最后才碰星辰之力。三样一起练，练了一百多年。": "Every day he trained his fists first, then his legs, and only then touched the power of the stars. He trained all three together for over a hundred years.",
"先去问妹妹：你想不想要": "Ask his sister first: do you want it",
"将玉雪那一年四岁。她想了很久，说：我想要哥哥一直在。他说：好。": "Jiang Yuxue was four that year. She thought a long time and said: I want my brother to always be here. He said: all right.",
"回片场，把那部纪录片再看一遍": "Go back to the set and watch that documentary once more",
"他一个人坐在空片场里，从头看到尾。九岁那个思源拖着比自己还大的东西走回战线尽头。他看了很多年，还是没看明白那个人当时在想什么。": "He sat alone in the empty set and watched it from start to finish. Siyuan at nine, dragging something larger than himself back to the end of the front. He watched it for years and still did not understand what that person was thinking then.",
"同一夜": "The Same Night",
"二十三岁。他长成了和师傅同级的超级明星。星辰认可的仪式开在科技城区的中央广场，人挤到最外面三层环线。仪式进行到一半，人群里有人掀开了衣服，喊着一个名字——他们说不该有两个人同时被看见。他一只手把将玉雪按到身后，另一只手抬了起来。": "Twenty-three. He had grown into a superstar at his Master's level. The rite of the stars' acknowledgement was held in the central square of the tech district, the crowd packed out to the third ring. Halfway through, someone in the crowd opened his coat and shouted a name — they said two people should not be seen at once. One hand pushed Jiang Yuxue behind him. The other rose.",
"星辰在同一天夜里认可了两个人。这是第一次。他把妹妹扛在肩上，绕着广场转了一整圈。后来有人问他那天打了多久，他说：不长。他没说的是，他打完的时候，天已经亮过一次了。": "That night the stars acknowledged two people. It was the first time. He put his sister on his shoulder and carried her a full circle around the square. Later someone asked how long he had fought that day. He said: not long. What he did not say: by the time he finished, the dawn had already come once.",
"他抱着妹妹退到了环线外面。第二天他重新站回广场中央，一个人，站到星辰愿意看他为止。": "He carried his sister back out past the ring. The next day he stood in the middle of the square again, alone, until the stars were willing to look at him.",
"独守西区": "Holding the West District Alone",
"一百八十六岁。有敌对的存在准备对整个恒组织科技区发射核弹头。第四任恒永者李耀辉赶到的时候，指挥台已经在报坐标。他跑了上去，说：西区交给我。李耀辉看了他两秒，同意了。撤离用了四十分钟。他一个人站在西区正中间，抬头，等着。": "One hundred eighty-six. A hostile existence prepared to fire a nuclear warhead at the whole Heng Organization tech district. When Li Yaohui, the fourth Eternal, arrived, the command deck was already calling out coordinates. He ran up and said: leave the West District to me. Li Yaohui looked at him for two seconds and agreed. The evacuation took forty minutes. He stood alone in the exact center of the West District, looked up, and waited.",
"他抗住了。星辰之力从他掌下铺开，盖住了整片天。冲击散尽以后，西区的楼一栋都没有塌。他还站在原来的位置上，对着镜头笑了一下。组织给了他奖赏。李耀辉只给了他两个字：「不错。」": "He held it. The power of the stars spread from under his palm and covered the whole sky. When the blast cleared, not one building in the West District had fallen. He was still standing where he had stood, and smiled once at the camera. The Organization gave him a reward. Li Yaohui gave him two words: \"Not bad.\"",
"九岁那场戏，重拍了三十次": "That Scene at Nine, Reshot Thirty Times",
"科技城区的片场，白天也亮着灯。": "On the set in the tech district, the lights were on even in daytime.",
"五岁那年他演第三任恒永者纪录片里九岁的思源。": "At five he played Siyuan at nine in the third Eternal's documentary.",
"最后一场，一个人拖着一样比自己身体还大的东西，走回战线尽头。": "The last scene: one person dragging something larger than his own body back to the end of the front.",
"第三十次。导演把监视器推近了一点。": "Take thirty. The director pulled the monitor in a little closer.",
"「不是这个走法。那个孩子当时不是在走路。」": "\"Not that walk. That child was not walking.\"",
"他把那摞档案带回去，读了七遍。": "He took the stack of files home and read them seven times.",
"第三十一次，过了。掌声响起来，鼓掌的人比他多得多。": "Take thirty-one. It passed. Applause rose. The people clapping outnumbered him many times over.",
"他在原地站了很久，等场务来收灯。": "He stood in place a long time, waiting for the crew to take down the lights.",
"剧组后来把那一条留了底。": "The crew kept that take on file.",
"底片上那个孩子一直走到尽头，没有回头。": "On the negative, that child walked to the end and did not look back.",
"回片场，把那一幕从头到尾看一遍": "Go back to the set and watch that scene from start to finish",
"放映室只有他一个人。他看完了，没有倒回去重看，也没有开灯。": "He was alone in the screening room. He watched it through. He did not rewind, and he did not turn on the light.",
"去问那个演过旁边角色的老人": "Ask the old man who played the role beside him",
"老人讲了很久，不是讲角色，是讲当年在哪一站等过补给。他没有记笔记。": "The old man talked a long time. Not about the role — about which station he had waited at for supplies back then. He took no notes.",
"开始练恒之拳法": "Begin training the Heng Fist Arts",
"经纪人替他推了三天的行程。他说：拳先练，行程您按原来排。": "His manager cleared three days of his schedule. He said: the fists come first. Keep the schedule as it was.",
"那间屋子，186岁以后": "That Room, After 186",
"他在总部的屋子很小，一张床，一张桌子，窗户朝着西区。": "His room at headquarters was small. One bed, one table, a window facing the West District.",
"186岁那年他站在那里接一样东西，接住了，西区的楼一栋都没有塌。": "At one hundred eighty-six he stood there and caught something. He caught it. Not one building in the West District fell.",
"组织奖赏了他。手续走了三个月。屋子还是那间屋子。": "The Organization rewarded him. The paperwork took three months. The room stayed the same room.",
"后勤的人来问过两次要不要换。他说不用。": "Logistics came twice to ask whether he wanted to move. He said no need.",
"墙上贴着一张旧海报，是他五六岁那年的纪录片。": "An old poster hung on the wall, from the documentary he made at five or six.",
"海报上的字都看不清了，他没有换，也没有揭。": "The words on the poster were no longer readable. He did not replace it, and did not take it down.",
"将玉雪隔几天来一次，带一盒点心，坐在床边把点心吃完。": "Jiang Yuxue came every few days, brought a box of pastries, sat on the edge of the bed and ate them all.",
"那间屋子到后来一直空着。": "That room stayed empty afterward.",
"新来的人问那是谁的。后勤翻了一下本子：以前第十任住过。": "New arrivals asked whose it was. Logistics flipped through a ledger: the tenth used to live here.",
"把窗户换成朝东的": "Have the window changed to face east",
"换完他才想起来，换方向以后，早上西区上班的人走的那条路就看不见了。": "Only after it was done did he remember: with the window facing east, he could no longer see the road the West District workers took in the morning.",
"留一副空碗筷在桌上": "Leave an empty bowl and chopsticks on the table",
"后勤的人以为是谁落了东西，收走了两次。第三次，桌上那张纸条上写着：别收。": "Logistics thought someone had left them behind and cleared them away twice. The third time, a note on the table read: do not clear these.",
"申请调到西区常驻": "Apply for a permanent posting in the West District",
"批得很慢。批下来那天他把行李收了半天，最后只带走了一个箱子。": "The approval was slow. The day it came, he packed for half a day and in the end took one case.",
"他生来好看，4岁被送进偶像圈，6岁拜第57任星辰宠儿为师，7到18岁霸占少年榜第一。23岁成长为与师傅同级的超级明星，也得到星辰认可——同一年，他妹妹将玉雪也得到了认可，这是星辰第一次认可两个人。186岁，敌人要向恒组织科技区发射核弹头，李耀辉赶到，他向李耀辉申请独自抗住西区。他抗住了。245岁竞选，综合第一，247岁成为第十任。": "He was born good-looking. At four he was sent into the idol circle. At six he took the fifty-seventh Child of the Stars as his Master. From seven to eighteen he held the top of the youth rankings. At twenty-three he grew into a superstar at his Master's level, and the stars acknowledged him — the same year his sister Jiang Yuxue was acknowledged too, the first time the stars acknowledged two people. At one hundred eighty-six the enemy moved to fire a nuclear warhead at the Heng Organization tech district. Li Yaohui arrived, and he applied to hold the West District alone. He held it. At two hundred forty-five he entered the selection and took first overall. At two hundred forty-seven he became the tenth.",
"247岁受位 · 生于科技城区": "Took the seat at 247 · born in the tech district",
"5岁那年，他在纪录片里演过9岁的思源。": "At five he played Siyuan at nine in a documentary.",
"万般星辰的力量。186岁独自抗住敌方向科技区发射的核弹头。": "The power of all the stars. At one hundred eighty-six he held alone the nuclear warhead the enemy fired at the tech district.",
"247 岁：245 岁竞选综合第一，247 岁就任": "Age 247: first overall in the 245 selection. Took office at 247.",
"降神·将漠然": "Descent · Jiang Moran",
"星辰落下来的时候，他还对着镜头笑了一下。": "As the stars came down, he still smiled once at the camera.",
"第四任的地界在结霜。带六块冰晶碎屑回来，我要确认那是不是真的永冻。": "The fourth's territory is frosting over. Bring back six shards of ice crystal. I want to confirm whether that is true permafrost.",
"真名陈梓恩。一颗星球上只剩他一个活人，和脖子上妹妹送的表盘。\n赐他新名的人是思源。复仇过后，他跪在圣堂下，从此只剩下一个身份：思源家族庄园的管家。": "His real name was Chen Zi'en. On that planet only one person was left alive, and the dial his sister had given him, on his neck.\nThe one who gave him a new name was Siyuan. After the revenge, he knelt beneath the sanctuary, and from then on he had only one identity: steward of the Siyuan family estate.",
"「卡塔……卡塔……」": "\"Kata... Kata...\"",
"表盘": "The Dial",
"卡塔……卡塔……": "Kata... Kata...",
"他在各个世界流浪，一边走，一边听那个声音。": "He wandered through world after world, walking, listening to that sound.",
"那颗星球上最后活着的东西，只有他和他脖子上的表盘。": "The last living things on that planet were him and the dial on his neck.",
"有人把他拦了下来。那个人问他：": "Someone stopped him. That person asked:",
"「你叫什么？」": "\"What is your name?\"",
"他说不出话。他已经很久没有说过自己的名字了。": "He could not speak. He had not spoken his own name in a long time.",
"「那就叫茫吧。跟我走。」": "\"Then you will be called Mang. Come with me.\"",
"跟着他，问的第一件事是怎么报仇": "Follow him, and ask first how to take revenge",
"思源没有回答。他只是带着他往一个方向走，走了三千年。": "Siyuan did not answer. He only led him in one direction, and walked for three thousand years.",
"先问：为什么要给我起名字": "Ask first: why give me a name",
"「因为没名字的人，走不出很远。」思源说，「你会走得很远。」": "\"Because a man without a name cannot walk far,\" Siyuan said. \"You will walk far.\"",
"把表盘摘下来，收进怀里": "Take the dial off, tuck it into his coat",
"他摘下来了，但又戴了回去。他发现自己做不到不听见那个声音。": "He took it off, then put it back on. He found he could not stop hearing that sound.",
"三千年": "Three Thousand Years",
"他跟着思源流浪，见了三千年的事。他学会了时光与空间的掌控。": "He wandered with Siyuan and saw three thousand years of things. He learned to command time and space.",
"他终于为自己选了一身衣裳——中世纪庄园管家的衣裳。思源从来没有命令过他。": "At last he chose clothes for himself — the clothes of a medieval estate steward. Siyuan had never given him an order.",
"卡塔": "Kata",
"他想报仇。报仇。报仇。": "He wanted revenge. Revenge. Revenge.",
"表盘好似赋予了他新的使命。黑色的皮手套。": "The dial seemed to give him a new purpose. Black leather gloves.",
"卡塔……卡塔……响满整个庄园。": "Kata... Kata... ringing through the whole estate.",
"卡塔……卡塔……复仇的歌唱。": "Kata... Kata... the song of revenge.",
"满地尸骸。无人幸免。": "Corpses everywhere. No one was spared.",
"卡塔……": "Kata...",
"让表盘继续走下去": "Let the dial keep running",
"他没有停下来。复仇过后，他已经五千多岁。": "He did not stop. By the end of the revenge, he was over five thousand years old.",
"在最后一个人面前停手": "Stop before the last man",
"他停手了。那个人跪在地上，和他当年一样。他转过身，把刀收了回去。": "He stopped. The man knelt on the ground, the same as he once had. He turned around and put the blade away.",
"把妹妹的表盘按在胸口，等它停": "Press his sister's dial to his chest and wait for it to stop",
"他站在满地尸骸里，按着胸口，等那个声音停下。它没有停。": "He stood among the corpses, pressing his chest, waiting for the sound to stop. It did not stop.",
"圣堂下的跪": "Kneeling Beneath the Sanctuary",
"从任务回到组织以后，他彻底对生失去了动力，跪在圣堂下。他不再是一名复仇者，也不再是一名流浪者。": "After returning from the mission to the Organization, he lost all drive to live and knelt beneath the sanctuary. He was no longer an avenger, and no longer a wanderer.",
"他把最后那个追着他来的东西留在了圣堂门外。他跪着，没有回头看。": "He left the last thing that had chased him outside the sanctuary door. He knelt there, and did not look back.",
"后院": "The Back Courtyard",
"在那之后，思源每天都会在后院教他拳法，辅助他学会对时间和空间的掌控。": "After that, Siyuan taught him boxing in the back courtyard every day, helping him learn to command time and space.",
"他慢慢变强了。他数了数，自己已经五千六百多岁。": "He grew stronger, little by little. He counted it up: he was already over five thousand six hundred years old.",
"第十一任": "The Eleventh",
"当代恒组织并没有合适的人选来担任恒永者一职。": "The Heng Organization of that era had no suitable candidate for the post of Eternal.",
"于是他们选了一个老实本分的管家。": "So they chose an honest, dutiful steward.",
"因为仅仅只是一名管家的原因，他的实力垫底。": "Because he was only a steward, his strength ranked at the bottom.",
"但他会不断变强，成为一名真正彻头彻尾的恒永者。": "But he would keep growing stronger, and become an Eternal through and through.",
"——他将担任人员管理型恒永者。": "—He would serve as a Personnel-Manager type Eternal.",
"他把庄园的钥匙挂在腰上。他抬头看了一眼会台。": "He hung the estate keys at his waist. He raised his eyes to the stage once.",
"梓恩": "Zi'en",
"他本名陈梓恩。": "His real name was Chen Zi'en.",
"一场变故把他家里的人、他的家乡、他的星球，一起拿走了。": "A single upheaval took his family, his home, and his planet, all at once.",
"等他从废墟里爬起来，那颗星球上活着的东西只剩两样：他，和他脖子上妹妹送的那个表盘。": "When he rose from the ruins, only two living things were left on that planet: him, and the dial his sister had given him, on his neck.",
"他开始流浪。走过很多世界，没有在一个地方停过。他已经很久没有听人叫过他的名字了。": "He began to wander. He crossed many worlds and never stopped in one. No one had called him by name in a long time.",
"有一天，路上有人把他拦了下来。": "One day, someone on the road stopped him.",
"他说不出话。": "He could not speak.",
"拦他的人，是第三任恒永者思源。这件事，他很多年以后才知道。": "The one who stopped him was Siyuan, the third Eternal. He did not learn this until many years later.",
"他跟着思源走了三千年。三千年里，思源没有命令过他一次。": "He followed Siyuan for three thousand years. In three thousand years, Siyuan never gave him a single order.",
"三千年后，他自己挑了一身衣裳——中世纪庄园管家的衣裳。": "Three thousand years later, he chose clothes for himself — the clothes of a medieval estate steward.",
"他成了思源身边唯一的仆人。是他自己选的。": "He became the only servant at Siyuan's side. He chose it himself.",
"问：茫是什么意思": "Ask: what does Mang mean",
"思源说：「走得很远、又不知道要去哪里的人。」他说：那我不要。思源说：「行。那先跟着我，跟到你想要为止。」": "Siyuan said: \"One who walks far and does not know where he is going.\" He said: then I do not want it. Siyuan said: \"Fine. Follow me first, then. Follow me until you want something.\"",
"把表盘摘下来，递过去给他看": "Take the dial off and hold it out for him to see",
"思源看了一眼那个表盘，没有接。他说：「留着。以后你会知道它为什么还在走。」": "Siyuan glanced at the dial and did not take it. He said: \"Keep it. One day you will know why it is still running.\"",
"先不问，跟他走一段再说": "Ask nothing yet, walk with him a while first",
"他跟着走了三天才开口问第一句话。思源等了他三天。": "He walked with him three days before he spoke his first question. Siyuan had waited three days.",
"满地尸骸": "Corpses Everywhere",
"回到组织以后，他成了思源家族的管家。庄园的钟每走一格，他脖子上的表盘就应一声。他想起自己本来是要做什么的。黑色皮手套戴上去的时候，他先听见的还是那个声音。卡塔……卡塔……": "After returning to the Organization, he became the steward of the Siyuan family. Each tick of the estate clock was answered by the dial on his neck. He remembered what he had set out to do. When he put on the black leather gloves, the first thing he heard was still that sound. Kata... Kata...",
"复仇的歌，一首一首唱完了。满地尸骸，无人幸免。他没有留下一个活口，也没有多看任何一具。后来他把手套脱下来，叠好，放进口袋。等他从最后一个任务里回到组织，他已经五千多岁。": "The songs of revenge were sung, one by one, to the end. Corpses everywhere. No one was spared. He left no one alive, and did not look twice at any of the bodies. Later he took the gloves off, folded them, and put them in his pocket. When he returned to the Organization from the last mission, he was already over five thousand years old.",
"跪在圣堂下": "Kneeling Beneath the Sanctuary",
"他彻底对生失去了动力。他走进圣堂，跪下，不动了。他说不清自己在等什么，也没有站起来的意思。圣堂的门没有关。有东西从外面追着他来——那是他一路杀过来、留在地上的影子。": "He lost all drive to live. He walked into the sanctuary, knelt, and did not move. He could not say what he was waiting for, and he had no intention of standing up. The sanctuary door was not closed. Something chased him from outside — the shadow he had left on the ground all the way as he killed.",
"他把那个东西留在了圣堂门外。他没有回头看。从那一刻起，他不再是一名复仇者，也不再是一名流浪者。他只剩下一个身份：思源家族庄园的管家。或者说是，思源家族的新成员。": "He left that thing outside the sanctuary door. He did not look back. From that moment, he was no longer an avenger, and no longer a wanderer. He had only one identity left: the steward of the Siyuan family estate. Or rather, a new member of the Siyuan family.",
"影子在祭坛前站了一会儿，自己散了。它认出了这个跪着的人。": "The shadow stood before the altar for a while, then scattered on its own. It had recognized the kneeling man.",
"清点人数": "Counting Heads",
"庄园的规矩是每天傍晚点一次人。": "The estate's rule was to count heads once every evening.",
"他管的人一共八十六个。他点了七遍。": "Eighty-six people were under him. He counted seven times.",
"第一遍八十五，第二遍八十六，第三遍八十四。": "The first time, eighty-five. The second, eighty-six. The third, eighty-four.",
"第八遍开始，走廊里有人在笑，笑到咳嗽。": "From the eighth count on, someone in the corridor was laughing, laughing until he coughed.",
"「先生，擦窗的那个刚才去后面泼水了。」": "\"Sir, the one who cleans the windows just went out back to dump water.\"",
"他重新点了一遍。八十六。": "He counted again. Eighty-six.",
"他把名册合上，又把八十六这一行描了一遍。": "He closed the roster, then traced the line for eighty-six once more.",
"「明天照旧。」": "\"Same as usual tomorrow.\"",
"他数完之后把表盘按了一下。表盘没有停，还是那个声音。": "When he finished counting, he pressed the dial. The dial did not stop. It was the same sound.",
"把每个人的名字和位置抄成一张表": "Copy every name and post onto a single sheet",
"那张表后来贴在门厅。有人偷偷在上面画了一个人形，标着自己站的地方。": "The sheet was later posted in the entrance hall. Someone quietly drew a figure on it, marking where he stood.",
"以后改成让厨房的人替他数": "From then on, let the kitchen count for him",
"厨房的人数了两次就数错。他又自己拿回来了。": "The kitchen staff got it wrong on the second count. He took it back himself.",
"在名册最后一页记下今天的事": "Write today's business on the last page of the roster",
"他写：少了两个，去泼水。他划掉「少了两个」，改成「都在」。": "He wrote: two missing, went to dump water. He crossed out \"two missing\" and wrote \"all present\".",
"后院的拳架": "The Stance in the Back Courtyard",
"后院的地砖有三块是松的。他自己记住了是哪三块。": "Three of the paving stones in the back courtyard were loose. He remembered which three on his own.",
"思源教拳，从桩开始。他说桩站不稳，后面的都是空的。": "Siyuan taught boxing, starting from the stance. He said if the stance is not steady, everything after it is empty.",
"一个桩，教了十一天。": "One stance, taught for eleven days.",
"第十二天，思源不说话了，蹲在旁边看。": "On the twelfth day, Siyuan stopped speaking and crouched to the side, watching.",
"庄园的其他人都来看。管家练拳，后院的猫也跟着看。": "The rest of the estate came to watch. The steward practiced boxing; the cat in the back courtyard watched too.",
"「久了以后，时间会自己找你。」": "\"After long enough, time will come looking for you.\"",
"他没有问要多久。他知道这个问题在这里没有答案。": "He did not ask how long. He knew that question had no answer here.",
"收工的时候他把三块松的地砖重新压平了。": "When the work was done, he pressed the three loose paving stones flat again.",
"又过了一些年，他成了第十一任恒永者。": "Some years passed, and he became the eleventh Eternal.",
"会台上他的位置在最边上。回庄园以后，他还是先去了后院。": "His place on the stage was at the very edge. After returning to the estate, he still went to the back courtyard first.",
"每天加练一个时辰": "Add one extra hour of practice each day",
"加练到第九天，思源站在廊下看了一会儿，一句话没说就走了。": "On the ninth day of extra practice, Siyuan stood under the corridor and watched for a while, then left without a word.",
"把每次站桩的时间记下来": "Write down the time of each stance session",
"本子上的数字越来越大，他后来不写了。他说：写这个没用，记住就行。": "The numbers in the notebook grew larger; he stopped writing them later. He said: writing this is useless, just remember it.",
"问思源：您当年也站过这个吗": "Ask Siyuan: did you stand this too, back then",
"「站过。」思源说，「我站的时候，没人来看。」": "\"I did,\" Siyuan said. \"When I stood, no one came to watch.\"",
"一颗星球上只剩他一个活人，和脖子上妹妹送的表盘。他在各个世界流浪，听了一路卡塔卡塔的声响。赐他新名的人是思源；他跟着思源学了三千年，最后为自己选了一身管家的衣裳。复仇过后，他跪在圣堂下，从此只剩下「思源家族管家」这一个身份。当代没有合适的人选，组织选了这个老实本分的管家当第十一任恒永者——实力垫底，但他会不断变强。": "On one planet only he was left alive, and the dial his sister had given him, on his neck. He wandered through world after world, hearing Kata, Kata all the way. The one who gave him a new name was Siyuan; he studied under Siyuan for three thousand years, and in the end chose the clothes of a steward for himself. After the revenge, he knelt beneath the sanctuary, and from then on he had only one identity left: steward of the Siyuan family. That era had no suitable candidate, so the Organization chose this honest, dutiful steward as the eleventh Eternal — last in strength, but he would keep growing stronger.",
"真名陈梓恩 · 5637岁": "Real name Chen Zi'en · 5,637 years old",
"他的名字是思源给的。他脖子上是妹妹送的表盘。": "Siyuan gave him his name. The dial on his neck came from his sister.",
"跟随思源流浪三千年，学时光与空间；复仇之后，跪在圣堂下。": "Wandered with Siyuan for three thousand years, learned time and space; after the revenge, knelt beneath the sanctuary.",
"5637 岁：组织没有合适人选，选任了老实本分的茫": "Age 5,637: the Organization had no suitable candidate and appointed the honest, dutiful Mang",
"降神·茫": "Descent · Mang",
"表盘响了一下。那一秒里，时间归他管。": "The dial sounded once. In that second, time was his to command.",
"走完第五传。虚无之主的那一段，档案里是空的——把它填上。": "Finish the Fifth Tale. The section on the Void Lord is blank in the archive — fill it in.",
"十一任恒永者过去了。组织档案馆的最后一格是空的——那一格上面写着「第十二任」。\n有人从组织的边缘走了进来。它没有名字，也没有脸。它复述所有人的名字。": "Eleven Eternals have passed. The last slot in the Organization's archive is empty—that slot bears the words: the Twelfth.\nSomeone walked in from the edge of the Organization. It has no name and no face. It repeats everyone's names.",
"「无相不生，无相不死。」": "\"No form is born; no form dies.\"",
"空着的那一格": "The Empty Slot",
"十一任都记在了册子上。你翻到最后一页，发现后面还有一格。": "All eleven are entered in the ledger. You turn to the last page and find one more slot after it.",
"那一格上写着三个字：第十二任。": "That slot bears three words: the Twelfth.",
"下面没有名字，没有生卒，没有师徒。": "Underneath there is no name, no birth or death, no master or disciple.",
"只有你这一路走过来留下的东西：一副刻满名字的剑鞘，一条挂着身份牌的项链，一个走得不准的表盘。": "Only what you left behind along the way: a scabbard carved full of names, a necklace hung with an identity tag, a dial that never kept time.",
"而在组织的边缘，有东西正走进来。": "And at the edge of the Organization, something is walking in.",
"把剑鞘内侧的名字一个个再念一遍": "Read the names on the inside of the scabbard again, one by one",
"你念完了。然后你把剑收回鞘里——这副鞘，你已经不用再换了。": "You finish reading. Then you put the sword back in the scabbard—this scabbard, you no longer need to change it.",
"去孤儿院门口坐一会儿": "Sit for a while at the orphanage gate",
"院里的孩子还不敢靠近你。你拍了拍身边的地：「坐这儿。」": "The children in the yard still do not dare come near you. You pat the ground beside you. \"Sit here.\"",
"站到会台上去": "Stand up on the stage",
"你第一次站在会台上，而不是看着会台。台下没有人，但你听见了掌声。": "For the first time you stand on the stage, instead of looking at it. Below the stage there is no one, but you hear applause.",
"无相": "Wuxiang",
"它张开嘴，吐出的第一个词是你自己的名字。": "It opens its mouth. The first word it spits out is your own name.",
"它的脸开始融化。融出来的，是你在前十一传里见过的每一张脸。": "Its face begins to melt. What melts out is every face you saw in the first eleven chapters.",
"镜我": "Mirror-Self",
"它长出了你的脸。它用的也是恒之剑法——是你学的那些，一招不差。": "It grows your face. It also uses Heng Sword Arts—the same ones you learned, not one move missing.",
"你把它砍下去的时候，它也笑了一下。那个笑，你认得。": "When you cut it down, it smiled as well. That smile, you recognize.",
"第十二任": "The Twelfth",
"无相散了。组织档案馆里那一格终于有了内容。": "Wuxiang scattered. The slot in the Organization's archive finally has something in it.",
"来登记的人问你职务名。你想了想。": "The registrar asks you for the name of the post. You think for a moment.",
"第一任写的是「创始者」。第三任写的是「首席」。第十一任写的是「管家」。": "The First wrote \"Founder.\" The Third wrote \"Chief.\" The Eleventh wrote \"Steward.\"",
"你把笔接过来，写了两个字。": "You take the pen and write two characters.",
"然后你放下笔，走出档案馆。": "Then you put down the pen and walk out of the archive.",
"外面是组织的走廊。有新的成员正在走廊尽头，被那道威压压得站不稳。": "Outside is the Organization's corridor. At the far end, a new member is being pressed by that pressure, unable to stand steady.",
"你走了过去，和那个人并肩站好。": "You walk over and stand shoulder to shoulder with that person.",
"——你想起一句话。你终于知道那句话是谁说的了。": "—You remember a sentence. You finally know who said it.",
"第十二任的那一格": "The Twelfth's Slot",
"十一任都记在了册子上。你翻到最后一页，发现后面还有一格。那一格上写着三个字：第十二任。下面没有名字，没有生卒，没有师徒。会台上，十一任恒永者以已就任的身份，一个一个到齐。第一任站在最左边。第十任将漠然站得很正，手里什么也没拿。第十一任茫站在最右边，腰上挂着庄园的钥匙。第三任恒永者走到你面前，把剑横在你身前。": "All eleven are entered in the ledger. You turn to the last page and find one more slot after it. That slot bears three words: the Twelfth. Underneath there is no name, no birth or death, no master or disciple. On the stage, the eleven Eternals arrive one by one, each in the post he held. The First stands at the far left. The Tenth, Jiang Moran, stands very straight, holding nothing. The Eleventh, Mang, stands at the far right, the keys to the estate hanging at his waist. The Third Eternal walks up to you and holds his sword across in front of you.",
"你接住了。他只出了一剑，收势比出势还快。收剑的时候他说：「空了这么多年的一格，终于有人来站了。」你没有回头。你也知道，那十一个人都还在原位站着。": "You caught it. He made only one strike; his recovery was faster than the strike. Sheathing the sword, he said, \"A slot empty for so many years—at last someone has come to stand in it.\" You did not turn around. You also knew that those eleven were still standing in their places.",
"剑停在离你半寸的地方。他说：「还没到。先回去把前面十一传再看一遍。」": "The sword stops half an inch from you. He says, \"Not yet. Go back and read the first eleven chapters again.\"",
"旧账": "Old Debts",
"[X]战队和[恒]组织之间有一笔旧账，一直没有人去收。当年有一个人从这里走了出去，名字从册子上划掉，档案锁进最下面一层。现在他挂着[X]的牌子回来了，站在科技城区外面，说要跟新上任的第十二任谈一谈。档案馆只给了你两句话：名字已经划了。那一格已经有人了。": "There is an old debt between Squad [X] and the [Heng] Organization, and no one has ever gone to collect it. Years ago a man walked out from here; his name was struck from the ledger, and his file was locked on the lowest level. Now he has come back wearing a [X] tag, standing outside the tech district, saying he wants to talk with the newly installed Twelfth. The archive gave you only two sentences: the name is already struck. That slot already has someone in it.",
"他谈到最后，把手里的牌子摘下来，扔在地上，说：「把名字加回去。」你说：加不加得回去，是册子的事。那一格，已经有人站了。他愣了很久，笑了一下。他被带走的时候，档案上那一行还是划掉的——只是下面多了一行小字：此人归来过。": "At the end of the talk he took off the tag he was wearing, threw it on the ground, and said, \"Put the name back.\" You said: whether it goes back is the ledger's business. That slot already has someone standing in it. He was stunned for a long time, then smiled once. When he was taken away, that line in the file was still struck through—only below it was one small line added: this person returned once.",
"复述完之后": "After the Retelling",
"它张开嘴，把吃过的东西一个一个吐了出来。十一个影子落在会台上，一个不多，一个不少——从第一任到第十一任，全部到齐。它们还戴着恒永者的名字，用的也是恒永者的招式。它们朝你走过来的时候，会台上真正的十一个人，谁都没有动。第三任只说了一句：「它们是我们当年输掉的那一部分。这一部分，你替我们拿回来。」": "It opens its mouth and spits out, one by one, the things it has eaten. Eleven shadows fall on the stage, no more and no less—from the First to the Eleventh, all present. They still wear the names of Eternals, and the moves they use are an Eternal's. As they walk toward you, the eleven real ones on the stage do not move, none of them. The Third says only one thing: \"They are the part we lost back then. That part—you take it back for us.\"",
"你一个一个把它们打了回去。它们倒下的时候，脸上溶出来的，是你在前十一传里见过的每一张脸。最后只剩下一个，它没有还手，只是把你的名字念了一遍。你砍下去，然后转过身。会台上站着十一个人，一个都没有少。第一任走过去，把插在地上的那把刀拔了出来——那是组织成立那天插下去的刀。他把刀递给你，说了两个字：「收好。」": "You beat them back one by one. When they fall, what dissolves out of their faces is every face you saw in the first eleven chapters. In the end only one is left; it does not strike back, only recites your name once. You cut it down, then turn around. Eleven people stand on the stage, not one missing. The First walks over and pulls the blade out of the ground—the blade driven in on the day the Organization was founded. He hands it to you and says two words: \"Keep it safe.\"",
"影子退回了它嘴里。台上的十一个人依旧没有动。第三任说：「还没到。再来。」": "The shadows retreat back into its mouth. The eleven on the stage still do not move. The Third says, \"Not yet. Again.\"",
"会台散场以后": "After the Stage Empties",
"会台的样子，以前是从台下看的，现在是收场的时候看。": "The look of the stage—before, you saw it from below the stage; now you see it at closing time.",
"凳子要一张一张摆回原位。摆回原位以后，还得擦一遍。": "The stools have to be put back in place one by one. After they are back in place, they still have to be wiped down.",
"地上有脚印。脚印从台下一直通到最中间那个位置。": "There are footprints on the floor. The footprints run from below the stage all the way to the place at the very center.",
"有人来问要不要封起来留个纪念。管事的人说不封，明天有人用。": "Someone comes to ask whether it should be sealed off as a memorial. The man in charge says no, someone will use it tomorrow.",
"有一件外套搭在第二排的椅背上，没有人来拿。": "A coat is draped over the back of a chair in the second row. No one comes to take it.",
"台上的灯一盏一盏关掉，关到剩最后两盏。": "The lights on the stage are turned off one by one, until two are left.",
"他在最中间那个位置上站了一会儿，把外套叠好放在台边。": "He stands for a while in the place at the very center, folds the coat, and puts it at the edge of the stage.",
"会台平时就是这样，散场以后空着，等人来用。": "The stage is always like this: empty after everyone leaves, waiting for someone to use it.",
"门口的灯留了一盏。": "One light at the door is left on.",
"把外套交到失物处登记": "Hand the coat in at lost and found and register it",
"登记本上写着：外套一件，无人认领。第二天外套不见了，登记的日期还在。": "The register reads: one coat, unclaimed. The next day the coat is gone; the date of the entry is still there.",
"把凳子又重摆一遍，按横线对齐": "Line the stools up again, aligned to the marked lines",
"摆到最后他自己笑了一下，说明天反正也要乱。": "By the last one he smiled to himself and said it would be a mess again tomorrow anyway.",
"坐在台下最后一个位置上看一会儿": "Sit in the last seat below the stage and watch for a while",
"台下很空。他坐了很久，没有上去。": "Below the stage is very empty. He sits for a long time and does not go up.",
"下一个要来的人": "The Next One to Come",
"档案馆每月初清一次空档。": "The archive clears out the empty slots at the start of every month.",
"第十二任那一格现在有东西了。旁边那一格的表已经放好，空着，等名字。": "The Twelfth's slot now has something in it. The form in the slot beside it is laid out already, empty, waiting for a name.",
"表格是通用的，每个新来的都得填一遍。出生那一栏常常没人知道。": "The form is standard; every newcomer has to fill it out once. The birth column is often unknown to anyone.",
"孤儿院那边新收的孩子，手环上的编号是院里自己编的，不是名字。": "For the children newly taken in at the orphanage, the number on the wristband is made up by the home itself, not a name.",
"带人的时候要问名字。问不出来就先编一个，编了之后要记得改回来。": "When you bring someone in, ask for the name. If no name comes out, make one up first; after you make one up, remember to change it back.",
"这些是他写在交接纸上的三条，用的是很平的字。": "These are three lines he wrote on the handover paper, in very plain handwriting.",
"原话抄在纸的最下面：「遇孤儿必带回。——令，无例外。」": "The original words are copied at the very bottom of the paper: \"Any orphan encountered must be brought back.—Order. No exceptions.\"",
"他写完把纸压在尺子底下，去走廊尽头看了一眼那盏灯。": "After writing it he pressed the paper under a ruler and went to the end of the corridor to look at that light.",
"走廊的灯不用关，会有人开。": "The corridor light does not need to be turned off. Someone will turn it on.",
"这一格是空的。空着就是还留了一个位置。": "This slot is empty. Empty means a place is still being kept.",
"把那张纸复印一份，放在前台": "Copy that paper and leave it at the front desk",
"前台换过三拨人，纸一直在。后来谁都不记得是谁放的了。": "The front desk has changed hands three times; the paper stayed. In the end no one remembered who put it there.",
"院里的孩子还不敢靠近。他拍了拍身边的地，什么都没说。": "The children in the yard still do not dare come close. He pats the ground beside him and says nothing.",
"把空表格多印十份": "Print ten more blank forms",
"十份里三份的出生年月栏填不上。他把那三份单独放进了抽屉。": "Three of the ten have a birth date column that cannot be filled in. He puts those three separately in a drawer.",
"星辰宠儿的战场会留下星尘。收五份，别用手直接碰。": "The battlefield of a Star Darling leaves stardust behind. Collect five portions. Do not touch them with bare hands."
};
DATA.langNames = { zh:"中文", en:"English" };

